l":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/41ea53cd710fb93ae8fae2601ce7925a59637487/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:45:40Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T20:45:40Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"release: v11.2.0 — per-aspect volume, the monoculture guard, and Dependabot for security only\n\nA minor rather than a major: one user-visible feature and two pieces of\nhousekeeping, which is what the bump is meant to track.\n\n- the dashboard counts logged sets per climbing aspect (#151)\n- issue #89 closes as a non-defect, and ruling 55 pins what PR #120 actually\n  won: no single exercise may take more than 17% of a plan''s blocks or 23% of\n  its minutes (#152)\n- `@tanstack/react-router` is pinned exactly at 1.170.33, the last version\n  where the federated mount still navigates in place, and the error boundary\n  now handles a non-`Error` throw instead of crashing on it (#153)\n- Dependabot no longer opens scheduled version-update PRs; alerts and security\n  updates are a repo setting and are unaffected. This is the promotion that\n  makes that live, since the config is read from `main` (#154)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d3d402700c7aadb09dc0f9afa0a3e7fb6250364e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/git/trees/d3d402700c7aadb09dc0f9afa0a3e7fb6250364e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/git/commits/41ea53cd710fb93ae8fae2601ce7925a59637487","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","foll