NzZhNGExMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commit/65b96efc86e1f27f391c7378b7f616fee2d219be","sha":"65b96efc86e1f27f391c7378b7f616fee2d219be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/65b96efc86e1f27f391c7378b7f616fee2d219be"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commit/8c2d67489d27c3b85f0fe3a4c3bfd33d615cb768","sha":"8c2d67489d27c3b85f0fe3a4c3bfd33d615cb768","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/8c2d67489d27c3b85f0fe3a4c3bfd33d615cb768"}],"sha":"3e8c951309e350fe1beb239f21fce26a76a4a100","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/3e8c951309e350fe1beb239f21fce26a76a4a100"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/8c2d67489d27c3b85f0fe3a4c3bfd33d615cb768/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T19:59:30Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T19:59:30Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"chore(test): guard a plan against a single-exercise monoculture, and close #89\n\nIssue #89 tracked \"~36 exercises carry ~80% of every plan\" as a library\nconcentration defect. Measured over 144 plans, that metric is not one: no\nexercise exceeds 15% of a plan''s blocks or 14% of its minutes, 80% of the\nblocks sit on 55% of the rows a plan uses where an even spread reads 80%, and\nthe head count is mostly set by the eligible pool — 94 rows with full gear\nagainst 38 on a bare bouldering wall — so it moves on a purchase rather than\non a defect. Ruling 47 had already priced the one route to moving it.\n\nClosed as a non-defect by ruling 55, which keeps the part that IS owed: PR\n#120 fixed a real monoculture at its cause and nothing pinned the result, so a\nlibrary or ranking edit could have walked it back silently.\n\nThe guard asserts a per-plan ceiling on the single largest exercise over the\nexisting twelve-row sweep at six session counts and three weaknesses, 216\nplans: 17% of a plan''s blocks and 23% of its seconds. Both halves, because\n#120 stated its result in minutes while #89''s metric was blocks, and a ceiling\non one leaves the other free to regress. `OPEN_CLIMBING_KEYS` is out of both\nnumerator and denominator — those blocks arrive as ruling 27''s length fill by\nruling 29''s decision, so counting them would measure a ruling, not a defect.\n\nShown to fail, not assumed to: narrowing `prescribable()` to one row per cell\n— the generalised pre-#120 condition — puts `limit_boulders` at 17.50% of\nblocks and 30.78% of minutes, over both ceilings, on all twelve rows. Freezing\nthe rotation instead stays green, which is the useful negative: pool narrowness\nmakes a monoculture, rotation order does not. The worst case in both eras is\nthe narrow-equipment column, so a full-vocabulary-only sweep would have been\ngreen for the wrong reason.\n\nTests only — no product code changes, and no new sweep, plan builder or minutes\nhelper: both arms read `generate()` output through the file''s own `_input` and\n`_block_seconds`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d812ead36966bfa3fe8fe0802abe7fe2076440b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/git/trees/d812ead36966bfa3fe8fe0802abe7fe2076440b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/git/commits/8c2d67489d27c3b85f0fe3a4c3bfd33d615cb768","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commit/8c2d67489d27c3b85f0fe3a4c3bfd33d615cb768","node_id":"C_kwDOT2NbNNoAKDhjMmQ2NzQ4OWQyN2MzYjg1ZjBmZTNhNGMzYmZkMzNkNjE1Y2I3Njg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commit/65b96efc86e1f27f391c7378b7f616fee2d219be","sha":"65b96efc86e1f27f391c7378b7f616fee2d219be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/65b96efc86e1f27f391c7378b7f616fee2d219be"}],"sha":"8c2d6748