ps://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commit/dcc2597bca0b3170b6bd2eba27d542f23534517c","node_id":"C_kwDOT2NbNNoAKGRjYzI1OTdiY2EwYjMxNzBiNmJkMmViYTI3ZDU0MmYyMzUzNDUxN2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commit/c24731e330ed9fb9a9e6c1723bdbf095abbe56f8","sha":"c24731e330ed9fb9a9e6c1723bdbf095abbe56f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/c24731e330ed9fb9a9e6c1723bdbf095abbe56f8"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commit/a0f1ee0fc8d40fc16a18906a78101f0360f10fba","sha":"a0f1ee0fc8d40fc16a18906a78101f0360f10fba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/a0f1ee0fc8d40fc16a18906a78101f0360f10fba"}],"sha":"dcc2597bca0b3170b6bd2eba27d542f23534517c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/dcc2597bca0b3170b6bd2eba27d542f23534517c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/a0f1ee0fc8d40fc16a18906a78101f0360f10fba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T21:13:02Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T21:13:02Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"feat(plan): collapsible phases, and how much of each session got done\n\nCloses #92 and #85. Dev 7.5.0.\n\nThe plan screen listed 16 phases fully expanded and said nothing about what had\nactually been done. Phases are now collapsible `<details>`, and every past session\ncarries a real completion percentage derived server-side, down to which individual\nblocks got done.\n\n- `GET /api/sessions/completion` — one bounded, `GROUP BY` read returning per-session\n  block counts plus `done_block_ids`. No migration, no new column: partial completion\n  stays a derived query, because the rule will be tuned.\n- Collapsed by default except the block the climber is standing in, persisted per plan\n  in `ct:planPhases`, with expand/collapse-all.\n- A per-phase aggregate badge on the collapsed heading: the mean of its sessions''\n  percentages, every session weighted equally, a skipped one counting as 0.\n- Colour comes from the percentage alone — 100 green, 50-99 amber, under 50 red —\n  never from whether Finish was pressed. `AMBER_FLOOR_PERCENT` is the one boundary.\n\nBoth environments stay at DB `0008`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e7aea6aaa68e0296fe0b3a921fb62ffc10b9aec4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/git/trees/e7aea6aaa68e0296fe0b3a921fb62ffc10b9aec4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/git/commits/a0f1ee0fc8d40fc16a18906a78101f0360f10fba","verific