imb-trainer/commits/a058a79dd8cc8e400a9becc48cfe1c51b217cec1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/6f32f681a771934a804dbf868cbde8ddd4e401e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T12:00:00Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T12:00:00Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"feat(planner): climbing-first plans — level bands, session windows, honest reach\n\nThe generator prescribed only 28% of its minutes on a wall — 549 against 1,424 —\nand whole weeks with no climbing at all. PR #86 made the session player execute\nthose plans faithfully, which turned a content problem into a shipped one.\n\nClimbing''s share is now level-dependent but never a minority: a target band per\nclimber (85-90 / 75-82 / 50-62% by beginner / intermediate / advanced) over a\nhard per-week floor, with the bands stored as an ordinal boundary per discipline\nrather than a label, because the sport and boulder ladders are disjoint.\n\nSession length is a property of the training TYPE, not of the climber''s free\ntime. A max-hang session is 20-45 minutes because low volume is the protocol;\npadding it makes it worse, not longer. Only endurance and technique work expands.\n\nPriority work leads its session: max hangs, repeaters and limit boulders come\nbefore volume work, because quality of effort decides the adaptation and a hang\nbehind 35 minutes of climbing is training thrown away.\n\nSix exercises were unreachable by any plan. The two allocation passes used\non-wall/off-wall as an eligibility FILTER, and they are complements on that axis\nbut not on the which-aspects axis — so an on-wall exercise in a non-wall-led\naspect, and an off-wall exercise in a wall-led one, were owned by neither pass.\nEligibility is now `prescribable()` alone and wall-ness is a preference, which\nremoves the class rather than patching the six. Reach is guarded both ways.\n\nCloses #84. Closes the naming half of #61.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d0fedf9781bcd8402be38ddf38cb426c7b38cfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/git/trees/4d0fedf9781bcd8402be38ddf38cb426c7b38cfb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/git/commits/6f32f681a771934a804dbf868cbde8ddd4e401e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"