pi.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/17c8a01a0a39b6387663703ba0a3575d6be26678/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T21:02:04Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T21:02:04Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"feat(session): the session player — timer, cues and the write path\n\nReplaces the 13-line stub at `web/src/routes/_authed/session.lazy.tsx` with\nthe guided session player, closing the core product loop: pick a target grade\n→ generate a plan → follow along in-session → log it.\n\nThe backend half shipped in #83, so this is web-only. No Alembic revision;\nboth environments stay at `0008`.\n\nNew `web/src/session/` package. Pure, unit-tested core: `protocol.ts` compiles\nany prescription into four phase kinds (prepare | work | rest | open) behind an\nexhaustive switch over `ProtocolKind`, so a new kind is a build failure — which\ncaught three kinds missing from the original design note. `clock.ts` advances\nwhile overdue from wall-clock time; `outbox.ts` owns the delta and the\nquarantine rule; `runStore.ts` persists the run under `ct:run`.\n\nThe session is a list of items. Starting it starts no timer — each item is\nstarted, paused, skipped, restarted or marked done by hand on its own. A\nrunning item owns the screen and hides the others.\n\nTiming invariants, each a bug a naive implementation ships: rAF drives the\ndisplay and never `setInterval`; `performance.now()` for elapsed maths and\n`Date.now()` only for persistence; a `setTimeout` armed to the next boundary\nbacks up a throttled rAF; a tick that skips several phases fires exactly one\ncue and offers a resync. Pause freezes the clock through `clockAt`, and resume\nshifts the phase start rather than re-stamping it.\n\nWrites follow the two-tier rule: Tier 1 at start and finish, Tier 2 batched to\nFinish, tab-hidden and reconnect only — no debounce and no item-count trigger,\nbecause a periodic flush would hold Neon awake for a 45–90 minute session.\n4xx quarantines permanently, 5xx retries. `duration_minutes` is elapsed\nminutes floored at 1, never `estimated_minutes`.\n\nMarking an item done by hand logs its prescribed sets with null measurements,\nso the derived completion figure agrees with what the climber said. A skipped\nitem logs nothing, which is what keeps it honest.\n\nScreen wake lock is a user-owned toggle rendered from the sentinel''s real\nstate, hidden entirely where unsupported. Cues are synthesized oscillators\narmed inside the Start gesture, behind a mute toggle.\n\nCloses the full-height deferral in `_chrome.scss` with an in-flow `100%`\nchain — no viewport units, no `position: fixed` — degrading to content height\nin the federated mount.\n\n904 web tests and 653 server tests pass. Every guard was shown red against a\nsynthetic violation before being trusted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d812dcf0b2a59a441eae7489fa4467867fc2d4ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/git/trees/d812dcf0b2a59a441eae7489fa4467867fc2d4ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/git/commits/17c8a01a0a39b6387663703ba0a3575d6be26678","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commit/17c8a01a0a39b6387663703ba0a3575d6be26678","node_id":"C_kwDOT2NbNNoAKDE3YzhhMDFhMGEzOWI2Mzg3NjYzNzAzYmEwYTM1NzVkNmJlMjY2Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commit/fa738895316c8d0940f6be2a464dc3e8ab906157","sha":"fa738895316c8d0940f6be2a464dc3e8ab906157","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/fa738895316c8d0940f6be2a464dc3e8ab906157"}],"sha":"17c8a01a0a39b6387663703ba0a3575d6be26678","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/17c8a01a0a39b6387663703ba0a3575d6be26678"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","