.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/161aec92aeb87caf859c3f712eba5a06af4ab95e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T07:59:34Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T07:59:34Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"chore(release): v7.0.0 — the exercise library, the plan generator, and plan persistence\n\nSixth production promotion, and the first to carry six dev minors at once:\nPR #63 (planned PR #10, the exercise library — 85 exercises and 271\nprescription templates in server/domain/exercises.py, seeded by the new\nserver/contentseed.py, plus GET /api/library CDN-cached on the build id, and\nmigration 0007), PR #66 (planned PR #11a, the pure plan generator in\nserver/domain/planner/ with POST /api/plans/preview and the /plan screen),\nPR #70 (planned PR #11b, POST /api/plans persisting a plan already activated\nwith GET /api/plans/active and abandon, and migration 0008), PR #72 (the prose\ntrim — ~14,000 lines of comment and docstring down to a five-cap budget with\ntwo new pytest guards), PR #67 and PR #75 (the python and web dependency\ngroups, plus the construct-citation conversion and its vitest guard that keeps\na node_modules citation from rotting silently), and PR #76 (docs reconcile).\n\nMajor rather than minor: three new user-facing capabilities — a browsable\nexercise library, a generated training plan and a persisted active plan — and\ntwo schema revisions ship with it.\n\nMIGRATION REQUIRED, AND IT RUNS FIRST. Production is at 0006 and must reach\n0008 before this merges. Dispatched at --ref dev for two reasons this time,\nnot one: 0007 and 0008 live only on dev until this PR lands, and the workflow''s\nown \"Seed the exercise library\" step is also dev-only — so a default-ref run\nwould seed the vocabulary through server.seed and leave the exercise library\nempty, which is a 500 on /library and a generator with nothing to prescribe.\nRead each revision back out of the run log rather than trusting the green tick.\n\nBoth revisions are expand-safe: every added column is nullable with no default,\nso no existing row is rewritten and the deployed v6.0.0 code keeps serving in\nthe gap between the migration and this merge. 0008''s partial unique index\nuq_plan_one_active_per_user cannot collide on the way in, because production\nhas never held a plan row — no code that writes one has shipped there.\n\nSeeded on the way: 0007 introduces authored content production has never had.\nserver/seed.py is idempotent by upsert and never deletes, and server.contentseed\nis a pure insert against an empty library here, so seed=true only brings the\ntables up to what the shipping code expects.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4587e5c761aa2aed81d9f4ed401085a29f23b875","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/git/trees/4587e5c761aa2aed81d9f4ed401085a29f23b875"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/git/commits/161aec92aeb87caf859c3f712eba5a06af4ab95e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":n