b.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/cac2ee0167f25a13f21420365ba4fd72d85ccaaa"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commit/7fab514256bf26588b8670a04c890545365ae534","sha":"7fab514256bf26588b8670a04c890545365ae534","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/7fab514256bf26588b8670a04c890545365ae534"}],"sha":"6e588ba8959e6850f6f54a909626044ec93afbb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/6e588ba8959e6850f6f54a909626044ec93afbb5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/7fab514256bf26588b8670a04c890545365ae534/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T13:50:24Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T13:50:24Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"chore: cite library source by construct, not line number, and guard it\n\nCarries Dependabot #73 (web group, 10 updates) together with the fix its own bump\nmade necessary — so `dev` never holds a false citation.\n\n`@tanstack/react-query` 5.101.4 -> 5.102.2 falsified SIX of nine line-number\ncitations into node_modules while the entire suite stayed green: mutation.js:135->105,\n:194->143, queryClient.js:92->88/99, queryObserver.js:331->258, :141->127,\nquery.js:268->215/225/310. Every behaviour still holds; only the addresses rotted.\n\nThose citations are load-bearing — CLAUDE.md requires claims about library behaviour\nto be READ from the installed source, because three consecutive review rounds found\nbugs that came from reasoning about TanStack Query''s semantics instead of reading\nthem. They were on the trim PR''s non-negotiable-keeps list, and they turn out to be\nthe most rot-prone prose in the repo: a line number is falsified by every bump and\nnothing can check it.\n\nSo the form changes, not the claims. `mutation.js:82` becomes\n`mutation.js` - `retry: this.options.retry ?? 0`: greppable, survives renumbering,\nand verifiable. Pinned versions dropped from the prose — the guard makes provenance\nlive, so a pinned version is one more thing to rot.\n\n18 citations converted, four more than first identified, including a line-number\ncitation into one of our OWN files. All six moved behaviours were re-read in 5.102.2\nrather than assumed: the success ordering still awaits onSuccess before dispatching,\nrunNext still resumes the scope''s next paused mutation, setQueryData still no-ops on\nundefined, a reverted CancelledError still writes nothing.\n\nweb/src/api/libraryCitations.test.ts — in the WEB suite deliberately, because it\nreads web/node_modules and CI''s server job does not install web dependencies; a\npytest guard would pass vacuously there. Four arms: every construct still present;\nvacuity (table size, modules readable and non-trivial, plus a negative control);\ntable -> prose; and prose -> table by auto-detection, so a new citation without a\nrow fails rather than relying on a hand-kept count. Every arm shown red, then\nrestored.\n\nAlso removes a stale measured figure: CLAUDE.md claimed the PWA precache was\n33 entries / ~426 KiB \"as of PR #7\"; the build reports 41 / 523.96 KiB. The figure is\ngone (the build prints it); the rule it was attached to — remoteEntry.js and the MF\nchunks must stay precached or the standalone app loses offline — is unguarded prose\nand is now issue #74.\n\nGate: web 688 passed / 32 files, server 581 passed / 0 skipped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"92b30ff245414787e37f50d6d0a344b372013787","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/git/trees/92b30ff245414787e37f50d6d0a344b372013787"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/git/commits/7fab514256bf26588b8670a04c890545365ae534","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commit/7fab514256bf26588b8670a04c890545365ae534","node_id":"C_kwDOT2NbNN