ithub.com/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commit/7b0f203f59f9ee8c5cd9e89a41bb545fca441d94","sha":"7b0f203f59f9ee8c5cd9e89a41bb545fca441d94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/7b0f203f59f9ee8c5cd9e89a41bb545fca441d94"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commit/e41b4d90fe5c8349fec46dbc2a1a5cc636ca075a","sha":"e41b4d90fe5c8349fec46dbc2a1a5cc636ca075a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/e41b4d90fe5c8349fec46dbc2a1a5cc636ca075a"}],"sha":"ab9c1246aa89b1de50b13edd4784d18ddac7c8d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/ab9c1246aa89b1de50b13edd4784d18ddac7c8d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/e41b4d90fe5c8349fec46dbc2a1a5cc636ca075a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T21:18:26Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T21:18:26Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"docs(plans): trim the prose in PR #11b, keeping every trap\n\nComment- and docstring-only pass over the five files Kilian flagged as\nover-explained. No behaviour change: server 544 passed / 0 skipped and web\n684 passed / 31 files, both unchanged.\n\nWhat went: restatement of the next line, justification of the obvious,\nnarration of this PR''s own rounds, the same reason argued in the migration\nand the route and the test, and the payload tables that PR #70''s body\nalready carries.\n\nWhat stayed, compressed rather than deleted: the backref-cascade trap and\nits `unitofwork.py` initiator-key citation, `sa.text` never `func.text`,\nthe character-identical active-plan predicate, coordinate-addressed\n`generator_caveats` and its degrade rule, the `private, no-store` security\nreasoning, why there is no `onError` refetch, every citation of installed\nSQLAlchemy and query-core source, and `aspect_key` being read live.\n\n`web/src/api/schema.ts` is regenerated: Pydantic model and handler\ndocstrings become the OpenAPI `description` fields, so trimming them moves\nthe committed document digest. The diff there is comment text only — zero\ntype changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1715ed800f792d4a4f66a2c975071a271a3e0912","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/git/trees/1715ed800f792d4a4f66a2c975071a271a3e0912"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/git/commits/e41b4d90fe5c8349fec46dbc2a1a5cc636ca075a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commit/e41b4d90fe5c8349fec46dbc2a1a5cc636ca075a","node_id":"C_kwDOT2NbNNoAKGU0MWI0ZDkwZmU1YzgzNDlmZWM0NmRiYzJhMWE1Y2M2MzZjYTA3NWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commit/7284b037b055a2c2b910d06c99d73b362b6c77a7","sha":"7284b037b055a2c2b910d06c99d73b362b6c77a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/7284b037b055a2c2b910d06c99d73b362b6c77a7"}],"sha":"e41b4d90fe5c8349fec46dbc2a1a5cc636ca075a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/e41b4d90fe5c8349fec46dbc2a1a5cc636ca075a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/commits/7284b037b055a2c2b910d06c99d73b362b6c77a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T20:57:09Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T20:57:09Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"feat(plans): persist and activate a generated plan (PR #11b)\n\nPR #11a shipped a pure generator and a preview that writes nothing, so a user could see\na plan and not have one. This is the write path.\n\n`POST /api/plans` regenerates the blueprint server-side (never trusting a client-supplied\ntree), stands the user''s current plan down, inserts the whole six-level tree and activates\nit — one transaction, all-or-nothing. Plus `GET /api/plans/active` and\n`POST /api/plans/{plan_id}/abandon`.\n\nMigration `0008`, purely additive: `plan.current_grade_id` (the profile''s current grade\ndrifts as the climber improves, so nothing else recovers what the plan was built from),\n`plan.generator_caveats` (jsonb — the shortfalls and notes the generator emitted, which no\npersisted row records), `session_block.rest_between_sets_seconds`, and\n`uq_plan_one_active_per_user`, a partial unique index making one-active-plan structural.\n\nPersisting IS activating, abandoning marks rather than deletes (activity.planned_session_id\nis the only link from a logged session to the plan), and the transaction that activates one\nplan is the transaction that stands the other down.\n\nNotes worth keeping:\n\n- A backref append cascades NOTHING. `Mesocycle(plan=plan, ...)` persisted the plan row and\n  silently dropped all ~2,400 descendants: 201, committed, one SAWarning.\n  `sqlalchemy/orm/unitofwork.py:66` gates the save-update cascade on `key == initiator.key`.\n  Nothing in the schema requires a plan to have a mesocycle, so only a six-table row count\n  catches it — hence that test.\n- The insert is 13 statements (5 executemany, one per level), not one per row.\n- `generator_caveats` is coordinate-addressed (`week_no.weekday.order_index`), not\n  positional, so a changed `order_by` cannot mis-attach a banner; unrecognised shapes\n  degrade to \"no caveats\" rather than 500.\n- One response shape serves preview and persisted alike, so the client has one renderer.\n- The local dev database IS the test database; a hand-made account broke 15 tests naming\n  profile validation. `_refuse_a_polluted_database` now fails first with the real reason.\n\nOut of scope, deliberately: issue #62''s second invariant (no logged_set write surface\nexists yet), #64, and idempotency for a retried-after-lost-response create (#69).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8194d2b00d882b71704b2f2d79c850e4d67598db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/git/trees/8194d2b00d882b71704b2f2d79c850e4d67598db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/climb-trainer/git/commits/7284b037b055a2c2b910d06c99d73b362b6c77a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/us