board-remote):\n  - exportCommitments() helper in lib/api.ts — fetches blob, triggers\n    browser download via a temporary anchor element\n  - ''Export CSV'' and ''Export PDF'' buttons in the Associated Commitments\n    header of ReputationDashboard; loading/disabled state while in-flight\n  - Inline export error banner rendered below the buttons on failure\n\n- commitments.ts: exported CommitmentOutcomeRow interface so export.ts\n  can reuse the shared row type without duplication\n\nCloses #209","tree":{"sha":"e8e0788536527d4a55535d868200f58ac08a958a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/trees/e8e0788536527d4a55535d868200f58ac08a958a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/commits/b201108ff779726bf604689699ec4186808b8bca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194898168?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Victorjonah-prog/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Victorjonah-prog/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Victorjonah-prog/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Victorjonah-prog/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Victorjonah-prog","id":194898168,"login":"Victorjonah-prog","node_id":"U_kgDOC53o-A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Victorjonah-prog/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Victorjonah-prog/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Victorjonah-prog/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Victorjonah-prog/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Victorjonah-prog/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Victorjonah-prog","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/b201108ff779726bf