s (M[A-Z2-7]{68}) in addition to G/C/S addresses and hex hashes.\n- Export scrubEvent and add unit tests verifying redaction across\n  event.message, event.exception.values and event.extra.\n- Document scrubString/scrubValue.","tree":{"sha":"8501ac18d06033245965f6460d8099e9b630f4ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/trees/8501ac18d06033245965f6460d8099e9b630f4ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/commits/ed156342a5317899e9c6b3ff65c2874ab13d959b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98468608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muhammadjazuli","id":98468608,"login":"Muhammadjazuli","node_id":"U_kgDOBd6DAA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/ed156342a5317899e9c6b3ff65c2874ab13d959b","node_id":"C_kwDOT2TmttoAKGVkMTU2MzQyYTUzMTc4OTllOWM2YjNmZjY1YzI4NzRhYjEzZDk1OWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/0ab32a06639fe6e4eb745d7dfd62196cb8ad71a9","sha":"0ab32a06639fe6e4eb745d7dfd62196cb8ad71a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/0ab32a06639fe6e4eb745d7dfd62196cb8ad71a9"}],"sha":"ed156342a5317899e9c6b3ff65c2874ab13d959b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/ed156342a5317899e9c6b3ff65c2874ab13d959b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98468608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muhammadjazuli","id":98468608,"login":"Muhammadjazuli","node_id":"U_kgDOBd6DAA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/0ab32a06639fe6e4eb745d7dfd62196cb8ad71a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T10:20:56Z","email":"98468608+Muhammadjazuli@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jazuli"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T10:20:56Z","email":"98468608+Muhammadjazuli@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jazuli"},"message":"feat: integrate Sentry frontend error monitoring & session tracing\n\nAdd @sentry/react to the Vite/React frontend (Issue #210):\n\n- Initialise Sentry in main.tsx before the tree renders so unhandled\n  promise rejections, global errors and React component crashes are\n  captured from the first frame. No-op unless VITE_SENTRY_DSN is set.\n- Wrap the whole app (main.tsx) and the main application shell (App.tsx)\n  in a Sentry Error Boundary via the new SentryErrorBoundary component;\n  behaves as a no-op wrapper when Sentry is disabled.\n- Enable browser tracing (browserTracingIntegration) for session tracing.\n- Scrub sensitive data (Stellar wallet/contract addresses and 64-char hex\n  transaction/commitment hashes) in beforeSend before events leave the\n  browser.\n- Report Soroban RPC timeouts / node exhaustion to Sentry from the RPC\n  pool with non-sensitive context.\n- Document VITE_SENTRY_DSN / VITE_SENTRY_RELEASE in .env.example.","tree":{"sha":"d007a04eb775fbb1cc11b6b6c13a73733724fe0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/trees/d007a04eb775fbb1cc11b6b6c13a73733724fe0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/commits/0ab32a06639fe6e4eb745d7dfd62196cb8ad71a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98468608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muhammadjazuli","id":98468608,"login":"Muhammadjazuli","node_id":"U_kgDOBd6DAA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muhammadjazuli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"ht