226534673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amankoli09","id":226534673,"login":"amankoli09","node_id":"U_kgDODYClEQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/5f1483b0b340a04a8d68c7029c1f14c375d41a7e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T10:11:41Z","email":"2025.amana@isu.ac.in","name":"Aman koli"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T10:11:41Z","email":"2025.amana@isu.ac.in","name":"Aman koli"},"message":"fix: repo-wide health pass — dead code, unwired CI, stale stub endpoints\n\nFull audit across every package, prompted by the six issues filed\nearlier (#230-#235). Concrete fixes, not just more filed issues:\n\n- Removed frontend-vanilla/: the pre-React prototype UI, superseded by\n  frontend/ (commit 05451ac), unreferenced by any build/CI/deploy path,\n  only mentioned in SECURITY.md''s scope list. Updated that reference to\n  the actual current frontend packages (frontend/, frontend-wizard-remote/,\n  frontend-dashboard-remote/).\n\n- evm/ (the cross-chain oracle PoC for issue #74) had zero CI coverage\n  and a test that had, as far as anyone could tell, never once been\n  confirmed passing since it was introduced: an unverified \"≥75% gas\n  reduction\" claim that the real measured reduction (~71%) has never\n  actually cleared. Recalibrated the threshold to the real, measured\n  number with headroom, and added .github/workflows/evm.yml so this\n  can''t silently drift unnoticed again.\n\n- packages/cli (@pactum/cli) also had zero CI coverage. Running its\n  test suite surfaced two more never-caught issues: its @pactum/sdk\n  dependency has to be built before the CLI can resolve it (fine once\n  you know, but nobody had ever run this in the right order to find\n  out), and `reputation.ts` read `.fulfilled/.late/.breached` off the\n  SDK''s Reputation type, which has always been `fulfilledCount`/\n  `lateCount`/`breachedCount` — a typecheck error, not caught because\n  `npm run typecheck` had never run in CI either. Added a cli-tests job\n  to ci.yml (build SDK, then typecheck/test/build the CLI) and fixed\n  the field names.\n\n- GET /commitments/:id was a stub returning `{ message, id }` with no\n  DB lookup at all — implemented it for real against commitment_outcomes,\n  reusing the same toApiCommitment shape transform GET /commitments (the\n  list endpoint) already applies, since skipping that transform reintroduces\n  the exact issuer/counterparty-undefined crash its own doc comment\n  describes. Wired the frontend''s \"Get Commitment\" page to actually call\n  it instead of an alert(\"not implemented yet\") placeholder, and made\n  \"Check Overdue\" work off the fetched commitment''s due date instead of\n  being an inert no-op button.\n\n- contracts/*/test_snapshots/ was listed in .gitignore but 130 files\n  under it were tracked anyway (ignore rules don''t retroactively untrack\n  already-committed files) — every contract-touching PR this cycle\n  carried 100+ line diffs across these on top of its real change. Untracked\n  them (git rm --cached; they''re regenerated locally as before, just not\n  committed).\n\n- .gitignore was missing dist-crypto-test/ (added for the homomorphic-\n  encryption crypto test suite, alongside the four dist-*-test/ entries\n  already listed) -- same class of gap as the test_snapshots one above,\n  just smaller.\n\nVerified locally: backend/frontend/cli typecheck clean, evm''s full\n33-test suite passing, frontend lint/unit-tests/build clean (170\ntests), backend''s full test suite (indexer/relayer/crypto) clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"872516b8d33e53559c6972aa7e9b020b31464f34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/trees/872516b8d33e53559c6972aa7e9b020b31464f34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/commits/5f1483b0b340a04a8d68c7029c1f14c375d41a7e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226534673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amankoli09","id":226534673,"login":"amankoli09","node_id":"U_kgDODYClEQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/5f1483b0b340a04a8d68c7029c1f14c375d41a7e","node_id":"C_kwDOT2TmttoAKDVmMTQ4M2IwYjM0MGEwNGE4ZDY4YzcwMjljMWYxNGMzNzVkNDFhN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol