com/users/amankoli09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/7b08e03cea5be3c02f5b28c76644d9daa20b6a5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T08:05:57Z","email":"2025.amana@isu.ac.in","name":"Aman koli"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T08:05:57Z","email":"2025.amana@isu.ac.in","name":"Aman koli"},"message":"fix: preflight simulation used only 4 of create_commitment''s 9 args\n\nThe e2e-sandbox job''s real Soroban simulation was failing with\nHostError: Error(WasmVm, UnexpectedSize) / MismatchingParameterLen --\nthe hand-built preflight transaction only passed\n(issuer, counterparty, terms_hash, due_at), while the registry\ncontract''s create_commitment takes 9 parameters. submitCreateCommitment\nalready builds the full call correctly (fetching the arbitrator as\nresolver_address, void oracle/schema_id, empty attestors, 0 vote\nthreshold); the preflight tx now mirrors it exactly instead of\nindependently reconstructing a stale subset.\n\nConfirmed via the failing run''s Playwright trace: the simulateTransaction\nresponse for the preflight tx contained the MismatchingParameterLen\nerror, so preflight always failed simulation before the wallet was ever\nprompted, regardless of whether the real submission would have\nsucceeded.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8fbbb96c090cc33c0a148bfa7b5e6cf53f0f74a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/trees/8fbbb96c090cc33c0a148bfa7b5e6cf53f0f74a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/commits/7b08e03cea5be3c02f5b28c76644d9daa20b6a5f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.c