s://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/390ec3e2cb2dc9ca130a90ee596f13131f3e63e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T05:47:15Z","email":"2025.amana@isu.ac.in","name":"Aman koli"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T05:47:15Z","email":"2025.amana@isu.ac.in","name":"Aman koli"},"message":"fix: pass required --admin arg to registry initialize in e2e deploy script\n\nRBAC''s initialize() now takes an admin Address alongside the arbitrator\nset, but scripts/e2e/deploy-test-contract.sh was never updated, so the\ne2e-sandbox job''s deploy step failed with \"Missing required argument\n''admin''\". The arbitrator identity already signs as --source, so it\ndoubles as the admin here to avoid needing a second co-signing identity.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce792ee999519422d76ff2ba3660f37740fd3675","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/trees/ce792ee999519422d76ff2ba3660f37740fd3675"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/commits/390ec3e2cb2dc9ca130a90ee596f13131f3e63e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226534673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amankoli09","id":226534673,"login":"amankoli09","node_id":"U_kgDODYClEQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/390ec3e2cb2dc9ca130a90ee596f13131f3e63e7","node_id":"C_kwDOT2TmttoAKDM5MGVjM2UyY2IyZGM5Y2ExMzBhOTBlZTU5NmYxMzEzMWYzZTYzZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/1e363c31973e698ab734c57c64c0bf5f124dbbe7","sha":"1e363c31973e698ab734c57c64c0bf5f124dbbe7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/1e363c31973e698ab734c57c64c0bf5f124dbbe7"}],"sha":"390ec3e2cb2dc9ca130a90ee596f13131f3e63e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/390ec3e2cb2dc9ca130a90ee596f13131f3e63e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226534673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amankoli09","id":226534673,"login":"amankoli09","node_id":"U_kgDODYClEQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/1e363c31973e698ab734c57c64c0bf5f124dbbe7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T05:37:27Z","email":"2025.amana@isu.ac.in","name":"Aman koli"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T05:37:27Z","email":"2025.amana@isu.ac.in","name":"Aman koli"},"message":"fix: repair bad merge fallout and RBAC signature drift breaking CI\n\nSeveral bad merges of main into RBAC left the branch in a broken state:\n- registry errors.rs: NotAdmin/AdminAlreadySet collided with\n  RollupChallengePending/RollupProofInvalid (both = 42/43); renumbered\n  to 45/46.\n- contracts/Cargo.toml lost \"fraud_verifier\" from workspace.members,\n  breaking the zk crosscheck test''s cargo run --bin hash_helper.\n- frontend/e2e/commitment-flow.spec.ts had duplicated/dead switch\n  cases in the Freighter mock and a duplicated wallet-connect block\n  in the WASM-validation test; restored to match main (no RBAC-owned\n  changes lived in this file).\n- state_channel lost its #[allow(clippy::too_many_arguments)]\n  attributes and had a clean boolean rewritten as a verbose if/else.\n\nNew contracts/rust-toolchain.toml pinned channel 1.88.0 with only\nwasm32-unknown-unknown, which is both too old for fraud_verifier''s\ndeps (need 1.89+) and missing the wasm32v1-none target the optimized\nbuild/E2E sandbox jobs need. Removed it; each CI job already pins its\nown toolchain via dtolnay/rust-toolchain@stable.\n\nFixed two real bugs in the RBAC change itself:\n- init_upgrade_admin took an admin param but only required that same\n  address''s own signature, so any self-signing caller could install\n  itself as upgrade admin. Added a separate `caller` argument that\n  must be the registered contract admin.\n- upgrade()/set_upgrade_admin() gained a redundant admin-gate on top\n  of the existing upgrade-admin (Timelock) gate, which the Timelock''s\n  own cross-contract dispatch() was never updated to satisfy — every\n  governance-path test failed at runtime. Reverted these two to their\n  pre-RBAC signatures; only init_upgrade_admin (the one bootstrap step\n  before a Timelock exists) needed the new admin check.\n\nAlso fixed 23 unused-variable clippy errors and ran cargo fmt.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3c0733244ec89f6b27e483117bd4307f3c5a392","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/trees/a3c0733244ec89f6b27e483117bd4307f3c5a392"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/commits/1e363c31973e698ab734c57c64c0bf5f124dbbe7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226534673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amankoli09","id":226534673,"login":"amankoli09","node_id":"U_kgDODYClEQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amankoli09","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/1e363c31973e698ab734c57c64c0bf5f124dbbe7","node_id":"C_kwDOT2TmttoAKDFlMzYzYzMxOTczZTY5OGFiNzM0YzU3YzY0YzBiZjVmMTI0ZGJiZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/b44617c