":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85998029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mac-5","id":85998029,"login":"Mac-5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1OTk4MDI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/129c403b14017611dd1383475fc694bf0b8b533f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T21:42:39Z","email":"emmamarkpius@gmail.com","name":"Mac-5"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T21:42:39Z","email":"emmamarkpius@gmail.com","name":"Mac-5"},"message":"fix(frontend): remove duplicate wallet-connect step and dead switch cases in e2e test\n\nTwo issues in commitment-flow.spec.ts, both pre-existing on main and\nboth blocking this branch''s commit via the repo''s eslint pre-commit\nhook (no-duplicate-case is an error, not auto-fixable):\n\n1. The \"WASM validation failure blocks transaction simulation and\n   wallet submission\" test connected the wallet twice: three inline\n   steps (Connect Wallet -> Freighter -> assert address), then an\n   immediate second call to connectFreighter() doing the same thing.\n   Once connected, WalletConnectButton''s label is no longer \"Connect\n   Wallet\" -- clicking it reopens WalletConnectModal in its\n   already-connected branch (address details + Disconnect button),\n   which never renders a \"Freighter\" button. The second\n   connectFreighter() call then hung on\n   getByRole(''button'', { name: /Freighter/ }) for the full 30s\n   timeout, on every retry, on both chromium and firefox. Removed the\n   redundant inline block, matching the same cleanup already done for\n   the \"encrypted commitment\" test elsewhere in this file.\n\n2. installFreighterMock''s postMessage switch had accumulated\n   duplicate/dead case labels from what looks like several merges that\n   each added their own mock handler without removing the prior one:\n   - A first ''REQUEST_SIGN_MESSAGE'' arm referenced `txXdr`, a const\n     scoped to an earlier case block -- not just dead code, but would\n     have thrown ReferenceError had it ever actually been reached.\n   - Two duplicate ''SUBMIT_TRANSACTION'' arms after the first (real)\n     one were unreachable dead code (JS switch takes the first\n     matching label).\n   Kept only the first (reachable, correct) SUBMIT_TRANSACTION/\n   REQUEST_SIGN_TRANSACTION arm and the well-formed SUBMIT_BLOB/\n   REQUEST_SIGN_MESSAGE arm; deleted the broken/dead ones.\n\nVerified: `npx eslint e2e/commitment-flow.spec.ts` clean (was 3\nno-duplicate-case errors before). Full frontend e2e suite: 30/30 pass\non both chromium and firefox (up from 28 pass / 2 fail in the CI run\nthat reported the original timeout). `npm run lint` (oxlint) exit 0,\nno errors, no new warnings from this file.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EhLWUgzRq34gcr1VpAP2or","tree":{"sha":"21339b698909aefba204fa93eba5d02769a89a0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/trees/21339b698909aefba204fa93eba5d02769a89a0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/commits/129c403b14017611dd1383475fc694bf0b8b533f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85998029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mac-5","id":85998029,"login":"Mac-5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1OTk4MDI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/129c403b14017611dd1383475fc694bf0b8b533f","node_id":"C_kwDOT2TmttoAKDEyOWM0MDNiMTQwMTc2MTFkZDEzODM0NzVmYzY5NGJmMGI4YjUzM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/48b3c23a8b0e11b091cc8bed923dbe7d91521946","sha":"48b3c23a8b0e11b091cc8bed923dbe7d91521946","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/48b3c23a8b0e11b091cc8bed923dbe7d91521946"}],"sha":"129c403b14017611dd1383475fc694bf0b8b533f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/129c403b14017611dd1383475fc694bf0b8b533f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85998029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mac-5","id":85998029,"login":"Mac-5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1OTk4MDI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/48b3c23a8b0e11b091cc8bed923dbe7d91521946/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T19:23:14Z","email":"emmamarkpius@gmail.com","name":"Mac-5"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T19:23:14Z","email":"emmamarkpius@gmail.com","name":"Mac-5"},"message":"fix(contracts): register fraud_verifier as a workspace member\n\nzk/test/crosscheck.test.ts runs `cargo run --bin hash_helper` from\ncontracts/fraud_verifier, but that crate was never added to\ncontracts/Cargo.toml''s workspace.members -- it sits inside the\nworkspace''s directory tree without being declared a member, so Cargo\nrefused to build it standalone (\"current package believes it''s in a\nworkspace when it''s not\"), failing the zk test suite in CI.\n\nAlso drops fraud_verifier''s own [profile.release] block: now that it''s\na workspace member, Cargo ignores per-member profiles in favor of the\nworkspace root''s (which already has identical settings) and was\nemitting a \"profiles for the non root package will be ignored\"\nwarning.\n\nVerified safe before applying, since `cargo clippy --workspace` and\n`cargo build --target wasm32-unknown-unknown` in CI now cover this\ncrate too:\n- cargo build --target wasm32-unknown-unknown --release (whole\n  workspace, matches the contract-tests CI job) succeeds cleanly with\n  fraud_verifier included.\n- cargo test --workspace --features\n  registry/wasm-tests,timelock/wasm-tests passes, including\n  fraud_verifier''s own 2 unit tests.\n- cargo fmt --all -- --check and cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets\n  -- -D warnings are already failing on main today, entirely within\n  state_channel -- pre-existing, unrelated to fraud_verifier, which\n  contributes zero new diffs/errors to either. Not fixed here (out of\n  scope, different crate, different bug class).\n- zk/test/crosscheck.test.ts now passes for real: 6/6, including the\n  previously-failing \"Rust and TypeScript produce identical hashes\"\n  case.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EhLWUgzRq34gcr1VpAP2or","tree":{"sha":"b954203a9aececf8623b26febac0dfd4cdec44c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/trees/b954203a9aececf8623b26febac0dfd4cdec44c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/commits/48b3c23a8b0e11b091cc8bed923dbe7d91521946","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85998029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mac-5","id":85998029,"login":"Mac-5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1OTk4MDI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mac-5","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/48b3c23a8b0e11b091cc8bed923dbe7d91521946","node_id":"C_kwDOT2TmttoAKDQ4YjNjMjNhOGIwZTExYjA5MWNjOGJlZDkyM2RiZTdkOTE1MjE5NDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/c429