pi.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/81132c1c3a562af6303d829268560a5691ef9565/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T08:40:21Z","email":"Richardkingz2019@gmail.com","name":"Richardkingz2019"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T08:40:21Z","email":"Richardkingz2019@gmail.com","name":"Richardkingz2019"},"message":"fix: wire per-call onStatusUpdate into cached pool failover\n\nThe Proxy in getOrCreatePool accepted onStatusUpdate but never invoked it\n— it forwarded execute opts verbatim and the cached pool''s onFallback\nclosure was fixed to console.warn only, so UI callers received no failover\nmessages.\n\nReplace the inert Proxy with a module-level listener set keyed by pool:\nthe pool-wide onFallback now notifies every registered listener, and\ngetOrCreatePool registers the caller''s callback (bounded to 8 to avoid\nretaining stale React setters). Adds tests covering pool reuse and\nlistener notification on failover.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"3ed942d0b8cc35f8189a815ea1cfbe3a61527953","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/trees/3ed942d0b8cc35f8189a815ea1cfbe3a61527953"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/commits/81132c1c3a562af6303d829268560a5691ef9565","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276032939?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/e