z2019","node_id":"U_kgDOEHPtqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/e6bebb8a156264b4ee8764774620027edea74d88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T08:24:36Z","email":"Richardkingz2019@gmail.com","name":"Richardkingz2019"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T08:24:36Z","email":"Richardkingz2019@gmail.com","name":"Richardkingz2019"},"message":"fix: convert fetchArbitrator to pool, fix bare server references\n\n- fetchArbitrator: replace `new rpc.Server(...)` with `getOrCreatePool()`\n  so that the arbitrator lookup also benefits from connection pooling\n  and health-aware routing.\n- submitCreateCommitment: fix `server.prepareTransaction(tx)` →\n  `pool.prepareTransaction(tx)` — `server` was an undefined variable\n  left over from a pre-pool refactor.\n- submitGenericSorobanTx: same `server` → `pool` fix.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"70d8196de929c341a392a6ac07931dd1aabe2dc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/trees/70d8196de929c341a392a6ac07931dd1aabe2dc6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/commits/e6bebb8a156264b4ee8764774620027edea74d88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276032939?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/events{/pri