de_id":"U_kgDOEHPtqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/df07ce9136680a28c2e30ac7212fcbfb923b48b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T08:09:26Z","email":"Richardkingz2019@gmail.com","name":"Richardkingz2019"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T08:15:42Z","email":"Richardkingz2019@gmail.com","name":"Richardkingz2019"},"message":"fix: address PR review — pool lifecycle caching and non-retryable error handling\n\n- resolveSorobanRpcUrls: fall through to env/defaults when the explicit\n  rpcUrls array contains only blank entries (prevents pool exhaustion\n  when callers pass ['''', '' '']).\n- Module-level pool cache (getOrCreatePool): reuse one SorobanRpcPool\n  instance per URL set so health scores, EWMA latencies and cooldowns\n  persist across calls. Deprecate createSorobanRpcPool in favor of the\n  cached factory.\n- recordFailure: only penalize node health (score deduction + cooldown)\n  for retryable failures (429, 5xx, network errors). Record latency and\n  attempt counters for application-level errors but keep score unchanged\n  — a node that correctly reports \"unfunded account\" shouldn''t be\n  deprioritized.\n- sorobanTxHelpers: switch from inline new SorobanRpcPool(...) to the\n  shared getOrCreatePool() cache, removing duplicated config.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"a4fdbb68c0a1ee06fe0341275b05a752cab86f1a","url":"https://api.git