,"node_id":"C_kwDOT2TmttoAKDU3ZmQwNjcwMWIxMTI1MTczZjI3NTBlOGUzNGM3ZGIxODQ3ZTZhODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/81c2e5a9549531fd924fac01ae69b4eda2202ebb","sha":"81c2e5a9549531fd924fac01ae69b4eda2202ebb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/81c2e5a9549531fd924fac01ae69b4eda2202ebb"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/64dbcedb1fe7e6ac477f7e995d274b6fe3803f24","sha":"64dbcedb1fe7e6ac477f7e995d274b6fe3803f24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/64dbcedb1fe7e6ac477f7e995d274b6fe3803f24"}],"sha":"57fd06701b1125173f2750e8e34c7db1847e6a82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/57fd06701b1125173f2750e8e34c7db1847e6a82"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276032939?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Richardkingz2019","id":276032939,"login":"Richardkingz2019","node_id":"U_kgDOEHPtqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/81c2e5a9549531fd924fac01ae69b4eda2202ebb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T07:10:18Z","email":"Richardkingz2019@gmail.com","name":"Richardkingz2019"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T07:10:18Z","email":"Richardkingz2019@gmail.com","name":"Richardkingz2019"},"message":"feat: add Soroban RPC connection pool with health scoring and automatic failover (#141)\n\nIntroduce a production-grade SorobanRpcPool that manages multiple RPC\nendpoints, routes traffic to the healthiest node, and transparently\nretries on retryable errors (HTTP 429, 5xx, network failures, JSON-RPC\nserver errors, and TRY_AGAIN_LATER responses).\n\nNew files:\n- frontend/src/lib/sorobanRpcPool.ts — pool implementation with:\n  • Health scoring (0–100) and EWMA latency tracking per node\n  • Cooldown period after failures to avoid thrashing\n  • Automatic retry: retryable failures rotate to next-best node\n  • Non-retryable errors (400, simulation/contract errors) surface\n    immediately\n  • Drop-in API surface (getAccount, getLatestLedger,\n    simulateTransaction, prepareTransaction, sendTransaction,\n    getTransaction, getHealth, getNetwork)\n  • RetryableRpcError / RpcPoolExhaustedError typed exceptions\n  • checkHealth() for proactive probing\n  • onFallback / onNodeSuccess / onNodeFailure callbacks\n\n- frontend/src/lib/sorobanRpcPool.test.ts — 31 tests covering:\n  • isRetryableError classification (HTTP codes, JSON-RPC, network)\n  • Pool rotation, cooldown, health score recovery\n  • maxAttempts enforcement, TRY_AGAIN_LATER rotation\n  • RpcPoolExhaustedError when all nodes exhausted\n  • resolveSorobanRpcUrls (priority order, dedup, legacy fallback)\n  • SDK fetch-client integration tests (real fetch stubs)\n\nRefactored files:\n- frontend/src/lib/soroban.ts:\n  • Exports DEFAULT_SOROBAN_RPC_URLS (array) with legacy singleton\n    DEFAULT_SOROBAN_RPC_URL (deprecated)\n  • resolveSorobanRpcUrls(): unified resolution from explicit arrays,\n    legacy single URL, env vars (VITE_SOROBAN_RPC_URLS /\n    VITE_SOROBAN_RPC_URL), and defaults\n  • createSorobanRpcPool(): factory wiring pool with onFallback that\n    surfaces user-facing retry messages\n  • submitCreateCommitment, fetchReputationFromRpc,\n    fetchLatestLedgerAnchor all use SorobanRpcPool instead of raw\n    rpc.Server\n  • New rpcUrls option on CreateCommitmentParams, SorobanReadOptions,\n    ReputationQueryOptions (rpcUrl deprecated but still accepted)\n\n- frontend/src/lib/sorobanTxHelpers.ts:\n  • submitGenericSorobanTx uses SorobanRpcPool for all RPC operations\n  • Accepts rpcUrls alongside legacy rpcUrl\n\n- frontend/e2e/commitment-flow.spec.ts:\n  • Updated mockSorobanRpc helper to use proper XDR fixtures\n    (LedgerFootprint, SorobanResources, SorobanTransactionData)\n  • Added Freighter SUBMIT_TRANSACTION mock for signing\n  • Updated test flows to navigate to post-submit pages\n\nCloses #141\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"69dc8cd57d9c184817756fd81460258f7bb6ee57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/trees/69dc8cd57d9c184817756fd81460258f7bb6ee57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/commits/81c2e5a9549531fd924fac01ae69b4eda2202ebb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276032939?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Richardkingz2019","id":276032939,"login":"Richardkingz2019","node_id":"U_kgDOEHPtqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Richardkingz2019","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/81c2e5a9549531fd924fac01ae69b4eda2202ebb","node_id":"C_kwDOT2TmttoAKDgxYzJlNWE5NTQ5NTMxZmQ5MjRmYWMwMWFlNjliNGVkYTIyMDJlYmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/9ada5fe6324acfc8d12b9078abd83552d3b941ae","sha":"9ada5fe6324acfc8d12b9078abd83552d3b941ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/9ada5fe6324acfc8d12b9078abd83552d3b941ae"}],"sha":"81c2e5a9549531fd924fac01ae69b4eda2202ebb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/81c2e5a9549531fd924fac01ae69b4eda2202ebb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125990615?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TheWeirdDee","id":125990615,"login":"TheWeirdDee","node_id":"U_kgDOB4J21w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/c0cb94f2d000e268933d43051f9ad331d1763902/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T21:43:59Z","email":"divinenation1@gmail.com","name":"TheWeirdDee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T21:43:59Z","email":"divinenation1@gmail.com","name":"TheWeirdDee"},"message":"fix(ci): bump ZK TypeScript Cross-Check to Node 22 on PR #187\n\nzk-crosscheck ran on Node 20, which can''t execute .ts files directly --\n`node --test test/*.test.ts` failed every test file with\nERR_UNKNOWN_FILE_EXTENSION. zk/package.json requires >=22.18.0 and CI''s\nown zk-tests job (ci.yml) already runs this same package on Node 22.x\nfor exactly that reason (\"Node 22.18+ runs the package''s TypeScript\nsources directly\"). Match it here.","tree":{"sha":"54b3e111e87b02a91c4bb312b54cdfe247756c05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/trees/54b3e111e87b02a91c4bb312b54cdfe247756c05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/commits/c0cb94f2d000e268933d43051f9ad331d1763902","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125990615?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TheWeirdDee","id":125990615,"login":"TheWeirdDee","node_id":"U_kgDOB4J21w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.gith