er":{"date":"2026-08-24T21:29:58Z","email":"divinenation1@gmail.com","name":"TheWeirdDee"},"message":"fix(ci): resolve remaining failing checks on PR #187\n\n- contracts/Cargo.toml: add `fraud_verifier` to workspace.members.\n  Its Cargo.toml has no `[workspace]` table of its own, so cargo\n  refused to build it standalone (\"current package believes it''s in\n  a workspace when it''s not\"), failing Soroban Fraud Verifier (cargo\n  test), ZK TypeScript Cross-Check (cargo build --bin hash_helper),\n  and ZK Circuit Tests (crosscheck.test.ts shells out to the same\n  binary). contracts/Cargo.lock already has a fully resolved\n  pactum-fraud-verifier entry, so --locked keeps working unchanged.\n- contracts/state_channel/src/lib.rs: `cargo fmt --all -- --check`\n  was failing on an import line and two token_client.transfer(...)\n  calls exceeding rustfmt''s line width. Reformatted to match.\n- frontend/e2e/commitment-flow.spec.ts: the \"loading spinners\"\n  test checked `launchBtn.isVisible()` right after `page.reload()`.\n  isVisible() doesn''t auto-wait, so it can race to false before the\n  SPA hydrates, silently skipping the click and leaving #nav-dashboard\n  unrendered (30s timeout). The file''s own beforeEach already\n  documents this exact trap and uses click()''s auto-wait instead;\n  applied the same fix here.","tree":{"sha":"cff27c3e50d6c365564404fb4506ff6003153498","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/trees/cff27c3e50d6c365564404fb4506ff6003153498"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/commits/d304ea28189847e7ac4d14c8be9554c166c47276","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125990615?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWeirdDee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheWe