,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/62c2af8eccc23e6fabe2f7d8b9110505f3fa3774/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T12:57:25Z","email":"yunusabdulhameed1@gmail.com","name":"Yunus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T12:57:25Z","email":"yunusabdulhameed1@gmail.com","name":"Yunus"},"message":"fix(ci): repair e2e-sandbox npm ci and mocked Playwright flows\n\n- e2e-sandbox.yml: mirror Frontend Checks install (\npm ci || npm install)\n  so a bare\npm ci in the workspace subdir no longer hard-fails with\n  ''Missing: @pactum/cli@0.1.0 from lock file'' (EUSAGE).\n- mock-soroban-success.ts: simulateTransaction get_arbitrator result must be\n  an Address ScVal, not scvBool(true); otherwise fetchArbitrator throws\n  ''Unsupported address type: true'' and commitment creation errors out.\n- commitment-flow.spec.ts: freighter mock now echoes signedTransaction\n  (freighter-api v6 signTransaction reads that key), fixing the\n  ''Transaction signing was cancelled or denied'' failure; also drop the stray\n  duplicate submit click that intercepted the real wizard submit.","tree":{"sha":"96bc2b1c74b00cafd2b78b452d4785f980e7f388","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/trees/96bc2b1c74b00cafd2b78b452d4785f980e7f388"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/commits/62c2af8eccc23e6fabe2f7d8b9110505f3fa3774","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151139232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yunus-dev-codecrafter","id":151139232,"login":"yunus-dev-codecrafter","node_id":"U_kgDOCQIzoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/62c2af8eccc23e6fabe2f7d8b9110505f3fa3774","node_id":"C_kwDOT2TmttoAKDYyYzJhZjhlY2NjMjNlNmZhYmUyZjdkOGI5MTEwNTA1ZjNmYTM3NzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/6eacafc0bc3aa398335562f14ec6e368c7e9b7df","sha":"6eacafc0bc3aa398335562f14ec6e368c7e9b7df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/6eacafc0bc3aa398335562f14ec6e368c7e9b7df"}],"sha":"62c2af8eccc23e6fabe2f7d8b9110505f3fa3774","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/62c2af8eccc23e6fabe2f7d8b9110505f3fa3774"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151139232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yunus-dev-codecrafter","id":151139232,"login":"yunus-dev-codecrafter","node_id":"U_kgDOCQIzoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/6eacafc0bc3aa398335562f14ec6e368c7e9b7df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T11:30:09Z","email":"yunusabdulhameed1@gmail.com","name":"Yunus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T11:30:09Z","email":"yunusabdulhameed1@gmail.com","name":"Yunus"},"message":"fix(ci): resolve failing Frontend Checks and e2e-sandbox runs\n\nRoot causes found by reproducing the CI steps locally:\n\n1. frontend/package-lock.json was out of sync with package.json — it\n   never recorded fake-indexeddb or @toruslabs/openlogin-ed25519 (they\n   were hoisted to the monorepo root but absent from the frontend lock).\n\npm ci in the frontend working dir therefore failed/had the deps\n   missing, breaking 3 test suites (web3authDerive, localIndexer/db,\n   localIndexer/poller) and the e2e-sandbox install step. Regenerated\n   the frontend lockfile so\npm ci installs all declared deps.\n\n2. src/hooks/useCommitments.ts declared queryKey/queryFn twice in the\n   same useQuery object (TS1117) — broke\npm run build.\n\n3. e2e/sandbox/create-commitment-sandbox.spec.ts redeclared\n   const commitmentCard in one test scope — oxlint error, broke lint.\n\n4. e2e/commitment-flow.spec.ts had two malformed switch cases (a case\n   nested inside an unclosed block) — parse errors, broke lint.\n\n5. syncSession.test.ts relied on a fixed 150ms wait for async CRDT\n   convergence, which is too short under full-suite CPU load and flaked.\n   Convergence assertions now poll for state equality instead.","tree":{"sha":"4f3869bc396733ea1a0dba813e4e326a6413d6d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/trees/4f3869bc396733ea1a0dba813e4e326a6413d6d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/git/commits/6eacafc0bc3aa398335562f14ec6e368c7e9b7df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151139232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yunus-dev-codecrafter","id":151139232,"login":"yunus-dev-codecrafter","node_id":"U_kgDOCQIzoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yunus-dev-codecrafter","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/6eacafc0bc3aa398335562f14ec6e368c7e9b7df","node_id":"C_kwDOT2TmttoAKDZlYWNhZmMwYmMzYWEzOTgzMzU1NjJmMTRlYzZlMzY4YzdlOWI3ZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commit/8721437bf30840325e128b2e6e2a9ceda1038366","sha":"8721437bf30840325e128b2e6e2a9ceda1038366","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/8721437bf30840325e128b2e6e2a9ceda1038366"}],"sha":"6eacafc0bc3aa398335562f14ec6e368c7e9b7df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LynxXProtocol/Pactum/commits/6eacafc0bc3aa398335562f14ec6e368c7e9b7df"},{"author":nu