"https://github.com/kannan-santharam/kannan-portfolio/commit/0abc032b60a47dceca2b4e3520bc692613a61aad","sha":"0abc032b60a47dceca2b4e3520bc692613a61aad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kannan-santharam/kannan-portfolio/commits/0abc032b60a47dceca2b4e3520bc692613a61aad"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/kannan-santharam/kannan-portfolio/commit/fb48d8cb35b93ad7d09550707be8901a40dc4d08","sha":"fb48d8cb35b93ad7d09550707be8901a40dc4d08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kannan-santharam/kannan-portfolio/commits/fb48d8cb35b93ad7d09550707be8901a40dc4d08"}],"sha":"469ff34e655d8cd34e4cbc30510bff86044a5cb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kannan-santharam/kannan-portfolio/commits/469ff34e655d8cd34e4cbc30510bff86044a5cb3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42336714?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kannan-santharam","id":42336714,"login":"kannan-santharam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMzM2NzE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kannan-santharam/kannan-portfolio/commits/fb48d8cb35b93ad7d09550707be8901a40dc4d08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T16:00:24Z","email":"kannan.santharam4@gmail.com","name":"Kannan Appiya Santharam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T16:00:24Z","email":"kannan.santharam4@gmail.com","name":"Kannan Appiya Santharam"},"message":"feat: 3D avatar greeter and a hero that states the ask\n\nAdds a full-body 3D avatar of Kannan in the bottom right, generated from\nthe existing photo by Avaturn. It waves on arrival, blinks, holds a smile,\nfollows the cursor and can be dragged through a full 360. Clicking it\nreplays the wave; the popup beside it routes to the DocMind chat.\n\nThe raw Avaturn export is 13.5 MB, most of it 72 facial blendshapes with\nposition and normal deltas for expressions the site never plays. A local\noptimiser keeps the 8 the greeter drives, drops the morph normals and caps\ntextures at 512px, which lands the shipped model at 2.9 MB. three.js stays\nout of the main bundle behind a dynamic import that only fires after load\nand idle, so first paint is untouched; the greeter is desktop only, skipped\nunder prefers-reduced-motion, held back until the hero is scrolled past,\ndismissible for the session, and its render loop stops while the chat is\nopen.\n\nThe hero was doing the job of three screens: thirteen competing elements,\nthe same five facts stated two to four times, and the target role buried in\na 12px table row. It now leads with the ask.\n\n- The mono line states the role sought, the city, and where from\n- The summary opens on leading a team of 4 to 6, not on what was built\n- Badges down to relocation, notice and visa; contact channels are not a\n  status, and the visa wording now matches the resume\n- Three CTAs with one job each: the CV, WhatsApp, and everything else\n- Photo overlay and three of the five fact rows removed as duplicates,\n  on desktop and on mobile\n- \"Direct UAE Contact\" no longer labels an Indian number","tree":{"sha":"113534763b4583cdc9b9ca1c1165debe7a7974cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kannan-santharam/kannan-portfolio/git/trees/113534763b4583cdc9b9ca1c1165debe7a7