santharam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kannan-santharam/kannan-portfolio/commits/50be202b1fd595b635b34ba5723c23671b7c6b2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:48:42Z","email":"kannan.santharam4@gmail.com","name":"Kannan Appiya Santharam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:48:42Z","email":"kannan.santharam4@gmail.com","name":"Kannan Appiya Santharam"},"message":"feat(resume): recover lost keywords, sharpen claims, free space for a project\n\nTwo review passes scored the resume against Dubai JDs and against a human\n90-second read. The keyword screen improved sharply, but the earlier bullet\nconsolidation had quietly dropped facts and blurred two claims. This restores\nwhat was lost, tightens what was vague, and trims the duplication that was\npaying for none of it.\n\nRecovered (each verified by grep against the pre-refactor resume)\n- `30,000+ lines` of dead code, back on the performance bullet.\n- `cross-functional`, `mid-level` and `real-time`, all of which had gone to zero.\n- The freshness-vs-network tradeoff on the Apollo hooks clause: the only place\n  the resume showed engineering judgment rather than an outcome.\n- `2 days of AI-assisted engineering`, a load-bearing qualifier without which\n  the 2-days-to-hours claim overstates.\n\nClaims made precise\n- `build time` -> `dev build time`. 2 minutes to 5 seconds is a cold-start dev\n  compile; unqualified it reads as a production bundle and invites a correction\n  in interview.\n- The Playwright suite is the AI platform''s output, so `backed by` -> `producing`.\n  Stronger and unambiguous.\n- The 70% page-load metric had no home in Experience while every other\n  achievement number did; the performance bullet now leads with it.\n- Visa status was `Employer-Sponsored`, which reads to a UAE recruiter as\n  already holding a sponsored visa. Now `Sponsorship Required`.\n\nTrimmed\n- Achievements collapse to headline form. `from 2 minutes to 5 seconds` and\n  `route-level code splitting` each appeared twice word for word; now once.\n- Dropped the third repetition of the 4,000+ customer count, the Freshworks\n  add-ons bullet (folded into end-to-end delivery), a dated HTML5/CSS3 stack\n  list on a 2016 bullet, and `Git & GitHub Flow`, which is table stakes at 10.5\n  years.\n- Undid two of my own keyword inserts that read as stuffing: `scalable,\n  reusable UI SDK framework` -> `reusable UI SDK`, and `Jest & Vitest Unit\n  Testing` -> `Unit Testing (Jest, Vitest)`.\n\nSlack goes from 6.2 to 12.6 body lines, which is the room a projects section\nneeds. Site and README follow the same wording; the site visa badge had kept\nthe ambiguous phrasing.\n\nVerified: both PDFs 2 pages, 22 bullets, 4 links, every JSON string present\nverbatim in the PDFs, DOCX files and built bundle, no whitespace artefacts in\nthe copy layer, India clean of Dubai content. tsc and build clean.","tree":{"sha":"85d062e2c2b38cb688928911ef1f4baa609413ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kannan-santharam/kannan-portfolio/git/trees/85d062e2c2b38cb688928911ef1f4baa609413ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kannan-santharam/kannan-portfolio/git/commits/50be202b1fd595b635b34ba5723c23671b7c6b2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42336714?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kannan-santharam","id":42336714,"login":"kannan-santharam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMzM2NzE0","organizations_url":"htt