m/users/kannan-santharam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kannan-santharam/kannan-portfolio/commits/227c09c500434b7e1e028a430d988e597a06ceca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T05:04:30Z","email":"kannan.santharam4@gmail.com","name":"Kannan Appiya Santharam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T05:04:30Z","email":"kannan.santharam4@gmail.com","name":"Kannan Appiya Santharam"},"message":"feat: JD-aligned resume content and resume/site consistency pass\n\nResume content, rewritten against real Dubai/UAE job descriptions for Lead,\nStaff Engineer and Engineering Manager roles. Keyword matching runs on stems,\nso verbs stay in the tense a resume should use; the noun phrases are what were\naligned.\n\nResume (src/data/resumeContent.json, drives both PDFs, both DOCX and the site)\n- Headings: PROFILE -> PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY, BUSINESS IMPACT SNAPSHOT -> KEY\n  ACHIEVEMENTS. Both are parser-recognised section labels.\n- SuperOps: 12 bullets -> 8. Merged the duplicated AI test platform and\n  Playwright bullets, and the dead-code and performance bullets; folded the\n  Python MCP server into the agent tooling bullet and the UI SDK into the\n  design system bullet; dropped the mentoring bullet already covered by the\n  team bullet and the achievements section. Added a shipping bullet for\n  hands-on feature delivery, and team size, hiring, performance feedback,\n  career development and roadmap ownership for EM screens.\n- Achievements now lead with a bold phrase, use no mid-sentence colons, and\n  swap the retired dead-code line for the 70% initial page load result.\n- Skills: Full Stack Engineering first; added MySQL, Jest & Vitest,\n  Responsive Web Design and Solution Architecture & System Design; renamed\n  Agent Write-Scope Safety, Core Web Vitals, Agile Delivery and Figma MCP.\n- Dubai header carries the phone beside the relocation line, tagged\n  (WhatsApp & BOTIM); visa status reworded to Employer-Sponsored. India\n  unchanged and verified clean of Dubai content.\n\nGenerator\n- Bullet indent is anchored to the bullet run. moveCursor emits a Td measured\n  from the line start, so the jump now carries the accumulated advance:\n  bullet text and its wrapped lines share one column.\n- wrap() breaks after a hyphen when a long token will not fit, keeping both\n  halves at least four characters.\n- Achievement lead-ins render bold in the PDF and the DOCX.\n\nSite consistency\n- Removed claims the resume does not make: sole authorship of the UI SDK,\n  10.5+ years framed as leadership, \"Immediate\" relocation against a 60-day\n  notice, invented AST/sandbox vocabulary, and the mangled \"Bedrock Core\".\n- Skills matrix: dropped an unevidenced SSE entry and a duplicate streaming\n  entry; added RAG & Embedding, GitHub Copilot and Stakeholder Management.\n  Every resume competency now appears on the site.\n- Removed `level` and `hot`, unrendered since the matrix became plain text.\n- Target role is region-driven instead of hardcoded, and the printed View CV\n  now carries Languages and the nationality/visa/notice line like the PDF.\n\nPer-region metadata\n- One index.html was served at every path, so /ind advertised the Dubai copy\n  to crawlers and link previews. SEO strings moved to src/data/seo.json, read\n  by both regionContent.ts and a build plugin that stamps index.html and emits\n  ind.html; vercel.json routes /ind to it. Both pages share one bundle.\n\nVerified: both PDFs 2 pages, 24 bullets, 4 links, every JSON string present\nverbatim in the PDFs, the DOCX files and the built bundle, no whitespace or\nnon-breaking-space artefacts in the copy layer, India free of Dubai content in\ntext, metadata and raw bytes, and no cross-region metadata leak in either HTML.\ntsc and build clean.","tree":{"sha":"d0dc86ae183dff34406390738607fabb19204ed0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kannan-santharam/kannan-portfolio/git/trees/d0dc86ae183dff34406390738607fabb19204ed0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kannan-santharam/kannan-portfolio/git/commits/227c09c500434b7e1e028a430d988e597a06ceca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42336714?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kannan-santharam","id":42336714,"login":"kannan-santharam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMzM2NzE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kannan-santharam/kannan-portfolio/commit/227c09c500434b7e1e028a430d988e597a06ceca","node_id":"C_kwDOT2g0BNoAKDIyN2MwOWM1MDA0MzRiN2UxZTAyOGE0MzBkOTg4ZTU5N2EwNmNlY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kannan-santharam/kannan-portfolio/commit/47c68145527c7bb206d14bedf8378aae750c620