se,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kannan-santharam/kannan-portfolio/commits/e14584f474765c3376eb54d4ac6d51d5cfbd4fbb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T06:31:15Z","email":"kannan.santharam4@gmail.com","name":"Kannan Appiya Santharam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T06:31:15Z","email":"kannan.santharam4@gmail.com","name":"Kannan Appiya Santharam"},"message":"feat(resume): single-source resume content, 11pt rebuild, site alignment\n\nIntroduce src/data/resumeContent.json as the single source of truth for\nresume content. Both PDFs, both DOCX files and the site now derive from it,\nso a content edit lands everywhere from one place.\n\nContent (user-approved):\n- Full-stack positioning, \"enterprise SaaS\", tagline React · Node.js ·\n  AI-Native Engineering\n- Base UI design system built on customised design tokens\n- Playwright 300+ test-case, 12 monorepo packages, (Suspense), (RBAC),\n  4 to 6 mentees at SuperOps, 10+ aggregate across both employers\n- RAG & Embedding competency; drop \"Migration\" from Rspack & Webpack 5\n- Header reordered: contact, nationality, then links; phone annotation\n  dropped from the resumes only\n\nGenerators:\n- Rename build_business_resume.py to build_resume.py; add\n  build_resume_docx.py for the Word variants\n- Body font 10.5pt to 11pt with leading at 14.0; both variants still fit\n  two pages, India leakage assertions intact\n\nSite:\n- Skills matrix rebuilt as a left rail plus plain-text lists; new\n  Backend & Full Stack category\n- View CV portfolio link now region-aware instead of hardcoded to Dubai\n- Remove the footer edition badge and the contactRowsStyle field\n- Correct DocMind copy and drop fabricated code snippets","tr