uired by Freshworks, which is how the\n  Freshworks role was joined, so the timeline reads as one employer.\n\nNew business-impact resumes (Dubai and India), generated by\nscripts/build_business_resume.py:\n- Outcome-led framing with a BUSINESS IMPACT SNAPSHOT section, full-stack\n  positioning, and a short recruiter-facing summary.\n- The India variant drops all Dubai, visa and BOTIM content, uses the /ind\n  portfolio link, and states no location in the seeking line. The build\n  asserts 2 pages, correct links, and no region leakage in text or metadata.\n\nSite:\n- AI showcase gains a fourth pillar card for the design system and Figma\n  skill; grid moves to 2x2 so the code snippets stay readable.\n- Update the AI-Native metric card; drop the unused aiInitiatives array,\n  which nothing rendered.","tree":{"sha":"141d24ad74200d9485e0fa91379a86376615c77c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kannan-santharam/kannan-portfolio/git/trees/141d24ad74200d9485e0fa91379a86376615c77c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kannan-santharam/kannan-portfolio/git/commits/3f6aa77f6b951b7181b606da6c5b125d35854279","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42336714?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kannan-santharam","id":42336714,"login":"kannan-santharam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMzM2NzE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kannan-santharam/repos","site_admin":false