uhua33/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huyuhua33/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huyuhua33/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/huyuhua33","id":20833571,"login":"huyuhua33","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODMzNTcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huyuhua33/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huyuhua33/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huyuhua33/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huyuhua33/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huyuhua33/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/huyuhua33","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/INNOCO-IN/WEB---React/commits/ae62a576f5c32f7c8f131a1bbf777d83ea91f5bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T05:09:34Z","email":"hu881121@gmail.com","name":"Siganmorfu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T05:09:34Z","email":"hu881121@gmail.com","name":"Siganmorfu"},"message":"Arrange the constellation along the ME=WE loop\n\nA fourth mode beside Format, Topic and Random. The six arcs from ARCS sit on\na ring in the order the loop runs, IGNITE through GLOW, with a faint dashed\nring tying them together. Every arc is drawn even while it holds no light, so\nthe path is visible before the stories reach it. Points with no arc gather in\nthe middle as \"not on the loop yet\" instead of being guessed onto it.\n\nHand-typed spellings of the same arc (\"ME=WE\", \"ME != WE\") resolve to the one\nin ARCS, so the map never grows a seventh cluster.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f920a3551381ca2d68cf0b6ad580b42d421b749b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/INNOCO-IN/WEB---React/git/trees/f920a3551381ca2d68cf0b6ad580b42d421b749b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/INNOCO-IN/WEB---React/git/commits/ae62a576f5c32f7c8f131a1bb