ve Workers Static Assets flow used by this repo. The project is static-only, so the config now points to apps/web/out via `assets.directory` instead of the classic Pages key, and the docs explain the related deployment errors and why no Worker entry point is needed.","tree":{"sha":"5f4d6af9cdd901c69a36ec0db8c2319281426595","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/git/trees/5f4d6af9cdd901c69a36ec0db8c2319281426595"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/git/commits/17f048b41c1b37307df6cc08180b329bbad45e05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143943640?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh","id":143943640,"login":"mohithhhh","node_id":"U_kgDOCJRn2A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh/Provenance/commit/17f048b41c1b37307df6cc08180b329bbad45e05","node_id":"C_kwDOT2lIzdoAKDE3ZjA0OGI0MWMxYjM3MzA3ZGY2Y2MwODE4MGIzMjliYmFkNDVlMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh/Provenance/commit/1ff4d0686c5eff1e657de81e2173a34052122c90","sha":"1ff4d0686c5eff1e657de81e2173a34052122c90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/commits/1ff4d0686c5eff1e657de81e2173a34052122c90"}],"sha":"17f048b41c1b37307df6cc08180b329bbad45e05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/commits/17f048b41c1b37307df6cc08180b329bbad45e05"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143943640?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh","id":143943640,"login":"mohithhhh","node_id":"U_kgDOCJRn2A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/commits/1ff4d0686c5eff1e657de81e2173a34052122c90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:04:43Z","email":"143943640+mohithhhh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mohithhhh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:04:43Z","email":"143943640+mohithhhh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mohithhhh"},"message":"Add Cloudflare Pages deploy config\n\nDocument the Cloudflare Pages deploy quirk for monorepos and add the required root wrangler.jsonc so `wrangler deploy` can target the static app output. This avoids the generic Pages detection failure when the build succeeds but deploy runs from the repo root instead of a project directory. The config points at `apps/web/out` and the docs now note the required build-time environment variable and origin updates for the live frontend/backend setup.","tree":{"sha":"115058fe99aae7bbf2b5dc3db85abbf5e27951d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/git/trees/115058fe99aae7bbf2b5dc3db85abbf5e27951d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/git/commits/1ff4d0686c5eff1e657de81e2173a34052122c90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143943640?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh","id":143943640,"login":"mohithhhh","node_id":"U_kgDOCJRn2A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh/Provenance/commit/1ff4d0686c5eff1e657de81e2173a34052122c90","node_id":"C_kwDOT2lIzdoAKDFmZjRkMDY4NmM1ZWZmMWU2NTdkZTgxZTIxNzNhMzQwNTIxMjJjOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh/Provenance/commit/36edb230a2738968cb11dffe2b80000f794d333b","sha":"36edb230a2738968cb11dffe2b80000f794d333b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/commits/36edb230a2738968cb11dffe2b80000f794d333b"}],"sha":"1ff4d0686c5eff1e657de81e2173a34052122c90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/commits/1ff4d0686c5eff1e657de81e2173a34052122c90"},{