02ed640e78e16208299/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:29:03Z","email":"143943640+mohithhhh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mohithhhh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:29:03Z","email":"143943640+mohithhhh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mohithhhh"},"message":"Add Module D file provenance checks\n\nAdds Module D''s image provenance flow: backend C2PA manifest verification with the official c2pa-python SDK, EXIF metadata extraction via Pillow, and a multipart upload endpoint at /provenance/file. It also adds the /provenance web page, API client support, and fixture-backed tests covering valid, tampered, missing-manifest, and unsupported cases. The UI explicitly distinguishes cryptographic verification from the suite''s statistical detectors.","tree":{"sha":"f1a24641e7271d2b2b4fd9a913c32e1d48a1c3ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/git/trees/f1a24641e7271d2b2b4fd9a913c32e1d48a1c3ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/git/commits/4444bcf8a014b0dd5bf5402ed640e78e16208299","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143943640?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh","id":143943640,"login":"mohithhhh","node_id":"U_kgDOCJRn2A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh/Provenance/commit/4444bcf8a014b0dd5bf5402ed640e78e16208299","node_id":"C_kwDOT2lIzdoAKDQ0NDRiY2Y4YTAxNGIwZGQ1YmY1NDAyZWQ2NDBlNzhlMTYyMDgyOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh/Provenance/commit/9a15b6357c9b90e2ea64088008a87e27765aea79","sha":"9a15b6357c9b90e2ea64088008a87e27765aea79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/commits/9a15b6357c9b90e2ea64088008a87e27765aea79"}],"sha":"4444bcf8a014b0dd5bf5402ed640e78e16208299","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/commits/4444bcf8a014b0dd5bf5402ed640e78e16208299"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143943640?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh","id":143943640,"login":"mohithhhh","node_id":"U_kgDOCJRn2A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/commits/9a15b6357c9b90e2ea64088008a87e27765aea79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:06:59Z","email":"143943640+mohithhhh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mohithhhh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:06:59Z","email":"143943640+mohithhhh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mohithhhh"},"message":"Phase 5 — Module C: trained classifier + conformal calibration\n\nStylometric feature extraction (app/classifier/features.py) — sentence\nlength, lexical diversity, punctuation ratios, function-word frequency\n— feeding a logistic regression trained on HC3 (CC-BY-SA 4.0), wrapped\nin split conformal prediction so /classify/text returns a coverage-\nguaranteed interval around its AI-probability estimate instead of a\nbare percentage.\n\n- app/classifier/dataset.py: fetches HC3 via the datasets-server REST\n  API (plain JSON, no `datasets`/pyarrow dependency) and splits by\n  question id into train/calibration/test.\n- scripts/prepare_hc3.py / scripts/train_classifier.py: reproducible\n  data prep + training. Training data (data/classifier/*.csv) is\n  gitignored per project policy; the trained artifact\n  (app/classifier/artifact/model.json) is committed — small,\n  human-readable JSON, not a pickle, not the dataset itself.\n- app/routers/classify.py: POST /classify/text, verdict + AI\n  probability + conformal interval + per-feature contributions.\n- apps/web/src/app/classify: UI panel with a verdict card and a\n  feature-contribution table sorted by impact on this prediction.\n\nReal measured numbers (apps/api/data: 2315 train / 768 calibration /\n767 test): accuracy 0.814, F1 0.826, ROC-AUC 0.896; measured 90%-target\nconformal coverage 91.9%. Full report in docs/benchmark.md; method\nnotes in docs/architecture.md; honest scope caveats (HC3-specific\ncorrelations, marginal-not-per-example coverage) in\ndocs/limitations.md.\n\nAlso fixes a pre-existing bug in the documented invocation of\napps/api/scripts/*.py (they import `app.*` but were documented to run\nwithout PYTHONPATH set, which fails) — same root cause affects\ncalibrate_binoculars.py and both new scripts, fixed once in\napps/api/README.md and each script''s usage line.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"15b6765927ef3fc1c7fb5ba4b6bfe284da7d7c34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/git/trees/15b6765927ef3fc1c7fb5ba4b6bfe284da7d7c34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/git/commits/9a15b6357c9b90e2ea64088008a87e27765aea79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143943640?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh","id":143943640,"login":"mohithhhh","node_id":"U_kgDOCJRn2A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh/Provenance/commit/9a15b6357c9b90e2ea64088008a87e27765aea79","node_id":"C_kwDOT2lIzdoAKDlhMTViNjM1N2M5YjkwZTJlYTY0MDg4MDA4YTg3ZTI3NzY1YWVhNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh/Provenance/commit/eb8d79d3264f10ebf19dc95793f5242175d74749","sha":"eb8d79d3264f10ebf19dc95793f5242175d74749","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/commits/eb8d79d3264f10ebf19dc95793f5242175d74749"}],"sha":"9a15b6357c9b90e2ea64088008a87e27765aea79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/commits/9a15b6357c9b90e2ea64088008a87e27765aea79"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.gi