{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh/Provenance/commit/44ea5009e4e12ef951bed1491dbe809d3c626c5d","node_id":"C_kwDOT2lIzdoAKDQ0ZWE1MDA5ZTRlMTJlZjk1MWJlZDE0OTFkYmU4MDlkM2M2MjZjNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh/Provenance/commit/986642da789925c8cb47c869fcefd9ca3f1d9dc9","sha":"986642da789925c8cb47c869fcefd9ca3f1d9dc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/commits/986642da789925c8cb47c869fcefd9ca3f1d9dc9"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh/Provenance/commit/3c054b6e4625475770eb83c5b6c3e36dfd21de53","sha":"3c054b6e4625475770eb83c5b6c3e36dfd21de53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/commits/3c054b6e4625475770eb83c5b6c3e36dfd21de53"}],"sha":"44ea5009e4e12ef951bed1491dbe809d3c626c5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/commits/44ea5009e4e12ef951bed1491dbe809d3c626c5d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143943640?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh","id":143943640,"login":"mohithhhh","node_id":"U_kgDOCJRn2A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/commits/3c054b6e4625475770eb83c5b6c3e36dfd21de53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T19:35:09Z","email":"143943640+mohithhhh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mohithhhh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T19:35:09Z","email":"143943640+mohithhhh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mohithhhh"},"message":"Phase 3: Module F retrieval provenance ledger\n\napps/api (new — first backend module beyond the health check):\n- embeddings.py: real semantic embeddings via fastembed (ONNX Runtime,\n  BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5) instead of sentence-transformers/PyTorch —\n  same embedding quality, ~165MB installed vs. torch''s typical several\n  hundred MB to 1GB+, a disk-conscious choice given this project already\n  hit a real disk-space crunch once in Phase 0. Lazy-loaded so /health and\n  startup don''t pay the model-load cost.\n- ledger.py: SQLite-backed storage + brute-force cosine-similarity nearest\n  neighbor search — a deliberate, documented simplification appropriate at\n  demo scale (no FAISS/HNSW/pgvector needed yet). Ledger''s embed function\n  is injectable so most tests use a fast deterministic fake instead of the\n  real model.\n- routers/ledger.py: POST /ledger/log, POST /ledger/check, GET /ledger,\n  GET /ledger/stats.\n- DEFAULT_SIMILARITY_THRESHOLD = 0.85, empirically chosen from a measured\n  similarity table (exact copy 1.0, heavy paraphrase 0.94, same-topic-but-\n  different-claim 0.74, unrelated 0.36) — not guessed. That same table\n  surfaces a real, honest limitation now documented in both\n  docs/architecture.md and docs/limitations.md: a sentence asserting the\n  *opposite* of a logged claim scores 0.74, closer to \"paraphrase\" than\n  expected — this module verifies semantic proximity, not factual identity.\n- 22 tests: ledger CRUD/nearest-neighbor logic (fast, fake embeddings),\n  real-model integration tests (embedding shape, semantic separation),\n  and HTTP-level router tests, including one true end-to-end test with\n  the real model through the actual FastAPI wiring.\n\napps/web:\n- New /ledger page — Log and Check panels, recent-entries list, all\n  talking to a real backend for the first time (previous modules were\n  pure client-side). src/lib/api.ts is the fetch client, with a graceful\n  \"couldn''t reach the API, is it running?\" error path.\n- Small connective feature: a \"Log to Provenance Ledger\" button on the\n  Watermark Lab''s generate panel, tying Module A''s output into Module F.\n- Verified end-to-end in a real browser with both servers running: log →\n  paraphrase-check matches (99.4% similarity), unrelated text correctly\n  doesn''t match, zero console errors.\n\nCI: caches ~/.cache/huggingface so repeat runs don''t re-download the\nembedding model. pyproject.toml ignores ruff''s B008 (Depends-as-default is\nFastAPI''s idiomatic DI pattern, not the footgun that check exists for).\n\nREADME/docs updated: Phase 3 checkbox, Module F architecture section,\napps/api/README''s setup notes (network needed on first ledger call to\ndownload the model; sentence-transformers reference corrected to fastembed).\n\nAll checks pass: format/lint/typecheck/test/build across every TS\nworkspace (77 tests), ruff/mypy/pytest for apps/api (22 tests).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a4bbfb4a65994c5d402b309b70de244d6a57eb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/git/trees/1a4bbfb4a65994c5d402b309b70de244d6a57eb5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/git/commits/3c054b6e4625475770eb83c5b6c3e36dfd21de53","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143943640?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh","id":143943640,"login":"mohithhhh","node_id":"U_kgDOCJRn2A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh/Provenance/commit/3c054b6e4625475770eb83c5b6c3e36dfd21de53","node_id":"C_kwDOT2lIzdoAKDNjMDU0YjZlNDYyNTQ3NTc3MGViODNjNWI2YzNlMzZkZmQyMWRlNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh/Provenance/commit/f55787f2dac1ad54a059da61acf1a1b5ed0b8169","sha":"f55787f2dac1ad54a059da61acf1a1b5ed0b8169","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/commits/f55787f2dac1ad54a059da61acf1a1b5ed0b8169"}],"sha":"3c054b6e4625475770eb83c5b6c3e36dfd21de53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/commits/3c054b6e4625475770eb83c5b6c3e36dfd21de53"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143943640?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/