53258a8573973de2ec4647fc46f7d9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143943640?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh","id":143943640,"login":"mohithhhh","node_id":"U_kgDOCJRn2A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/commits/961c3046cff79a4ddf9887a33503fd0a385c1928/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T15:21:33Z","email":"143943640+mohithhhh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mohithhhh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T15:21:33Z","email":"143943640+mohithhhh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mohithhhh"},"message":"Phase 0: monorepo scaffold\n\n- npm workspaces root (apps/web, packages/*) with shared tsconfig.base,\n  ESLint flat config per package, Prettier\n- apps/web: Next.js 16 + TypeScript + Tailwind (create-next-app), wired\n  to import from @provenance/watermark-core to prove workspace linking\n- packages/watermark-core: empty TS package scaffold (Vitest-tested),\n  real port of the green-list/z-test logic from reference/watermark-lab.html\n  lands in Phase 1\n- apps/api: FastAPI skeleton with /health endpoint, pytest, ruff, mypy;\n  pinned to Python 3.11 venv (not the system''s newer Python) since\n  torch/transformers wheels for Phase 4+ lag brand-new Python releases\n- docker-compose.yml for local dev (api + web), config-validated\n- GitHub Actions CI: format check, lint, typecheck, test for both the\n  TS workspaces and the Python API, gated on every PR\n- README with disclaimers restated up front; docs/{architecture,\n  limitations, dataset, benchmark}.md stubs, with docs/limitations.md\n  already covering the base-model blind spot and Module F''s scope limit\n- reference/README.md placeholder describing the expected\n  watermark-lab.html prototype file, not yet added to the repo\n\nAll checks pass locally: npm run format:check / lint / typecheck / test\n/ build (web + watermark-core), and ruff / mypy / pytest (api).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"62714691bc6b74ebb3788142b5fed74294b91030","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/git/trees/62714691bc6b74ebb3788142b5fed74294b91030"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohithhhh/Provenance/git/commits/961c3046cff79a4ddf9887a33503fd0a385c1928","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143943640?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mohithhhh","id":143943640,"login":"mohithhhh","node_id":"U_kgDOCJRn2A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mohithhhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/use