@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"pools: one pre-4.7 warning from the exposed orchestrator version\n\nThe passive probe reads the version orchestrator v4.7 exposes on\n__NF_ORCHESTRATOR__.storage.__NATIVE_FEDERATION__ (native-federation/\norchestrator#86), data properties only; `get` is never called. It lands\nas optional runtime.orchestratorVersion and provenance.orchestratorVersion.\n\nThe Pools tab warns once, at the top, when that version is below 4.7.0,\nor when none is exposed and no pool carries a stored poolName. Fields no\nlonger say \"unknown\": a copy without a stored cause reads \"(own copy)\".","tree":{"sha":"4ccddd8692aa2e7649c4e1b1cb733d4439b610b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lutzleonhardt/native-federation-devtools/git/trees/4ccddd8692aa2e7649c4e1b1cb733d4439b610b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lutzleonhardt/native-federation-devtools/git/commits/f9066fcc59952f6fc66480fd9a1f9ace982d320d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lutzleonhardt/native-federation-devtools/commit/f9066fcc59952f6fc66480fd9a1f9ace982d320d","node_id":"C_kwDOT2m7gtoAKGY5MDY2ZmNjNTk5NTJmNmZjNjY0ODBmZDlhMWY5YWNlOTgyZDMyMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lutzleonhardt/native-federation-devtools/commit/e07f4f949d5642dba531988d08bddb1e45fb5254","sha":"e07f4f949d5642dba531988d08bddb1e45fb5254","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lutzleonhardt/native-federation-devtools/commits/e07f4f949d5642dba531988d08bddb1e45fb5254"}],"sha":"f9066fcc59952f6fc66480fd9a1f9ace982d320d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lutzleonhardt/native-federation-devtools/commits/f9066fcc59952f6fc66480fd9a1f9ace982d320d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lutzleonhardt/native-federation-devtools/commits/e07f4f949d5642dba531988d08bddb1e45fb5254/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:59:32Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:59:32Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"pools: read orchestrator v4.7 poolName and poolCause\n\nThe collector keeps SharedExternal.poolName and SharedVersionMeta.poolCause\n(native-federation/orchestrator#87). A pool''s card takes its name from the\nstored poolName (the pool ID still keys on the first member), own-copy\ncells carry a short cause label, and outcome lines a brief reason: a\nversion conflict names the package, its range and the shared tag.\n\nPools recorded before v4.7 keep the first-member name, read their\nreasons as unknown and carry one note saying so.","tree":{"sha":"a92f7432b164507664e628051e64a52a61f167a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lutzleonhardt/native-federation-devtools/git/trees/a92f7432b164507664e628051e64a52a61f167a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lutzleonhardt/native-federation-devtools/git/commits/e07f4f949d5642dba531988d08bddb1e45fb5254","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user