","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"feat(ui): show the runtime storage source and flag custom adapters\n\nThe capture strip names non-default runtime sources (web storage, custom\nnamespace), marks descriptor-less web storage as possibly stale, and warns\non unsupported custom storage adapters. Adds four synthetic storage\nfixtures; PRIVACY.md, README and DEVELOPMENT.md document the storage read.","tree":{"sha":"fbe89f17072b82d319c97f9560d1544664ee1488","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lutzleonhardt/native-federation-devtools/git/trees/fbe89f17072b82d319c97f9560d1544664ee1488"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lutzleonhardt/native-federation-devtools/git/commits/3688436b4d5bf4381bfb26ad977832f175c80d4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lutzleonhardt/native-federation-devtools/commit/3688436b4d5bf4381bfb26ad977832f175c80d4b","node_id":"C_kwDOT2m7gtoAKDM2ODg0MzZiNGQ1Y