ly-sans-serif. Jost\nstays the heading font.\n\nAdd vendor/icons/lucide/ with the first five icons in use, redraw the\nmenu caret and copy-button icons in docs/components.md using real\nLucide path data instead of the previous hand-drawn approximations,\nand document the new \"one icon, three places\" convention (header\n.app-icon, favicon, marin-os/catalog.json).\n\nAlso fixes SYNCING.md''s stale marinappsbrand references and adds the\nnew vendor files to its bundle list.","tree":{"sha":"795363ec08e966e6913682cf8de74c4d5c9e91c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marincountygov/marin-ui/git/trees/795363ec08e966e6913682cf8de74c4d5c9e91c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marincountygov/marin-ui/git/commits/e1bb2a2f9ed179e153d883812d2b4b35e2335f18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1569463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukefretwell/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukefretwell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukefretwell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukefretwell/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lukefretwell","id":1569463,"login":"lukefretwell","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1Njk0NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukefretwell/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukefretwell/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukefretwell/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukefretwell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukefretwell/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukefretwell","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marincountygov/marin-ui/commit/e1bb2a2f9ed179e153d883812d2b4b35e2335f18","node_id":"C_kwDOT2nxK9oAKGUxYmIyYT