/users/lukefretwell/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukefretwell/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukefretwell/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukefretwell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukefretwell/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukefretwell","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marincountygov/marin-ui/commits/e97e833f1f3f2b1abd21e9b269000a4aee8ae6cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T00:04:59Z","email":"luke@lukefretwell.com","name":"Luke Fretwell"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T00:04:59Z","email":"luke@lukefretwell.com","name":"Luke Fretwell"},"message":"Add Docs shell v2, sortable/copy/share behaviors, and dynamic MarinOS banner menu\n\n- Promote the ~90-line header/footer/title-area foundation that marindocs\n  and marin-expense each independently duplicated (site-header, doc-title,\n  doc-description, doc-actions, toc, etc.) into shared/app-brand.css, and\n  rewrite templates/docs/index.html to match it, since it''s the pattern\n  real MarinOS documentation products actually use.\n- Add generic sortable-table-column, copy-to-clipboard, and Share-button\n  behaviors to app-shell.js, promoted out of marin-expense''s page-specific\n  implementations.\n- Add the doc-updated class (styling only; each consumer keeps its own\n  date-sync tooling).\n- Make the MarinOS banner menu refresh itself from marinos/catalog.json at\n  runtime (cached in localStorage, versioned cache key, static-link\n  fallback on any failure) instead of every app hardcoding the same list.\n  Renders each entry''s icon field, verified byte-identical to the prior\n  static markup.\n\nBRAND_VERSION 1.4.2 -> 1.7.2, see CHANGELOG.md for the version-by-version\nbreakdown.","tree":{"sha":"b2edf466b94bd501310c790dae516ad53536d1fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m