llowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/LexTime/commits/0ae04bb2f4307fd8617bc82e722798db19004d0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T08:08:02Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T08:08:02Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"message":"feat: link the sign-in card to the quickstart instead of a hardcoded token\n\nAsked to add a specific dev JWT as a hardcoded \"demo access key\" on the\nsign-in page. Declined that exact ask and did this instead, for two\nreasons surfaced and confirmed with the user before writing any code:\n\n- That token''s own nbf/exp window (7 days) was already closing --\n  hardcoded, it would have stopped working within hours.\n- This repo already treats dev tokens as credential material, not\n  something to commit: docs/agent-log.md records a prior session\n  refusing to mint one for exactly this reason. Baking one into a\n  page that ships in git history doesn''t fit that precedent.\n\nAdded a plain-language link from the sign-in card to the repo''s own\ntwo-command quickstart, which prints a fresh token per run -- no\ncredential ever enters source control, and it doesn''t go stale.\n\nStyled as the app''s first inline text link. There was no precedent for\none (global a{color:inherit}, zero underline, the only prior <a> is the\nvisually-hidden skip-link) -- .muted a reuses the row-select idiom\nalready in the file: navy-900, transparent underline, revealed on\nhover/focus-visible.\n\nVerified: tsc --noEmit, next build, and live -- the link resolves to\nthe real quickstart, computed color matches --navy-900, and the\nunderline reveals on hover (confirmed via computed style, not just\nvisually).","tree":{"sha":"6fb02bda90e16f0fa9908d58ee2be9ae70e16d5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/LexTime/git/trees/6fb02bda90e16f0fa9908d58ee2be9ae70e16d5e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/LexTime/git/commits/0ae04bb2f4307fd8617bc82e722798db19004d0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/LexTime/commit/0ae04bb2f4307fd8617bc82e722798db19004d0b","node_id":"C_kwDOT2sdDNoAKDBhZTA0YmIyZjQzMDdmZDg