pi.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/LexTime/commits/a8299112d0ac0233c590e21214af7422013c64f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T10:53:10Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T10:53:10Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"message":"Permit a thin operations UI now that the API is complete.\n\nThe blanket frontend exclusion was the right call while the API was unfinished. A half-finished React app is still out of scope; a bounded consumer of the finished endpoints is not.","tree":{"sha":"1032b45cadc2627d13a57288779c1fb4900b99a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/LexTime/git/trees/1032b45cadc2627d13a57288779c1fb4900b99a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/LexTime/git/commits/a8299112d0ac0233c590e21214af7422013c64f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/LexTime/commit/a8299112d0ac0233c590e21214af7422013c64f7","node_id":"C_kwDOT2sdDNoAKGE4Mjk5MTEyZDBhYzAyMzNjNTkwZTIxMjE0YWY3NDIyMDEzYzY0Zjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/LexTime/commit/a3cd9bc34264c75f70528c113207fa471db631a1","sha":"a3cd9bc34264c75f70528c113207fa471db631a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/LexTime/commits/a3cd9bc34264c75f70528c113207fa471db631a1"}],"sha":"a8299112d0ac0233c590e21214af7422013c64f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/LexTime/commits/a8299112d0ac0233c590e21214af7422013c64f7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/LexTime/commits/a3cd9bc34264c75f70528c113207fa471db631a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T16:35:24Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T16:35:24Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"message":"docs: add CLAUDE.md, the agent operating guide (PRD section 6.10)\n\nOverdue. PRD section 6.10 makes it a done criterion and section 5 lists it\nfirst in the repository layout, and it has been absent through all six features\n- nothing caught it because no test or gate covers a documentation artefact.\n\nDeliberately not a restatement of the constitution. It points at the two\ndocuments that hold the rules, then records what this repository has actually\ncost to get wrong: the traps distilled from 25 agent-log entries, each one a\ncase that produced a confident wrong answer rather than an error.\n\nThe largest section is that list, because it is the part a fresh agent cannot\nderive. Incremental builds reporting success they have not earned, three times.\nPowerShell''s working directory not persisting between calls. GO in a\nprogrammability file. DENSE_RANK returning bigint. Statistics messages arriving\nafter the final result set, so a reader disposed early reports zero logical\nreads with nothing failing. Boundary values that trip a different rule first.\n\nAlso fixes what must not change without an amendment - the seed constants,\nthe published performance figures, the hand-computed rollup expectations, the\nduplicated database constraints - and carries the known open items so they are\nnot rediscovered.\n\nEvery factual claim was checked against the repository rather than recalled:\nentry numbers, suppression counts, the project-reference count, and the seed\nconstants. The first draft said \"four suppressions\" in a CA2100 paragraph when\nthree of the four are in src and one is in tests; corrected.\n\nGovernance commit on main under P22.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9832c1c708eeddcea589d2bbabd5069d1840e9e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/LexTime/git/trees/9832c1c708eeddcea589d2bbabd5069d1840e9e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/LexTime/git/commits/a3cd9bc34264c75f70528c113207fa471db631a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4