se,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/LexTime/commit/85964d36c1884499c991cdc79f1a14ef63a0b23e","node_id":"C_kwDOT2sdDNoAKDg1OTY0ZDM2YzE4ODQ0OTljOTkxY2RjNzlmMWExNGVmNjNhMGIyM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/LexTime/commit/56c19608135baeb6fb476cd7443742f0c8eeb3d4","sha":"56c19608135baeb6fb476cd7443742f0c8eeb3d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/LexTime/commits/56c19608135baeb6fb476cd7443742f0c8eeb3d4"}],"sha":"85964d36c1884499c991cdc79f1a14ef63a0b23e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/LexTime/commits/85964d36c1884499c991cdc79f1a14ef63a0b23e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/LexTime/commits/56c19608135baeb6fb476cd7443742f0c8eeb3d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T19:16:27Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T19:16:27Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"message":"docs: add README and MIT licence, pin SDK, realign PRD\n\nPins the SDK to 9.0.317 via global.json with rollForward latestFeature - the\nauthoring machine also has 10.0.302 and was picking it silently. latestFeature\nrather than disable so a reviewer on any 9.0.x still satisfies the cold-start\ncriterion.\n\nPRD realigned with constitution v2.0.0: section 5 rewritten for four projects,\nsection 2.2 records MediatR and AutoMapper as out of scope with the verified\nlicensing (MediatR commercial from v13.0.0 and requiring a runtime licence key,\nAutoMapper from v15.0.0), the StyleCop row rewritten now that mandatory doc\ncomments are wanted, budget raised to 3-4 evenings, and the claim that sixteen\nendpoints generate \"in close to one pass\" removed - it stopped being true when\neach endpoint gained a handler class.\n\nREADME documents the two-command quickstart, the EF-Core-vs-stored-procedure\nsplit, the quality and documentation gate, the trade-offs, and four concrete\nthings the agent got wrong while building this. Performance numbers are left as\nvisible placeholders rather than filled with plausible figures.\n\nAlso commits the Spec Kit scaffolding and the .NET gitignore.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d9b317523bf4c44a35d818f55e78afb6335c366","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/LexTime/git/trees/8d9b317523bf4c44a35d818f55e78afb6335c366"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/LexTime/git/commits/56c19608135baeb6fb476cd7443742f0c8eeb3d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/LexTime/commit/56c19608135baeb6fb476cd7443742f0c8eeb3d4","node_id":"C_kwDOT2sdDNoAKDU2YzE5NjA4MTM1YmFlYjZmYjQ3NmNkNzQ0Mzc0MmYwYzhlZWIzZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel/LexTime/commit/03b4a6a748f756de74926a79af7b967ee7592f18","sha":"03b4a6a748f756de74926a79af7b967ee7592f18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/LexTime/commits/03b4a6a748f756de74926a79af7b967ee7592f18"}],"sha":"56c19608135baeb6fb476cd7443742f0c8eeb3d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/LexTime/commits/56c19608135baeb6fb476cd7443742f0c8eeb3d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/601607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TiredRebel","id":601607,"login":"TiredRebel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTYwNw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TiredRebel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TiredRebel/LexTime/commits/03b4a6a748f756de74926a79af7b967ee7592f18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T19:16:09Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T19:16:09Z","email":"dlsaus@gmail.com","name":"TiredRebel"},"message":"docs: amend constitution to v2.0.0\n\nReason: adopt clean-architecture layering and add the process, quality and\ndocumentation rules agreed this session.\n\nMAJOR because P4 is redefined: \"Three projects. No more.\" becomes \"Four\nprojects, layered, with dependencies pointing inward\", and the clause barring\nabstractions until a second implementation exists is dropped. The bans on\nMediatR, AutoMapper and a generic repository over DbSet<T> remain in force.\n\nFolds in the unreleased v1.1.0, which added P21 (composition roots are\nextension methods), P22 (branch per spec), P23 (reproducible quality gate) and\nP24 (security review on auth and SQL commits). v1.1.0 was never committed, so\nit has no dedicated commit of its own; noted in the Sync Impact Report rather\nthan implying the amendment clause was satisfied for both.\n\nAlso adds P25: everything documented in XML doc comments, enforced by\nGenerateDocumentationFile + CS1591 + --warnaserror, with comments that restate\ntheir signature treated as defects. P3 retitled \"Fits in three evenings\" to\n\"One evening per spec\" - its rule always capped a spec, not the project, and\nthe old title contradicted the revised PRD budget.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5cfc84f9136428d70dccd8223c54b5c334647709","url":"https://api.gith