,"email":"calin.sandu.94@gmail.com","name":"The-Fool-cmd"},"message":"Add NOTICE.md with third-party attribution and license scope\n\nThe repo redistributes two sets of third-party files whose notices were\nmissing: the Home Assistant Voice PE YAML configs (ESPHome, MIT - the\ncopyright and permission notice must be retained) and the Voice PE sound\nassets (CC BY 4.0, Clayton Charles Tapp).\n\nAlso documents training-data provenance for the .tflite weights, which\nare a derived work of LibriTTS-R, the MIT RIR survey, AudioSet, FMA and\nthe CHiME6/DiPCo-derived feature sets, and scopes the top-level GPL-3.0\nto this repo''s own work.","tree":{"sha":"2ef143cd9eded96dbed8e39c0c75e96cedfa0381","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/The-Fool-cmd/Meridian-wake-word/git/trees/2ef143cd9eded96dbed8e39c0c75e96cedfa0381"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/The-Fool-cmd/Meridian-wake-word/git/commits/54aa8840fd93bd2445ce2d3a1b5232b3ff9d7890","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/183977343?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Fool-cmd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Fool-cmd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Fool-cmd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Fool-cmd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/The-Fool-cmd","id":183977343,"login":"The-Fool-cmd","node_id":"U_kgDOCvdFfw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Fool-cmd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Fool-cmd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Fool-cmd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Fool-cmd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-Fool-cmd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/The-F