/api.github.com/users/NarakCODE/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NarakCODE/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NarakCODE/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NarakCODE/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NarakCODE/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NarakCODE","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NarakCODE/pos-client/commits/e78d383cb570ea32fc7419f824f1036a5fc4045f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T14:26:00Z","email":"channarakluy@gmail.com","name":"NarakCODE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T14:26:00Z","email":"channarakluy@gmail.com","name":"NarakCODE"},"message":"feat: add employee management dialogs for leave, suspension, termination, transfer, and unlocking POS access\n\n- Implemented SetOnLeaveDialog for managing employee leave periods with access control options.\n- Created SuspendEmployeeDialog to handle employee suspensions with effective date and reason selection.\n- Developed TerminateEmployeeDialog for terminating employment with operational warnings and confirmation.\n- Added TransferBranchDialog for transferring employees between branches with role and access options.\n- Introduced UnlockPosAccessDialog to unlock POS access with options for resetting PIN and revoking sessions.\n- Established a global dialog store using Zustand for managing dialog states across the application.\n- Integrated MSW for mocking API responses during development.\n- Documented domain structure, issue tracking conventions, and triage labels for better project management.","tree":{"sha":"42587ffff596e23e8ff293d06f435314e275879e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NarakCODE/pos-client/git/trees/42587ffff596e23e8ff293d06f435314e275879e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NarakCODE/pos-client/git/commits/e78d383cb570ea32fc7419f824f1036a5fc4045f","verification":{"pay