mit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T17:15:47Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T17:15:47Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"message":"feat(users): serve /users/stats/filtered with role filters\n\nroles, channel_roles and team_roles are applyMultiRoleFilters in\nSqlUserStore.Count: Go''s seven-way switch resolved into bind lists so one\nstatic query carries it. A name outside the switch filters nothing;\nsystem_user is an equality, the other system roles ILIKE; the admin\npredicates exclude system admins. channel_roles beside in_team names an\nalias Go never joined — its 500, measured and reproduced.\n\nparity::users_stats_filtered::the_role_filters_answer_as_go_does replaces\nthe forward guard (21 queries on a fresh team, team-scoped comparisons).\nMutations: 9 run, 7 caught, 2 controls survived.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2f157a4280a25e2297226bad024dd91bdba392c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/trees/f2f157a4280a25e2297226bad024dd91bdba392c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/commits/8710a96676d3c48df72beae81343514d187acacd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.c