ail":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:12:35Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"message":"feat(teams): serve the four team reads for a view-restricted caller\n\ngetTeamStats, getTeamMember, getTeamMembers and getTeamMembersByIds no longer\nforward a caller without view_members. The team store''s GetMembers,\nGetMembersByIds and both member counts apply applyTeamMemberViewRestrictions-\nFilter as an EXISTS per list (the counts are count(DISTINCT), so the ForStats\njoins never multiply); getTeamMember runs UserCanSeeOtherUser.\n\nA restricted sort=Username is Go''s 500 — the filter''s DISTINCT meets an ORDER\nBY column the select lacks — except for a caller with both lists empty, whose\n`1 = 0` returns before the DISTINCT: measured with a guest in no channel.\n\nMutations: 9 run, 7 caught, 2 controls survived.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a9ea31339ff993f9332cc75d4027dcd98dd6522e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/trees/a9ea31339ff993f9332cc75d4027dcd98dd6522e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/commits/e3e77b1d849c60518a127a8c9bf475aa31905ae0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/e3e77b1d849c60518a127a8c9bf475aa31905ae0","node_id":"C_kwDOT3fvHtoAKGUzZTc3YjFkODQ5YzYwNTE4YTEyN2E4YzliZjQ3NWFhMzE5MDVhZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/92221b025edb2600b8e01426766c0af44588a58f","sha":"92221b025edb2600b8e01426766c0af44588a58f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/92221b025edb2600b8e01426766c0af44588a58f"}],"sha":"e3e77b1d849c60518a127a8c9bf475aa31905ae0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/e3e77b1d849c60518a127a8c9bf475aa31905ae0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/92221b025edb2600b8e01426766c0af44588a58f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T15:08:09Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T15:08:09Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"message":"feat(plugin): a plugin''s GetUsers with view restrictions — D-1030 narrowed\n\nGetUsersFromProfiles passes the options'' ViewRestrictions to GetAllProfiles.\nGob omits zero values, so a plugin''s both-empty restrictions reach Go as nil\n(every user, never `1 = 0`); plugin_view_restrictions maps them to None.\nRole filters, update_at_asc and UpdatedAfter remain D-1030''s.\n\nThe recorder''s users tour asks four restriction shapes under both hosts, and\nGo''s answers are asserted to succeed and to leave somebody out.\nMutations: 6 run, 4 caught, 2 controls survived.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f90a14e672252642c1d14e7f3feacafcaed14bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/trees/8f90a14e672252642c1d14e7f3feacafcaed14bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/commits/92221b025edb2600b8e01426766c0af44588a58f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https