name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"message":"feat(users): serve GET /users for a view-restricted caller\n\nGetAllProfiles, GetProfiles, GetProfilesNotInChannel and GetProfilesNotInTeam\ntake view restrictions and apply the distinct filter; the in-team and\nnot-in-team etags end in restrictions.Hash(). The in-channel arm stays\nunfiltered: Go''s GetProfilesInChannel has no restriction filter. localGetUsers\npasses none.\n\nThe first mutation run left three arms'' filters unseen: every member with a\nchannel shared town-square with the callers, and not_in_team named a team\nnone could view, so that arm was a 403 on both servers. The fixture now\nhas a user in an unshared channel and asks about the callers'' own team.\n\nparity::view_restricted_lookups::a_restricted_callers_searches_and_lists_are_gos.\nMutations: 8 run, 6 caught, 2 controls survived.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"05c87a3031db6725b525dc9450ecb35ac0c9ee93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/trees/05c87a3031db6725b525dc9450ecb35ac0c9ee93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/commits/483e2a2e1705f60b6e76c29bcb16c1908a3bf454","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_u