app::command_join`), and with it JoinChannel''s UserHasJoinedChannel; the\n  execute route no longer forwards under the Rust host for a Go plugin directory it cannot see.\n- Channel guards: RegisterChannelGuard/UnregisterChannelGuard, the store writes, and Go''s cache\n  with its single-flight backoff retry while this process hosts the plugins.\n- OnWebSocketConnect, WebSocketMessageHasBeenPosted and OnWebSocketDisconnect from the socket, in\n  Go''s order, with `remote_addr` as GetIPAddress.\n- The plugin driver''s pool: MaxOpenConns with the QueryTimeout wait, MaxIdleConns, both lifetimes.\n\nParity: the notification/join/guard/websocket tour in parity::plugin_hooks,\nparity::command_dispatch::the_join_command_answers_as_go_does, and parity::plugin_driver''s pool\nsteps. D-811 now lists what still keeps MMRS_PLUGIN_HOST at `go`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44780b3c767ef440b6d344ece87b4cb9a0ebd63d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/trees/44780b3c767ef440b6d344ece87b4cb9a0ebd63d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/commits/9ef4dad016bed2fe940384701d9e5556e547b16e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"st