/mattermost-rs/commit/ef37f3fc33e4f45b2c930ac8dfaf46fe40525d6b","sha":"ef37f3fc33e4f45b2c930ac8dfaf46fe40525d6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/ef37f3fc33e4f45b2c930ac8dfaf46fe40525d6b"}],"sha":"1e1bc2a8dfe51fb2844d37fd6d422b90035be4c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/1e1bc2a8dfe51fb2844d37fd6d422b90035be4c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/ef37f3fc33e4f45b2c930ac8dfaf46fe40525d6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:20:10Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:20:10Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"message":"feat(plugin): the plugin API''s command, plugin, upload, icon, typing, toast, push and cluster twenty-eight — 204 of 258\n\nPhase 6''s next tranche (mm_app::plugin_api::server), each method over the\napp function a REST route already uses:\n\n- commands: CreateCommand (no creator, this plugin as owner, the unexported\n  createCommand — no EnableCommands gate: App::create_command_ungated),\n  GetCommand (the store''s own error text), UpdateCommand (Go''s merge: the\n  plugin''s creator kept, the stored team only when none was sent — so a\n  command sent with a creator fails IsValid, as Go''s does), DeleteCommand\n  (any id succeeds);\n- plugins: GetPlugins, GetPluginStatus, EnablePlugin, DisablePlugin,\n  RemovePlugin;\n- uploads: CreateUploadSession, GetUploadSession;\n- icons and images: GetTeamIcon, SetTeamIcon (App::set_team_icon_from_file,\n  new: the profile pipeline''s decode/upright/FillCenter/PNG, byte-identical\n  to Go''s encoder), RemoveTeamIcon, SetProfileImage\n  (App::set_profile_image_from_file, split out: no checkImageLimits);\n- PublishUserTyping, SendToastMessage (mm_app::toast, new),\n  SendPushNotification, AddUserToChannel (the requestor named in the system\n  post), GetChannelOfType, RestoreChannel, CreateTeamMembersGracefully;\n- PublishPluginClusterEvent and RegisterCollectionAndTopic (nil, as with no\n  cluster), GetLDAPUserAttributes (the nil interface''s 501),\n  RequestTrialLicense (its refusals; the licence server''s request answers\n  not-implemented), LogAuditRec and LogAuditRecWithLevel (no audit log is\n  kept: D-1330).\n\nparity::plugin_hooks::the_plugin_api_server_methods_answer_as_go_answers runs\nexamples/recorder/server.rs (61 calls) inside MessageWillBePosted under both\nhosts from the same planted rows and compares every answer, hook and frame;\nthe team-icon and profile-image bytes match.\n\nTests: mm-app lib, mm-plugin example build; the tranche passes. Full parity:\n4840 passed, 10 failed — seven pass alone; manualtest (no EnableTesting\noracle) and site_url_test''s ping fail on main too; email_send''s mention\nemail is intermittent on main as well (1 of 3 runs fails at e13bc351, the\nstale FeedbackName). Mutations (scripts/mutations/plugin-api-server.plan):\n11 run, 9 caught, 2 controls survived.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"476f2a2736a980bba2444dbf30f53a096d569f22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/trees/476f2a2736a980bba2444dbf30f53a096d569f22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/commits/ef37f3fc33e4f45b2c930ac8dfaf46fe40525d6b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/ef37f3fc33e4f45b2c930ac8dfaf46fe40525d6b","node_id":"C_kwDOT3fvHtoAKGVmMzdmM2ZjMzNlNGY0NWIyYzkzMGFjOGRmYWY0NmZlNDA1MjVkNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/e13bc351e472eef13c69c52e7e2f9052de76fc1c","sha":"e13bc351e472eef13c69c52e7e2f9052de76fc1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/e13bc351e472eef13c69c52e7e2f9052de76fc1c"}],"sha":"ef37f3fc33e4f45b2c930ac8dfaf46fe40525d6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/ef37f3fc33e4f45b2c930ac8dfaf46fe40525d6b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubus