ns and notify_expiring_access_tokens workers — D-804\n\ncleanupExpired''s batches (tell the owner, then delete the tokens and their sessions, then clear the\nsession caches) and the 7/3/1-day expiry warnings, each a DM from the system bot in the owner''s\nlocale; the four UserAccessToken store methods they need; i18n::init_from_dir so an in-process App\nbeside the stack renders the notices. Both compared against Go''s workers row for row.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4844b5b5a8b4d4f951c24151c4a793bc1f89832d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/trees/4844b5b5a8b4d4f951c24151c4a793bc1f89832d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/commits/3bcff55d9a65594fb6b1809e9e672c9998ac65f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/3bcff55d9a65594fb6b1809e9e672c9998ac65f2","node_id":"C_kwDOT3fvHtoAKDNiY2ZmNTVkOWE2NTU5NGZiNmIxODA5ZTllNjcyYzk5OThhYzY1ZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/0212832ef540e590722c529e0667ecc1ca8a5215","sha":"0212832ef540e590722c529e0667ecc1ca8a5215","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/0212832ef540e590722c529e0667ecc1ca8a5215"}],"sha":"3bcff55d9a65594fb6b1809e9e672c9998ac65f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/3bcff55d9a65594fb6b1809e9e672c9998ac65f2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/d1ed843476aa5a1b3ad3cda10c726acdd3b092b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T02:40:46Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T02:40:46Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"message":"feat(jobs): product_notices and install_plugin_notify_admin workers; SendNotifyAdminPosts served\n\n- product_notices: worker (UpdateProductNotices) and its scheduler (NoticesFetchFrequency, no\n  jitter).\n- The notify-admin send is ported: DoCheckForAdminNotifications, SendNotifyAdminPosts\n  (cool-off from Systems and MM_NOTIFY_ADMIN_COOL_OFF_DAYS, admins by role with deactivated ones\n  included, grouping by user/feature/plugin, the translated custom_up_notification post from the\n  system bot through CreatePost), FinishSendAdminNotifyPost; store Get/Update/DeleteBefore.\n  install_plugin_notify_admin gets its worker and 24-hour scheduler, and\n  POST /users/trigger-notify-admin-posts is served instead of forwarded.\n- upgrade/trial notify-admin (isEnabled is the start-up licence''s Cloud feature, which a\n  SimpleWorker cannot read) and resend_invitation_email (its DoJob never claims) are recorded as\n  D-1321 and D-1322.\n\nparity::notify_jobs runs each job on the stack''s Go and on a second mm-api with workers on, and\ncompares the rows, the post, the Systems stamp, the posted event and the job row. Job tests hold\ncommon::JOB_RUNS (a job server claims every type it knows), and the NotifyAdmin and notice-view\nsuites share locks with them. A job server writes its log to a file so a test can prove which\nserver ran the job.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d35609e51b9ff5fe220f3af4bfbdabe1565d8be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/trees/9d35609e51b9ff5fe220f3af4bfbdabe1565d8be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/commits/d1ed843476aa5a1b3ad3cda10c726acdd3b092b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"