ikhil Ranjan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T02:15:52Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"message":"Merge branch ''wt/mig-plugin-driver'': the plugin database Driver, 20 of 20, over a lib/pq port; the ratelimit burst test tolerates slow bursts — D-1340 opened\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9347b06b5d2c1e67b6c2e76b49e6a3b0e2c3762c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/trees/9347b06b5d2c1e67b6c2e76b49e6a3b0e2c3762c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/commits/f99cb5a9d9897fb07ab290d373402abb49b81a1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/f99cb5a9d9897fb07ab290d373402abb49b81a1c","node_id":"C_kwDOT3fvHtoAKGY5OWNiNWE5ZDk4OTdmYjA3YWIyOTBkMzczNDAyYWJiNDliODFhMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/2a6c53c21a51908a9d3f5a0ccf6e5f7d45cc67ae","sha":"2a6c53c21a51908a9d3f5a0ccf6e5f7d45cc67ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/2a6c53c21a51908a9d3f5a0ccf6e5f7d45cc67ae"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/f8731b98063a04f84fa48e39533391db4037289e","sha":"f8731b98063a04f84fa48e39533391db4037289e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/f8731b98063a04f84fa48e39533391db4037289e"}],"sha":"f99cb5a9d9897fb07ab290d373402abb49b81a1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/f99cb5a9d9897fb07ab290d373402abb49b81a1c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/f8731b98063a04f84fa48e39533391db4037289e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T02:15:20Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T02:15:20Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"message":"feat(plugins): the plugin database driver, 20 of 20 methods, over a lib/pq port — D-1340 opened\n\n`mm_app::plugin_driver::AppPluginDriver` answers every db_rpc.go method as app/plugin_db_driver.go\ndoes, over `gopq`, a new crate porting lib/pq v1.12.3''s connection (simple protocol without\narguments, unnamed prepare with them, binary results only for bytea/int2/4/8/uuid, lib/pq''s\ndecoded values and error texts, SCRAM/MD5 auth). database/sql''s `Raw` is kept: a\ndriver.ErrBadConn closes the *sql.Conn and later calls answer sql.ErrConnDone.\n\nmm-plugin gains Go''s `AppDriver` and `driverForPlugin`: each plugin is served its own view, whose\n`Conn` is `ConnWithPluginID`, and the environment calls `ShutdownConns` once a plugin stops.\n\n`parity::plugin_driver` runs `examples/driver_script` under both hosts against a planted table and\ncompares 171 replies byte for byte: NULLs, every column type, pq.Error fields, a rolled-back,\nread-only and failed transaction, several result sets, rows closed part-way, a query in progress,\na connection marked bad then closed, and the time.Time gob cannot carry. Mutations: 17 run,\n17 caught, 2 controls survived. `second_server_ports` now refuses a port or Go offset in the next\nstack''s range.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9347b06b5d2c1e67b6c2e76b49e6a3b0e2c3762c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/trees/9347b06b5d2c1e67b6c2e76b49e6a3b0e2c3762c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/commits/f8731b98063a04f84fa48e39533391db4037289e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/f8731b98063a04f84fa48e39533391db4037289e","node_id":"C_kwDOT3fvHtoAKGY4NzMxYjk4MDYzYTA0Zjg0ZmE0OGUzOTUzMzM5MWRiNDAzNzI4OWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/8ea9938aa19822328c008ed29acd67d29173c544","sha":"8ea9938aa19822328c008ed29acd67d29173c544","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/8ea9938aa19822328c008ed29acd67d29173c544"}],"sha":"f8731b98063a04f84fa48e39533391db4037289e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/f8731b98063a04f84fa48e39533391db4037289e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/2df305f3fb07445e6b2c74c5a880d94bc382ecb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T02:05:35Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T02:05:35Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"message":"feat(posts): persistent notifications — the create arm, their resolution, and their job (D-551 closed)\n\nPorts app/post_persistent_notification.go as mm_app::post_persistent_notification:\nforEachPersistentNotificationPost (channel/team maps, per-channel @username keywords and\nreferenceable groups, insertGroupMentions, the DM \"other side\" rule, the retirement of rows whose\npost is suppressed or whose channel or team is gone), ResolvePersistentNotification,\nDeletePersistentNotification and SendPersistentNotifications (push through\nShouldSendPushNotification, persistent_notification_triggered to desktop-enabled recipients not\nDND/OOO, UpdateLastActivity, DeleteExpired).\n\n- createPost serves persistent_notifications: the recipient check (1..=MaxRecipients, both 400s\n  wrapped in Go''s one 500) and savePostsPersistentNotifications in the save transaction; a reply\n  to a live persistent root is resolved after the save instead of forwarded.\n- Reactions and acknowledgements resolve after the write, as Go does (D-551).\n- FillInPostProps'' disable_group_highlight prop is ported: every licensed post with an @ used to\n  forward.\n- The post_persistent_notifications worker is registered; its scheduler is not (licence and\n  interval are not readable by a Scheduler) and the registry test names that.\n- Store: Get/UpdateLastActivity/DeleteExpired on PersistentNotifications, GetMemberUsersInTeam.\n\nTest apparatus: the Go oracles run no jobs or schedulers (MM_JOBSETTINGS_RUN*=false in\nscripts/go-*.sh; their Rust twins get the same env), so a pending job is the stack''s main Go''s;\nMM_API_JOB_WATCHER_INTERVAL_MS lets a second mm-api claim first. plugin_hooks'' onboarding host\nmoved off :8135 (Go + 70), where it killed the EnableTesting oracle manualtest needs.\n\nparity::persistent_notifications: create/validation, reply/reaction/ack resolution by a mentioned\nuser, bystander and author, and the job against Go''s own run (rows, events, pushes).\nMutations: 13 run, 11 caught, 2 controls survived. Opens D-1320.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6cfbb573814b88e23bbff58c60b404fafdc426c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/trees/a6cfbb573814b88e23bbff58c60b404fafdc426c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/commits/2df305f3fb07445e6b2c74c5a880d94bc382ecb8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/2df305f3fb07445e6b2c74c5a880d94bc382ecb8","node_id":"C_kwDOT3fvHtoAKDJkZjMwNWYzZmIwNzQ0NWU2YjJjNzRjNWE4ODBkOTRi