one ended after one batch with the planted\n{} instead of Go''s null. Every Go server on a stack runs job workers against the one Jobs table,\nso the link-preview oracle sometimes claims the export and writes the CSV under its own run\ndirectory; the test now looks there too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c1f26f9b8d7fbe3c8036594ac0b8b5639d8785db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/trees/c1f26f9b8d7fbe3c8036594ac0b8b5639d8785db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/commits/e5369ccbb2a4572044277efdc4ee72e24cf70534","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/e5369ccbb2a4572044277efdc4ee72e24cf70534","node_id":"C_kwDOT3fvHtoAKGU1MzY5Y2NiYjJhNDU3MjA0NDI3N2VmZGM0ZWU3MmUyNGNmNzA1MzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/ddc07dfb864b914ba16cb5319ef94e7bf10dac9d","sha":"ddc07dfb864b914ba16cb5319ef94e7bf10dac9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/ddc07dfb864b914ba16cb5319ef94e7bf10dac9d"}],"sha":"e5369ccbb2a4572044277efdc4ee72e24cf70534","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/e5369ccbb2a4572044277efdc4ee72e24cf70534"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/0212832ef540e590722c529e0667ecc1ca8a5215/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T01:49:44Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T01:49:44Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"message":"feat(jobs): the expiry_notify worker — NotifySessionsExpired over GetSessionsExpired — D-804\n\nThe session-expiry push (v2, type session, unsigned) to every mobile session that expired in the\nlast hour and was not yet told, ExpiredNotify set only after the proxy accepts it; worker and\nscheduler gated on ExtendSessionLengthWithActivity. Compared push-for-push against Go, the Rust half\non a second mm-api carrying the stack''s push environment.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d15c696a3213af5edf4a193076ef7e1f6cc666d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/trees/5d15c696a3213af5edf4a193076ef7e1f6cc666d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/commits/0212832ef540e590722c529e0667ecc1ca8a5215","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/0212832ef540e590722c529e0667ecc1ca8a5215","node_id":"C_kwDOT3fvHtoAKDAyMTI4MzJlZjU0MGU1OTA3MjJjNTI5ZTA2NjdlY2MxY2E4YTUyMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/a26c7b7fe977e4fd232129f21a3a891a6aa03973","sha":"a26c7b7fe977e4fd232129f21a3a891a6aa03973","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/a26c7b7fe977e4fd232129f21a3a891a6aa03973"}],"sha":"0212832ef540e590722c529e0667ecc1ca8a5215","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/0212832ef540e590722c529e0667ecc1ca8a5215"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/ddc07dfb864b914ba16cb5319ef94e7bf10dac9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T01:33:03Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T01:33:03Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"message":"test(jobs): the scheduler/worker test allows workers no scheduler queues; the export parity test cleans up its deliveries\n\nThe batch-migration workers are queued by startup migrations and the CSV export by the report\nAPI, so registered_workers() now outnumbers registered_schedulers(). The export test requested\nreports as the shared admin and left each run''s batch_report_*.csv FileInfo and post in the\nadmin''s DM, where file_search''s \"report\" term found them; it now requests as a user of its own\nand deletes what each run delivered.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2c221b64a6f83f3f24cded08cf7e83356e04f33c","url":"https://a