//api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/552c652660fc73feec2dcd6e7dd661079bc8e219","node_id":"C_kwDOT3fvHtoAKDU1MmM2NTI2NjBmYzczZmVlYzJkY2Q2ZTdkZDY2MTA3OWJjOGUyMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/773e5ba4e42b81b7019b02b02fcac4d0a4d5d42c","sha":"773e5ba4e42b81b7019b02b02fcac4d0a4d5d42c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/773e5ba4e42b81b7019b02b02fcac4d0a4d5d42c"}],"sha":"552c652660fc73feec2dcd6e7dd661079bc8e219","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/552c652660fc73feec2dcd6e7dd661079bc8e219"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/773e5ba4e42b81b7019b02b02fcac4d0a4d5d42c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T00:31:03Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T00:31:03Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"message":"feat(jobs): the batch-worker shape and its four workers — D-804 continued\n\nPorts jobs.BatchWorker, BatchMigrationWorker and BatchReportWorker into\nmm_app::job_runtime (BatchWorker, batch_migration_worker,\nbatch_report_worker, do_batch_job, Workers::add_batch/get_batch; the\nSimpleWorker add/get API is unchanged), plus JobServer.CancellationWatcher\nand UpdateInProgressJobData. The shape has no cancellation watcher: a row\nmoved to cancel_requested runs on, its progress writes dropped, and ends\nsuccess at the progress it had — Go''s.\n\nThe four workers built on it: delete_empty_drafts_migration,\ndelete_orphan_drafts_migration (which deletes every channel draft, as Go''s\nstatement does), delete_dms_preferences_migration, and\nexport_users_to_csv with SaveReportChunk / CompileReportChunks /\nSendReportToUser / CleanupReportChunks, the three draft and one\npreference store queries, and System.Save.\n\nThe CSV is written by a port of encoding/csv''s Writer (mm_model::go_csv)\nand its timestamps now carry Go''s zone abbreviation (local_time_zone),\nboth pinned by new rows in behaviour_go_stdlib.json.\n\nparity::batch_jobs lets this server''s worker run each job — re-keyed to a\ntype no Go worker claims — against Go''s worker on identical plantings and\ncompares job rows, deleted rows, the CSV, FileInfo and post; the draft\nsuites now hold common::DRAFT_ROWS against the migrations.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a51e20797ccb20a5748efa564e2386cbd7ebf28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/trees/0a51e20797ccb20a5748efa564e2386cbd7ebf28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/commits/773e5ba4e42b81b7019b02b02fcac4d0a4d5d42c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://ap