com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/fb2c1d1238105095246608ad153b347a4a204674"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/96ac2de6fe067a3b911dfad2595cf80d60889062/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:42:48Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:42:48Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"message":"fix(store): the team''s outgoing hooks are the live ones, in Go''s order\n\nGetOutgoingByTeam reads DeleteAt = 0 ORDER BY DisplayName, Id (webhook_store.go:337). The port\nkept deleted rows, on a comment claiming Go does — measured wrong on stack 0: Go re-creates a\ndeleted hook''s trigger and callback with a 201 where this server answered the intersect 500. And\ncreatePost''s would-a-hook-fire forward counted deleted hooks, so a suite''s cleaned-up channel-wide\nhook forwarded every later post in its channel: the licensed priority-post test''s failure on\nstack 0, which had no live hook at all.\n\nMutation: dropping the predicate fails webhook_writes and post_creates (2 run, 2 caught).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"50b0b7fa003ce4346aa8741278cbd6963b3ab393","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/trees/50b0b7fa003ce4346aa8741278cbd6963b3ab393"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/commits/96ac2de6fe067a3b911dfad2595cf80d60889062","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/96ac2de6fe067a3b911dfad2595cf80d60889062","node_id":"C_kwDOT3fvHtoAKDk2YWMyZGU2ZmUwNjdhM2I5MTFkZmFkMjU5NWNmODBkNjA4ODkwNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/2f231d912e6a208369c3d4c27eeb5dfd397878ea","sha":"2f231d912e6a208369c3d4c27eeb5dfd397878ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/2f231d912e6a208369c3d4c27eeb5dfd397878ea"}],"sha":"96ac2de6fe067a3b911dfad2595cf80d60889062","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/96ac2de6fe067a3b911dfad2595cf80d60889062"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/3d9010d1af87fbff44fca28a855d027d1f46f47a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:32:43Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:32:43Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"message":"fix(app): JSON another program wrote takes Go''s decoding rules where Go decodes it with encoding/json — D-1241 narrowed\n\nEvery non-test serde_json decode outside a request body was checked against its\nGo twin. These now go through mm_model::utils'' Go decoders:\n\n- json.Unmarshal: the GitHub latest-release check, the product-notices feed (a\n  null feed is an empty list, not parse_failed), the mm_blocks context string,\n  the recent-custom-statuses preference (both paths), a user''s customStatus\n  prop, doPostAction''s body (Go''s second Decode must be EOF), the emoji\n  upload''s `emoji` part.\n- Decode: the push proxy''s answer (map[string]string: a null member is \"\"),\n  the Marketplace feed, plugin.json (a null manifest is the zero manifest), the\n  channel/team scheme-id bodies, the team invite body, the post-search body.\n- Marshal-then-Unmarshal in Go, so from_value_go here: the property owners,\n  options and value attrs (model and property_hooks), CPA and session attrs,\n  post attachments, and both of MemberInvite''s decode attempts.\n\nA null PostActionOptions element now keeps its attachment, as Go does; the\nslot is a zero option where Go''s is nil (D-033 narrowed).\n\nD-1241 now lists what is still owed — the Config bodies (updateConfig,\npatchConfig, testEmail, testFileStore), MM_PLUGINSETTINGS_PLUGINSTATES, the\nsupport packet''s OIDC issuer, the search-results impls — and what is kept on\npurpose: AutocompleteArg (Go''s exact-key custom UnmarshalJSON), the i18n\nfiles, the oEmbed visitor, the dynamic-list response, and self-marshalled\ndocuments.\n\nTests: mm-model 1559, mm-api lib 542, mm-app lib 932, mm-plugin pass. Full\nparity: 4821 passed, 7 failed — three pass alone (file_search, plugin_hooks,\nsupport_packet); licensed_sweep''s priority post, manualtest and site_url_test''s\nping fail on main too; ratelimit''s Go-side login count is intermittent (4 of 5\nruns pass on this branch, and the failing count is Go''s own). Mutations\n(scripts/mutations/go-json-nonbody.plan): 5 run, 2 caught, 1 equivalent\n(MemberInvite''s list attempt: from_value_go and from_value agree on a\nVec<Option<String>>), 2 controls survived.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"684c2fb75f5715ae7de7420d354e92006b332d2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/trees/684c2fb75f5715ae7de7420d354e92006b332d2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/commits/3d9010d1af87fbff44fca28a855d027d1f46f47a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"comm