ps://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/fb5029bfd4b122b83817da0fccd9eed6934e0c0d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:21:21Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:21:21Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"message":"feat(posts): setPostUnread serves open channels and the CRT-unsupported reply arm — D-421 closed\n\ncountMentionsFromPost now runs beyond the DM short circuit: the user''s MentionKeywords with the\nmember''s channel notify props, isPostMention / isCommentMention over the post (against its own\nthread) and every later post 200 at a time via GetPostsAfterPost (read as the session''s user),\nand the urgent count from GetPriorityForPost / PostPriority().GetForPosts. The CRT-unsupported\nreply arm follows the thread when ThreadAutoFollow is on (MaintainMembership when there is no\nrow), sets LastViewed to CreateAt - 1, recounts UnreadMentions with countThreadMentions from the\nroot, reads the thread back extended and sanitised, and publishes thread_updated when the user\nhas CRT on; every failure there is app.channel.update_last_viewed_at_post.app_error.\n\nparity::set_unread_mentions runs one fixture (mention key, @user, @channel, add-to-channel, both\ncomment-mention rules, an urgent root, the reader''s own keyword) through Go and then this server,\nrestoring the thread membership between, and compares responses, ChannelMembers and\nThreadMemberships rows, and the post_unread / thread_updated events. post_acks'' forward guards\nnow assert the arms are served and read the arm from the body.\n\nMutations: 14 run, 12 caught, 2 controls survived.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ea4e795840d93be4d5dc31b3b2d400a1c9cca86d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/trees/ea4e795840d93be4d5dc31b3b2d400a1c9cca86d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/commits/fb5029bfd4b122b83817da0fccd9eed6934e0c0d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/fb5029bfd4b122b83817da0fccd9eed6934e0c0d","node_id":"C_kwDOT3fvHtoAKGZiNTAyOWJmZDRiMTIyYjgzODE3ZGEwZmNjZDllZWQ2OTM0ZTBjMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/5b048cc331631e5bc7cfcc3b9d8b7117f6fd8180","sha":"5b048cc331631e5bc7cfcc3b9d8b7117f6fd8180","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/5b048cc331631e5bc7cfcc3b9d8b7117f6fd8180"}],"sha":