— D-331, D-158 closed\n\nWhat a nullable map, slice or pointer column becomes on the wire depends on how Go scans it:\nsqlx into a map field gives {} for NULL and null for jsonb null; a pointer gives null and an\nall-null struct; a StringArray gives null either way; a manual []byte scan (User.Get,\nGetAllProfilesInChannel) fails on NULL. Audited every mm-store read and fixed:\n\n- users: NULL props/notifyprops/timezone is {} on sqlx paths and a 500\n  (app.user.get_by_username.app_error, now GetUser''s real id) on the two manual-scan reads\n- channelmembers.notifyprops and sessions.props: NULL is {}; a jsonb null session no longer\n  fails the read\n- channels.bannerinfo: jsonb null is the struct with three null fields\n- the text null in StringArray columns (outgoing webhooks, OAuth apps, drafts, scheduled posts)\n  and jsonb null thread participants / member timezones no longer fail the read\n\nparity::null_columns plants each shape by SQL on its own fixtures and compares both servers\n(8 tests). Mutations: 14 run, 12 caught, 2 controls survived.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"67592472b8a98ef3ffc22aff7f5ca8d504fa91bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/trees/67592472b8a98ef3ffc22aff7f5ca8d504fa91bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/commits/05239afab70f0d8bcbbac5255056ca75798220db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==