false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/db9c74bf178011e4cf651fca39b71fb99a95f045/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:44:38Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:44:38Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"message":"fix(api): one deciding rate limiter in front of Go, and the per-user step on the web client''s page — D-1150, D-1151 closed\n\nThis server''s limiters now decide for every request, forwarded ones included, and the Go\nprocess behind it never refuses first:\n- the forward leg sets the first trusted header to the peer when Go''s GetIPAddress walk would\n  otherwise fall back to RemoteAddr (this server), so Go keys each forwarded request on the\n  client and sees a subset of that key''s requests;\n- the X-RateLimit-* values Go adds to a forwarded answer are dropped and ours written in Go''s\n  order (global, route, per-user); a 429 from Go is passed through whole;\n- the three route limiters run in ratelimit::global, ahead of the per-user step, as\n  RateLimitedHandler sits outside ServeHTTP; the per-user route_layer skips a path segment\n  gorilla would not match (Go''s api4 catch-all has no per-user step);\n- web_static::fallback runs the per-user step for every request Go hands a web.Handler — the\n  SPA catch-all (IsStatic headers on the refusal, D-1151) and the OAuth/SAML/magic-link/\n  webhook routes it forwards (API handler shape).\n\nOne commit for both entries: the per-user step for the page and for the forwarded web routes is\nthe same classification (web_static::go_handler_kind) and the same parity test.\n\nparity::ratelimit::forwarded_requests_are_limited_once_on_the_clients_key runs a Go direct\nand an mm-api in front of a second, identically configured Go, with two clients on different\nloopback addresses. D-1210 (Go''s route limiters on forwarded login/DCR branches) and D-1211\n(no basicSecurityChecks 414 on the API router) opened.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"52aee39edef683c7271f23f3d4fca2e6e1b682ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/trees/52aee39edef683c7271f23f3d4fca2e6e1b682ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/git/commits/db9c74bf178011e4cf651fca39b71fb99a95f045","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/db9c74bf178011e4cf651fca39b71fb99a95f045","node_id":"C_kwDOT3fvHtoAKGRiOWM3NGJmMTc4MDExZTRjZjY1MWZjYTM5YjcxZmI5OWE5NWYwNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commit/82f5f6cbf8f776c8a0c6b2f842d6d2b8dda1728e","sha":"82f5f6cbf8f776c8a0c6b2f842d6d2b8dda1728e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/82f5f6cbf8f776c8a0c6b2f842d6d2b8dda1728e"}],"sha":"db9c74bf178011e4cf651fca39b71fb99a95f045","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/db9c74bf178011e4cf651fca39b71fb99a95f045"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/874046?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niklabh","id":874046,"login":"niklabh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDA0Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niklabh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niklabh/mattermost-rs/commits/b3ac871b63c353dfc7462c5ce0382fc9f4b338bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:40:38Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:40:38Z","email":"niklabh811@gmail.com","name":"Nikhil Ranjan"},"message":"fix(api): the forwarded-HEAD framing test gets its no-length answer from a long unknown-API path\n\nThe 404 for /api/v5/<1900 bytes> echoes the path past net/http''s 2048-byte buffer, so Go states\nno Content-Length on every stack; `/` did so only where the webapp bundle is built. A stated\nlength there is now a hard failure naming the lost branch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"