urso de Java.\n- Casos de estudio 20 → 50: análisis de nuevos requerimientos, diagnóstico entre\n  entornos (QA/staging/prod) y versionado/releases (10 casos cada uno).\n- Glosario: sección de mensajería y streaming (15 términos nuevos).\n- Actualiza índice, plan de estudio, seguimiento, sidebar del sitio y conteos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48a2d62014b6b9df1ab1b0a5e7e6ee2b9eaa1853","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/darwinva97/entrevistas-senior/git/trees/48a2d62014b6b9df1ab1b0a5e7e6ee2b9eaa1853"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/darwinva97/entrevistas-senior/git/commits/b677cfe152c222cde7ec0c13acf69e61485cf16f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30082909?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinva97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinva97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinva97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinva97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/darwinva97","id":30082909,"login":"darwinva97","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMDgyOTA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinva97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinva97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinva97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinva97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinva97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinva97","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/darwinva97/entrevistas-senior/commit/b677cfe152c222cde7ec0c13acf69e61485cf16f","node_id":"C_kwDOT3iF5toAKGI2NzdjZmUxNTJjMjIyY2RlN2VjMGMxM2FjZjY5ZTYxNDg1Y2YxNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/darwinva97/entre