.com/users/joaodss2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/commits/61f01d8afc3ebbdddd804562e13edb6503c95b3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:16:39Z","email":"32569584+joaodss2@users.noreply.github.com","name":"João Santos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:16:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(feature-flags): platform + per-cluster kubectl-access toggles (kill-switch v2) (#116)\n\nUI surface for the runtime feature-flags API (ADR-0016, server PR\n7K-Inari/inari-server#165):\n\n- OpenAPI snapshot resynced from the server branch (new feature-flags\n  routes) and schema.ts regenerated (inariServerSpecVersion stays ''edge'';\n  re-pin to a released server version before releasing per the\n  contract gate).\n- src/api/feature-flags.ts adapter, typed from the generated schema.\n- /platform/feature-flags page: platform-admin catalog with effective\n  values, platform-wide enable/disable, reset-to-default, envPinned\n  notice.\n- KubectlAccessCard on the cluster detail page: reversible per-cluster\n  override for tenant admin/operator, ''use platform default'' revert,\n  override badge, envPinned notice; hidden for revoked/decommissioned\n  clusters and when features.kubectlAccess is off.\n- MSW mock state + handlers for all six endpoints.\n- Tests: adapter (6), platform page (4), cluster card (7), incl. 403/500\n  error paths.","tree":{"sha":"73b283106d6c27d94b5866d73e426ca66e3f2c72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/git/trees/73b283106d6c27d94b5866d73e426ca66e3f2c72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/git/commits/61f01d8afc3ebbdddd804562e13edb6503c95b3d","verification":{"payload":"tree 73b283106d6c27d94b5866d73e426ca66e3f2c72\nparent 7c8b08ef5bf6b18b88a96c2f