dss2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joaodss2","id":32569584,"login":"joaodss2","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTY5NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/commits/7c8b08ef5bf6b18b88a96c2fe0d02b08a66612e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T19:33:29Z","email":"32569584+joaodss2@users.noreply.github.com","name":"João Santos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T19:33:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ext): surface remoteEntry fetch causes and validate registrations at add time (#115)\n\n* fix(ext): surface remoteEntry fetch causes and validate registrations at add time\n\n- Preflight the resolved remoteEntry URL before registering the remote with\n  the MF runtime; failures throw a typed ExtensionLoadError carrying the\n  entry URL, HTTP status, huma error detail, and network cause instead of a\n  bare 502 / generic script error.\n- Thread the cause through the extension registry (errorUrl/errorStatus on\n  ExtensionEntry) and render the HTTP status in the State column.\n- Registration-time health check in AddRemoteForm: definitively unreachable\n  remoteEntry URLs are rejected with an inline error; CORS-restricted\n  cross-origin URLs (opaque responses) warn and proceed; OCI references are\n  left to the server.\n- Cover with vitest: preflight failure causes, health-check tri-state,\n  registry cause threading, and page-level registration rejection.\n\n* fix(ext): close registration health-check gaps\n\n- Preflight bare-relative remoteEntry URLs (no leading slash) instead of\n  skipping them; only oci:// references bypass the client-side check.\n- Treat a 200 text/html response (SPA fallback / error page) as unhealthy\n  with a clear message instead of healthy.\n- Clear the unverifiable-reachability notice after a successful add.","tree":{"sha":"2b3fe6f0e4822bf46bd2c5d4f8cecbf0978a783e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/git/trees/2b3fe6f0e4822bf46bd2c5d4f8cecbf0978a783e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/git/commits/7c8b08ef5bf6b18b88a96c2fe0d02b08a66612e7","verification":{"payload":"tree 2b3fe6f0e4822bf46bd2c5d4f8cecbf0978a783e\nparent f6e6996a8cb8e16efb700b137e546eb2257f25ec\nauthor João Santos <32569584+joaodss2@users.noreply.github.com> 1791401609 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791401609 +0100\n\nfix(ext): surface remoteEntry fetch causes and validate registrations at add time (#115)\n\n* fix(ext): surface remoteEntry fetch causes and validate registrations at add time\n\n- Preflight the resolved remoteEntry URL before registering the remote with\n  the MF runtime; failures throw a typed ExtensionLoadError carrying the\n  entry URL, HTTP status, huma error detail, and network cause instead of a\n  bare 502 / generic script error.\n- Thread the cause through the extension registry (errorUrl/errorStatus on\n  ExtensionEntry) and render the HTTP status in the State column.\n- Registration-time health check in AddRemoteForm: definitively unreachable\n  remoteEntry URLs are rejected with an inline error; CORS-restricted\n  cross-origin URLs (opaque responses) warn and proceed; OCI references are\n  left to the server.\n- Cover with vitest: preflight failure causes, health-check tri-state,\n  registry cause threading, and page-level registration rejection.\n\n* fix(ext): close registration health-check gaps\n\n- Preflight bare-relative remoteEntry URLs (no leading slash) instead of\n  skipping them; only oci:// references bypass the client-side check.\n- Treat a 200 text/html response (SPA fallback / error page) as unhealthy\n  with a clear message instead of healthy.\n- Clear the unverifiable-reachability notice after a successful add.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxp6JCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAI04QALAXayD0klEJUTZknzDMRzxY\nIXv040m/1dPxoDo3rLq4zZXdc+pqhafvrHB5CS7tLoLuiwiuu1YjujGTV0h5IZAy\nWn3QmH/MT5t+J4czkULKfP2ghgtctpuQNgWgmLlESUXw5wUi4nIDur8uIelL2qBz\nr8e+U2FTGNT1grmM6pw9BrmhSOcdhX7Klue3UQXMZB+6XurR+/nc5XhDVHg5s7RN\npNHpHkQLC8+glYFE7P9WorjOt1DpIsDy8XkzxCQlPOnuBSI7ukPwGSxmihRy931x\n1vefWvjKvvgaWWZ/Pvxv7tY6zTvyJjXozC8w2xuYTiTNlFOpicE4seZ+enHeZ3fC\nSz2B9KB26X4AqLP2LnWXXVR00hixBlRGTjfNhfL1M8WBUakCpuYadQtIcEL1QhMh\n4amE7vE3Q2VYiLtE5S2lrnV8zX+QANvqNUcqimXpwI7bGD8uX8yV8uwia/6GxYru\nOd5ZgjXmo5uczJKR730/kE35SvP7clX/nPrYrb4N3HTu5m4y/R9StjNG53X01BAX\nAacfS+ml0YRp9Hp/aap+ImcMQWKBiZxjtTSjGERAYmt/xSHtnxiaKlp5y100SVjT\nvm3j6lFGIHq2Bp4dMFoq/3klffOooL8DSQQ82JwdpgmNVxut/v3dI09kpzJNd/wA\nrEtOT2/0kSiHcqk8pPPK\n=W+O2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T19:33:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"U