rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/commits/b6324687282c1fcda745c0609ebf1a3f12e916ce"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32569584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joaodss2","id":32569584,"login":"joaodss2","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTY5NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/commits/d7ba3ba3968706a8a022d70b5161127300a53a20/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T11:41:40Z","email":"32569584+joaodss2@users.noreply.github.com","name":"João Santos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T11:41:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(git-connections): map the real connection wire shape (#81)\n\n* fix(api): send Accept: application/json on all apiFetch calls\n\nThe usergit authorize endpoint negotiates on Accept: JSON clients get\n200 {authorizeUrl}, everything else a 302 to the provider consent URL.\nfetch() sends Accept: */*, so the console''s git-connections connect\ncall followed the 302 cross-origin to github.com, got CORS-rejected,\nand surfaced as ''Network error: control plane unreachable''.\n\nVerified live: default Accept -> 302 to github.com; with\nAccept: application/json -> 200 {authorizeUrl}.\n\n* fix(git-connections): map the real connection wire shape\n\nThe connected-account row rendered empty login/scopes because the UI\nwire type expected {login, scopes: string[]} while the server sends\n{providerLogin, scopes: string, apiBase?} (inari-server usergit\nConnection). The adapter now maps providerLogin -> login and parses the\nspace/comma-separated scopes string; apiBase stays optional (dash for\ngithub.com is intentional). Mocks and tests aligned.\n\n* test(git-connections): pin wire-shape mapping (providerLogin, scopes string)","tree":{"sha":"254ff8d153b7e329206fec0e6c235c56c3672724","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/git/trees/254ff8d153b7e329206fec0e6c235c56c3672724"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/git/commits/d7ba3ba3968706a8a022d70b5161127300a53a20","verification":{"payload":"tree 254ff8d153b7e329206fec0e6c235c56c3672724\nparent f9f9250895bf143ec7ad32c54c68b8df23f693aa\nauthor João Santos <32569584+joaodss2@users.noreply.github.com> 1790682100 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790682100 +0100\n\nfix(git-connections): map the real connection wire shape (#81)\n\n* fix(api): send Accept: application/json on all apiFetch calls\n\nThe usergit authorize endpoint negotiates on Accept: JSON clients get\n200 {authorizeUrl}, everything else a 302 to the provider consent URL.\nfetch() sends Accept: */*, so the console''s git-connections connect\ncall followed the 302 cross-origin to github.com, got CORS-rejected,\nand surfaced as ''Network error: control plane unreachable''.\n\nVerified live: default Accept -> 302 to github.com; with\nAccept: application/json -> 200 {authorizeUrl}.\n\n* fix(git-connections): map the real connection wire shape\n\nThe connected-account row rendered empty login/scopes because the UI\nwire type expected {login, scopes: string[]} while the server sends\n{providerLogin, scopes: string, apiBase?} (inari-server usergit\nConnection). The adapter now maps providerLogin -> login and parses the\nspace/comma-separated scopes string; apiBase stays optional (dash for\ngithub.com is intentional). Mocks and tests aligned.\n\n* test(git-connections): pin wire-shape mapping (providerLogin, scopes string)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu6P0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAT8EQAG2tqGI9jxHqt+CRVJjLu1yw\nL6nxrjqa2p70BXDv5pZS6qaRhBvx80QdLpl6pYW6ngI27fVKkwdGa7giqMPneoeH\nwzIwHtN+Yau5fNAdpRzuPRz2cV93zTZxVbFdbqidul708C20oiAOmoDDzgUhqSQZ\nKm+hDYRzkkDKQeJxMexs7pvhpgPdHIJCYYnSpxcdLuSIxQ/5/XZLAVqZmsp2cQak\nZAevO05+T0eIKufI9FqQr3SprTgrHg6CgdPItMc+jf3HwMi/yzVExTGtjRFalSAW\nDrMs0TtxkPxrs68oly3LtaXZRRPeNnsfJkDBU9L2aOCCzpcVVmpnaXvCzHJ4oW66\nWN1robCQNSFtrUgRDpUqubDurS6fkx3H+An8cGLschgnDcxrCnR5/RHM0iz0ZuJS\nqg5MOx2BFVJ+H1jDVq5LrP1YPoL7tWmLU2OfH1PrKscVqiEQs5OJjvzeBikcq8KP\naW5oaVfBRu1H1LnMQ0RPzuCqXGgxuRe+tCKlm4zx+ihAHL6McprvnUJRgRUuImz0\nRbOPePiAYso8JnPLQ7W51pX/jhdXxaA1xDs9GzhEZKQJjv6oxnZ+IvirBevwLyx7\nzX+VmkMuQzhYJhADGiFIKYMc8oG0cC0om5FLBpqng3xoZycC9DtCPfCFsUnjQ5oc\n7BweAyA16Zf+nBmkR3MD\n=Cdkz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T11:41:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url