version-bump so the bundle repo bumps the chart''s\nappVersion + bundle.tag in lockstep. Adds edge.yml: bundle tagged\n<pending>-edge.<shortsha> plus a GitHub prerelease on every merge to main\n(skips release merges). Old OCI artifacts at\noci://ghcr.io/7k-inari/inari-ui/charts stay published, deprecated.\n\n* chore(release): sync resolve-edge-version.sh (simple-mode tag fallback)\n\n* chore(release): sync resolve-edge-version.sh (unversioned-repo fallback)\n\n* fix(release): edge tags are vX.Y.Z-<sha> with a moving edge channel\n\nresolve-edge-version.sh emits <pending>-<shortsha> (no -edge infix); the\nedge workflow additionally force-moves the git tag edge and maintains a\nmoving edge GitHub prerelease for the latest edge build.\n\n* fix(release): make the edge prerelease create rerun-safe","tree":{"sha":"32137a2db65636000fef9cd9d7559aea4206c3e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/git/trees/32137a2db65636000fef9cd9d7559aea4206c3e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/git/commits/2fc290a7df492fcf9bba9c585a12058b619ee048","verification":{"payload":"tree 32137a2db65636000fef9cd9d7559aea4206c3e0\nparent 7e4458d444966f97ee8e6039bb1f22abcd083943\nauthor João Santos <32569584+joaodss2@users.noreply.github.com> 1790682025 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790682025 +0100\n\nfeat(release): move the inari-console chart to inari-release-bundle; semver edge releases (#79)\n\n* chore(release): move the inari-console chart to inari-release-bundle\n\nChart sources, chart CI and the release-please chart component leave this\nrepo; the chart now releases from 7K-Inari/inari-release-bundle into the\norg-level oci://ghcr.io/7k-inari/charts namespace. release.yml''s chart-sync\njob dispatches appversion-bump so the bundle repo bumps the chart''s\nappVersion + bundle.tag in lockstep. Adds edge.yml: bundle tagged\n<pending>-edge.<shortsha> plus a GitHub prerelease on every merge to main\n(skips release merges). Old OCI artifacts at\noci://ghcr.io/7k-inari/inari-ui/charts stay published, deprecated.\n\n* chore(release): sync resolve-edge-version.sh (simple-mode tag fallback)\n\n* chore(release): sync resolve-edge-version.sh (unversioned-repo fallback)\n\n* fix(release): edge tags are vX.Y.Z-<sha> with a moving edge channel\n\nresolve-edge-version.sh emits <pending>-<shortsha> (no -edge infix); the\nedge workflow additionally force-moves the git tag edge and maintains a\nmoving edge GitHub prerelease for the latest edge build.\n\n* fix(release): make the edge prerelease create rerun-safe","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu6OpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArl0QAEVnQkylHKdulzYa6bTXxsZv\nYd6pab39q9jBG6JSQvn5SUXxBwJVqqaDfWwJZONLrtkZIzBJfDa22G3y/ab4MaEt\n+PMcXkHF4RmPKgOkFfwiOoEFHSsyRx7cYSyKUSRvD3HU5v8SoNi1P+isUz9xCQ4u\ndKf/q28nkY9aEyNnXrrXlTcnF2vD225xByXyNCEZgFrdr3w7rzH2Zpeg7SZGL6wK\n9BCcr7kJZeRPc5Nfm1pV1olnH6tyNQJhwe6bI2BMm67QeYW2ktxTmNPDwEu2pkT9\n8zxVz90/66XzKC/GKHMwDCZNfG01WFZhnrqRqWzKy0rvAji/jye8NwDegblcE697\nnoF3Hx22bFJK6xLltNHSHlfZHPyhvkND+a8e2GvjShYMDXweu6B2DpPMO8+/GoUk\nOYl7Wv9v5RJlMSuqdYk1Aa9gWRQLhkCz/o9G8ID9dsv63OKNkfp2/mO7ox0OUB83\nOpHT29AHhkfRHa1NzmAr+PnRosHaXr05v0lHJmGZG1mKO+HaiB4XNjuuBthfgDjL\nSXztkJb6zr6hdKXjSbiKUv6zrUgGe2tSXlkq8RVTBMeM+Jw10kjgpsKLKwUXpowp\nIevvgMDnpwKFQ61u53CkVhpFeUQV/Ruye4SLduxQaQ0IA4bES2ne/nUvuBewSlCY\nqkHP6M/5aGzkbcWBFaCt\n=ENnD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T11:40:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/7K-Inari/inari-ui/commit/2fc290a7df492fcf9bba9c585a12058b619ee048","node_id":"C_kwDOT3j7o9oAKDJmYzI5MGE3ZGY0OTJmY2Y5YmJhOWM1ODVhMTIwNThiNjE5ZWUwNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/7K-Inari/inari-ui/commit/7e4458d444966f97ee8e6039bb1f22abcd083943","sha":"7e4458d444966f97ee8e6039bb1f22abcd083943","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/commits/7e4458d444966f97ee8e6039bb1f22abcd083943"}],"sha":"2fc290a7df492fcf9bba9c585a12058b619ee048","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/commits/2fc290a7df492fcf9bba9c585a12058b619ee048"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32569584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joaodss2","id":32569584,"login":"joaodss2","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTY5NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/commits/7e4458d444966f97ee8e6039bb1f22abcd083943/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T09:39:53Z","email":"32569584+joaodss2@users.noreply.github.com","name":"João Santos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T09:39:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(settings): align identity-clients + member-invite clients with the server contract (#78)\n\nThe identity settings clients were written against proposed MSW shapes\nthat never matched the implemented huma API, breaking live pages:\n\n- /settings/identity/clients crashed on render: the UI read\n  client.grantTypes/isPublic/id, but the server returns\n  {clientId, type, audiences, scopes, redirectUris, status, createdAt}\n  (grantTypes undefined -> TypeError in the table row).\n- client update used PUT; the server only registers PATCH.\n- create/rotate returned secret as an object in mocks; the server\n  returns a plain string.\n- member invite/role-change sent email+displayName body props (422 from\n  strict validation) and role values member/admin that the server\n  rejects (valid: org-admin/platform-engineer/developer/viewer).\n\nFixes: identity.ts rewritten to the server contract (clientId, type,\nPATCH update, string secret, {audience, scopes[]} catalog); clients.tsx\nand scopes.tsx updated (incl. audience:scope assignment entries);\nmember invite sends {role} only with valid role values (email subject\nresolution is server-side, inari-server#104); MSW fixtures/handlers and\ntests updated.\n\nVerified live (run 7045f491): identity/clients returns 200 and the\nserved bundle no longer contains the crashing code path; invite by\nemail returns 204.","tree":{"sha":"601191983f5cc5ef63d8e0dee383098976ecf184","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/git/trees/601191983f5cc5ef63d8e0dee383098976ecf184"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/git/commits/7e4458d444966f97ee8e6039bb1f22abcd083943","verification":{"payload":"tree 601191983f5cc5ef63d8e0dee383098976ecf184\nparent 54c41a6f1e0849a6b8690157d009dd17a1fad9f0\nauthor João Santos <32569584+joaodss2@users.noreply.github.com> 1790674793 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790674793 +0100\n\nfix(settings): align identity-clients + member-invite clients with the server contract (#78)\n\nThe identity settings clients were written against proposed MSW shapes\nthat never matched the implemented huma API, breaking live pages:\n\n- /settings/identity/clients crashed on render: the UI read\n  client.grantTypes/isPublic/id, but the server returns\n  {clientId, type, audiences, scopes, redirectUris, status, createdAt}\n  (grantTypes undefined -> TypeError in the table row).\n- client update used PUT; the server only registers PATCH.\n- create/rotate returned secret as an object in mocks; the server\n  returns a plain string.\n- member invite/role-change sent email+displayName body props (422 from\n  strict validation) and role values member/admin that the server\n  rejects (valid: org-admin/platform-engineer/developer/viewer).\n\nFixes: identity.ts rewritten to the server contract (clientId, type,\nPATCH update, string secret, {audience, scopes[]} catalog); clients.tsx\nand scopes.tsx updated (incl. audience:scope assignment entries);\nmember invite sends {role} only with valid role values (email subject\nresolution is server-side, inari-server#104); MSW fixtures/handlers and\ntests updated.\n\nVerified live (run 7045f491): identity/clients returns 200 and the\nserved bundle no longer contains the crashing code path; invite by\nemail returns 204.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu4dpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/A4QAA/3qP0VkgRYd569sxhqFpml\nBlCRla6ezMPmO8bFqP9Z884h5RXykd9/am8yl7MN/oqNRjwlvZ2as2ETVM49m+p0\nfgONRhKbweaPGjWeDi6eEyBhwJCx7J0RH6R319tjFBBQit8B/Z0Cl2rdF+OSsffI\nK2Sj/xZE0Y1Ap/R2T3p1VBAfOOda8Db2rWjTBviuacxHrEbctzTk910R6yGx9hbB\nwBukXwgSN0LrjetBjMGKLcL/nSeGy7bVY9QVNcOvRZeALNGLj83gm8FHITIrW+Ni\nLe6