tus\n- Interim hand-written wire types for W6 contract fields (scope,\n  commitIdentity, usedFallback, fallbackPolicy) pending spec sync\n\n* fix(templates): show identity badge on failed scaffold runs","tree":{"sha":"b07bc22e93e9297004b9c16d56b75c71e1e08b8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/git/trees/b07bc22e93e9297004b9c16d56b75c71e1e08b8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/git/commits/54c41a6f1e0849a6b8690157d009dd17a1fad9f0","verification":{"payload":"tree b07bc22e93e9297004b9c16d56b75c71e1e08b8d\nparent b4ba7da935966bbcbd276b659cf7dd6fef6610f9\nauthor João Santos <32569584+joaodss2@users.noreply.github.com> 1790534049 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790534049 +0100\n\nfeat(templates): badge template identity scope and surface git fallback UX (#76)\n\n* feat(templates): badge template identity scope and surface git fallback UX\n\n- Badge user-scope templates (Personal git) vs platform-scope in template\n  list, catalog browse, and catalog detail\n- Scaffold wizard previews commit identity before run: connected git login\n  for user scope, platform App for platform scope, warning + deep link to\n  Settings -> Git connections when no personal connection exists\n- Handle server 409 fallback-block with an explanation and deep link\n- Show commit identity, fallback flag, and audited notice on run status\n- Interim hand-written wire types for W6 contract fields (scope,\n  commitIdentity, usedFallback, fallbackPolicy) pending spec sync\n\n* fix(templates): show identity badge on failed scaffold runs","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquWGhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfJUQAB0CMkWOhyZCWxwTdSqnF/4v\nx7MrFFyMa8fDzn+iSNg/YIPwIJA9qLCpuGB7Extf0E8NH0qoIjQzJX4DriWkTpPf\nFpqXLh0YEVgAJzjNwb52hFVDBc5IHg0R1cHa09pHGgobIZ56TgdYKcxD2SArcfVo\nSwHLz2mVFk6ZTFPgNnfkhv5pKbUSlUCT9GivKisz7EOg/IlFCaagpIKo71IWKhVP\nRh7ftPkCMfYlcOQxAtfvQPJ6wkxMBV6nQCr6ri6bfHAGMVamm+eoldJSRf0Xd0y8\nw13XY6OB/GdEAPtB1Xzf1Xk3h73+