now-published contract (keyed provider sub-objects, targets with\nclusterSetRef, PATCH update body without name) and would 422 against the\nserver. Add src/api/secret-stores.ts wrapping the five endpoints with types\nfrom @/api/__generated__/schema, rework the page''s schema-driven form around\na native provider selector that renders only the selected provider''s config,\nand reshape the MSW fixtures/handlers and tests to the contract. secrets.ts\nis untouched (sibling task migrates it).\n\n* test(secret-stores): cover status and delete failure paths\n\n* fix(secret-stores): surface status fetch errors, disable submit while saving, reset form on tenant switch\n\n* fix(mocks): define ServerExtension in m4 fixtures after extensions refactor (#62)","tree":{"sha":"addb503a793cdc41def9e25f826649b756d4878c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/git/trees/addb503a793cdc41def9e25f826649b756d4878c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/git/commits/ae77eeb48263d025a1885d9fec81efaa55536aeb","verification":{"payload":"tree addb503a793cdc41def9e25f826649b756d4878c\nparent 62cc60717072b4e6495ce75987202bded429215e\nauthor João Santos <32569584+joaodss2@users.noreply.github.com> 1790332486 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790332486 +0100\n\nfeat(secret-stores): tenant-scoped ESO Secret Stores management page (#64)\n\n* feat(secret-stores): retype ESO Secret Stores UI from generated OpenAPI contract\n\nThe page was built on hand-written shapes in src/api/secrets.ts that drifted\nfrom the now-published contract (keyed provider sub-objects, targets with\nclusterSetRef, PATCH update body without name) and would 422 against the\nserver. Add src/api/secret-stores.ts wrapping the five endpoints with types\nfrom @/api/__generated__/schema, rework the page''s schema-driven form around\na native provider selector that renders only the selected provider''s config,\nand reshape the MSW fixtures/handlers and tests to the contract. secrets.ts\nis untouched (sibling task migrates it).\n\n* test(secret-stores): cover status and delete failure paths\n\n* fix(secret-stores): surface status fetch errors, disable submit while saving, reset form on tenant switch\n\n* fix(mocks): define ServerExtension in m4 fixtures after extensions refactor (#62)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtk5GCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA408QAD8ZptDwnpruG1qtpCiIeX1n\nsDb9gEJpxD34pqUbXqW8Od+xV6z5JRZ66U11g4ExJHDPQIQpo3t88iX8br7NLYSC\niY/l24aE5Xgz8QpvzuviEgyFgBpDsm7Lbo8ntCIuX/uMJupi45Le5AE09tNSzzK1\nDghNavuoiYQPzvd0RZHNb//Vc0ek/PgSQ29nvpStdOy5Q+wEsa75FgVNqPu5r/pW\nKcx1yVoLMhfmzBcvdGwgEgBTL2Om02Zzv4XxW9Zz8WJ25gGRA/jHmIsmxX7o48nG\nc7PfLOm7a/5AfnI/E5hGADJftk/qqSxrgESdsgD/jPKqH07xvcKFqMCH4rlmKgdD\nVGuxAsV+jRqc8wSXdvm3Xd/JQgV3mpHEGYCcbObrqIYprBdTOrE6gu59LpyUIJgv\nmt4EK//eU3vR0/O82g9u+wqE8kcIjAEpEDC6zJWV5t8nHbb7ED4b7oVE1ddLHxot\nncVsHhfFRWQg6ZqMNxRQhALq5iD0+z52KrV2p3VTQNwJQcNKeZoNREWgsU65sTgR\nRyLaaeFvUIWKNAuls2cvxzho1jGUFdGgacs/SgD8dbYpZDjRPz2R/bZL3ctpea2Z\norsnC+BqSN0gG3yQUimtLDUPLEkZ9wgrf48M+bYkt1kVrbDou7F3+HnkVTEx8OeT\n8X5MNp/0XAYfR4h1MB1V\n=Y/4U\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T10:34:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscription