nsions/{id}/identity/rotate and surface a\nRotate identity action on the extensions page; the returned one-time\nsecret is shown once, cleared on retry, failure, or tenant switch, and\nrotation errors render in the backend extensions card.","tree":{"sha":"839c2700ab1da38aa1c9bbfd9eb3b3df74fd5663","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/git/trees/839c2700ab1da38aa1c9bbfd9eb3b3df74fd5663"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/git/commits/c5f2cae538a032ea4a2211dc9e746095b24e5ff6","verification":{"payload":"tree 839c2700ab1da38aa1c9bbfd9eb3b3df74fd5663\nparent 92eee3e692633b9846351ff16bd3b3291b4e0346\nauthor João Santos <32569584+joaodss2@users.noreply.github.com> 1790331003 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790331003 +0100\n\nrefactor(extensions): type wire shapes from generated OpenAPI schema (#62)\n\nMigrate src/api/extensions.ts off hand-written wire structs\n(BackendExtension, BackendExtensionRecord) onto components[\"schemas\"]\ntypes, per the AGENTS.md generated-contract rule. UiExtensionRemote and\nSlotKind remain as *ViewModel UI projections of the /extensions/ui\nsurface.\n\nResolve the state vs healthy mismatch against the generated schema: the\nExtension wire record exposes state (pending|ready|degraded|stopped);\nhealthy is now a derived view-model field (state === \"ready\").\n\nAdd rotateExtensionIdentity for POST\n/tenants/{org}/extensions/{id}/identity/rotate and surface a\nRotate identity action on the extensions page; the returned one-time\nsecret is shown once, cleared on retry, failure, or tenant switch, and\nrotation errors render in the backend extensions card.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtkh7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXXIQAJgNVt/snISHV+od+qDojSJL\nTB3RM0bAATOyEOtdpAiynVB387fZmojPhlAjdEhH9WnpZGlW6AcNZmZSiawuQeEC\npp/Cijrmpau7n7tE8y+CHrwaVOV128uiK9jbzlbLoqeaqcY/6bQfacmyHNNV7wUw\nI1zuQCGSK8TweuTq4SM1FjJMiJ/H8LvneyYDiWfVTqszSet5mbGwp9SR1q5Wf0uf\nwNBA2v3CLlHhI678a/hdOf