parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/7K-Inari/inari-ui/commit/d579eb1d0dab94147ad966a2be1e98265147d7d6","sha":"d579eb1d0dab94147ad966a2be1e98265147d7d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/commits/d579eb1d0dab94147ad966a2be1e98265147d7d6"}],"sha":"5884e70d339a1146341e26738bb2739f2576e2da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/commits/5884e70d339a1146341e26738bb2739f2576e2da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32569584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joaodss2","id":32569584,"login":"joaodss2","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTY5NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/commits/d579eb1d0dab94147ad966a2be1e98265147d7d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:14:37Z","email":"32569584+joaodss2@users.noreply.github.com","name":"João Santos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:14:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(console): MF host shares zod+SDK singletons; catalog template badge; container-name derivation (#59)\n\n* feat(settings): tenant notifications settings page\n\nAdd a Notifications section under tenant settings for managing the\ninari-server notification-endpoints API (slack | webhook): endpoints\ntable with kind badge, client-side masked URL, event filter chips and\nenabled toggle; inline create/edit form with per-kind help text\n(Slack incoming webhook, JSON envelope + HMAC-SHA256 signature),\ngrouped event multi-select aligned with the server fan-out set, and\nhttp(s) URL validation; per-endpoint send-test with inline delivery\nresult, edit (PUT, kind immutable, blank secret preserved), and delete\nwith confirm. Viewer-role users get a read-only view.\n\nDelivery history is not exposed by the API yet; the page notes this\nand shows the test-send result instead (follow-up server task).\n\nClient: hand-written src/api/notifications.ts on apiFetch importing\ngenerated contract types. MSW mocks + vitest coverage mirror the\nexisting settings pages (list, create, validation, edit, toggle,\ntest-send feedback, delete confirm, viewer read-only).\n\n* review: mask endpoint URL in hover title, stabilize vitest env and timeout\n\n* test(settings): cover notification row-action errors and secret-on-create\n\n* fix(console): share zod + @7k-inari/ui-plugin-sdk as MF singletons from the host\n\n* fix(console): catalog template source badge + MF container name derivation (RUNTIME-001)\n\nCatalog page crashed on source=template items (undefined badge map entry).\nExtension loader registered remotes under the registry name with dashes,\nwhile webpack containers export underscore globals — the MF runtime could\nnot resolve remoteEntry exports.\n\n* test(console): container-name derivation (RUNTIME-001 regression)\n\n* chore(console): keep SDK dependency on ^0.1.5 (needs 0.1.6 publish for template union)\n\n* ci: trigger\n\n* chore(console): @7k-inari/ui-plugin-sdk ^0.1.6 (template union published)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: kandev-test-runner <kandev-test-runner@7kgroup.org>","tree":{"sha":"e633a46c915185f484a6a5866f1720208c1cb57e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ui/git/trees/e633a46c915185f484a6a5866f1720208c1cb57e"},"u