nection\nmetadata (bridged to incoming metadata for the in-process call), and maps\nUNAUTHENTICATED plugin errors to 401 + X-Inari-Reauth: argocd +\n{\"code\":\"reauth_required\"} — byte-identical to the control plane''s\nextension proxy contract so the UI zero-prompt SSO bootstrap and single\nretry behave uniformly in both deployment modes.","tree":{"sha":"c0cb7b6cf9ee258ab987920acdb5b7702e0791d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/git/trees/c0cb7b6cf9ee258ab987920acdb5b7702e0791d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/git/commits/5d544a04df436a6c2e7e4f7f7a03a26e328afc7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32569584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joaodss2","id":32569584,"login":"joaodss2","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTY5NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/commit/5d544a04df436a6c2e7e4f7f7a03a26e328afc7c","node_id":"C_kwDOT3kDj9oAKDVkNTQ0YTA0ZGY0MzZhNmMyZTdlNGY3ZjdhMDNhMjZlMzI4YWZjN2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/commit/1aca8f33b8ae0f3207d7c509b04d9e9edc0d8ae5","sha":"1aca8f33b8ae0f3207d7c509b04d9e9edc0d8ae5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/commits/1aca8f33b8ae0f3207d7c509b04d9e9edc0d8ae5"}],"sha":"5d544a04df436a6c2e7e4f7f7a03a26e328afc7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/commits/5d544a04df436a6c2e7e4f7f7a03a26e328afc7c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32569584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joaodss2","id":32569584,"login":"joaodss2","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTY5NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/commits/1aca8f33b8ae0f3207d7c509b04d9e9edc0d8ae5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T12:42:46Z","email":"joaodss@live.com.pt","name":"joaodss2"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T12:42:46Z","email":"joaodss@live.com.pt","name":"joaodss2"},"message":"feat(extplugin): declare oidc-sso-session auth; forward per-user token; typed re-auth\n\nThe plugin now declares oidc-sso-session (audience/provider \"argocd\") via\nthe plugin.v1 AuthMethod contract; credentials never travel in AuthContext.\nHandlers extract the host-injected downstream credential from connection\nmetadata and forward it to the Agent Gateway as hop metadata only. Missing\nsession fails closed with CodeUnauthenticated; agent-reported downstream\n401/403 (reauth_required prefix) maps to the typed re-auth signal\n(details code=reauth_required, provider=argocd) so the UI can drive the\nzero-prompt SSO bootstrap and retry once. e2e harness mirrors the W2/W3\nserver contract: raw user tokens arrive as x-inari-user-credential\nmetadata and only a vault reference reaches the dispatched command.","tree":{"sha":"2d615cc788bb9da8c0656f838a70ba9d41c50d50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/git/trees/2d615cc788bb9da8c0656f838a70ba9d41c50d50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/git/commits/1aca8f33b8ae0f3207d7c509b04d9e9edc0d8ae5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32569584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joaodss2","id":32569584,"login":"joaodss2","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTY5NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/commit/1aca8f33b8ae0f3207d7c509b04d9e9edc0d8ae5","node_id":"C_kwDOT3kDj9oAKDFhY2E4ZjMzYjhhZTBmMzIwN2Q3YzUwOWIwNGQ5ZTllZGMwZDhhZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/commit/1dca4eee9970ab316cac2f6adef2a4daaf6c2fd8","sha":"1dca4eee9970ab316cac2f6adef2a4daaf6c2fd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/commits/1dca4eee9970ab316cac2f6adef2a4daaf6c2fd8"}],"sha":"1aca8f33b8ae0f3207d7c509b04d9e9edc0d8ae5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/commits/1aca8f33b8ae0f3207d7c509b04d9e9edc0d8ae5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32569584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joaodss2","id":32569584,"login":"joaodss2","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTY5NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/commits/1dca4eee9970ab316cac2f6adef2a4daaf6c2fd8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T12:36:05Z","email":"joaodss@live.com.pt","name":"joaodss2"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T12:36:05Z","email":"joaodss@live.com.pt","name":"joaodss2"},"message":"feat(gateway): forward per-user credential as hop metadata; gate legacy token off by default\n\nBump inari-api/inari-plugin-sdk to the W1/W2 builds (plugin.v1 AuthMethod,\nSDK connection metadata). The Agent Gateway client now forwards the\nhost-injected per-user downstream credential as x-inari-user-credential\nmetadata only — never inside the persisted command payload, never logged.\nThe deprecated shared extension gate token (INARI_EXTENSION_GATEWAY_TOKEN)\nis retired from the default path and only sent when explicitly enabled via\nINARI_LEGACY_GATEWAY_TOKEN=true for rolling pre-W2 server upgrades.","tree":{"sha":"5516891e189ffa170f0629225faa3ef87641e7d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/git/trees/5516891e189ffa170f0629225faa3ef87641e7d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/git/commits/1dca4eee9970ab316cac2f6adef2a4daaf6c2fd8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32569584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joaodss2","id":32569584,"login":"joaodss2","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTY5NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/commit/1dca4eee9970ab316cac2f6adef2a4daaf6c2fd8","node_id":"C_kwDOT3kDj9oAKDFkY2E0ZWVlOTk3MGFiMzE2Y2FjMmY2YWRlZjJhNGRhYWY2YzJmZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/commit/f87ec28864dae8478f454c3227c4cf3400fc195d","sha":"f87ec28864dae8478f454c3227c4cf3400fc195d","ur