ase PR only\n  (skip-github-release: true)\n- release.yml: detects release merge on main, tags + creates GitHub\n  Releases, then publish jobs (backend image to GHCR with cosign\n  keyless signing, UI remoteEntry.js to the ui-v* release); publish\n  jobs guarded until the M4-W3 scaffold lands\n- manifest mode with two components (''.'' go backend, ''ui'' node UI\n  remote) chosen over single go release + extra-files updater: the\n  repo ships two independently versioned artifacts (plan §6) and the\n  node type bumps ui/package.json natively\n- AGENTS.md: document release flow and versioning decision","tree":{"sha":"290494fffea8537088e8a6eac76810b8b0d36272","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/git/trees/290494fffea8537088e8a6eac76810b8b0d36272"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7K-Inari/inari-ext-argocd/git/commits/67f7646701d87b7e18ad4c2b1fbb0963041f2d45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32569584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joaodss2","id":32569584,"login":"joaodss2","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTY5NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joaodss2","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/7K-Inari/inari-ext-ar