,"name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"message":"release v1.1.1","tree":{"sha":"160c20e91fc9385269ef544c67108a49aa4e70ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/trees/160c20e91fc9385269ef544c67108a49aa4e70ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/commits/cc865172fb9effe5cb06eada7e4bce778b669bc9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/cc865172fb9effe5cb06eada7e4bce778b669bc9","node_id":"C_kwDOT3r0_9oAKGNjODY1MTcyZmI5ZWZmZTVjYjA2ZWFkYTdlNGJjZTc3OGI2NjliYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/8ca237cfec3b3ff0de48fd290fe15883d0ca91dc","sha":"8ca237cfec3b3ff0de48fd290fe15883d0ca91dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/8ca237cfec3b3ff0de48fd290fe15883d0ca91dc"}],"sha":"cc865172fb9effe5cb06eada7e4bce778b669bc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/cc865172fb9effe5cb06eada7e4bce778b669bc9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/8ca237cfec3b3ff0de48fd290fe15883d0ca91dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T15:56:08Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T15:56:08Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"message":"Stop driving client navigation from the SSR runtime suite\n\nrouter-core 1.171.30 made navigate/commitLocation return early when the router\nresolves isServer, so a navigation in a node-environment test silently becomes a\nno-op. remote-route-runtime.test.ts asserted pathnames after navigate() and went\nred on the canary, while every other suite stayed green - they run under jsdom.\n\nThe suite is server-oriented by design: it asserts SSR markup through\nrenderToStaticMarkup, and one assertion exists specifically because SSR cannot\ndisplay client-only pending UI. Moving it to jsdom would have cost the only SSR\ncoverage of boundary projection, so the three navigate() calls leave instead.\n\nEach removed assertion was matched against an existing jsdom test before it went:\nfacade identity and navigation to the remote index are covered in\nreact-runtime.test.tsx, route tree stability in route-tree-update-adapter.test.ts,\nand scoped navigation under a basepath in scoped-navigation.test.ts. One had no\ncounterpart - a nested facade''s own `/` resolving to the nested mount path - so\nit moves to nested-deep-link.test.tsx, where navigation actually commits. The\nchain fixture now records each level''s scoped router to make that assertable;\nfalsified by removing the scoping, which fails it with ''/'' instead of\n''/remote/level2''.\n\n122 tests pass against the pinned versions and against router-core 1.171.30.","tree":{"sha":"2e935b74651129a94a0e47637b379b23dc1077de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/trees/2e935b74651129a94a0e47637b379b23dc1077de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/commits/8ca237cfec3b3ff0de48fd290fe15883d0ca91dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/8ca237cfec3b3ff0de48fd290fe15883d0ca91dc","node_id":"C_kwDOT3r0_9oAKDhjYTIzN2NmZWMzYjNmZjBkZTQ4ZmQyOTBmZTE1ODgzZDBjYTkxZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/0e0a2235985dc6611651ca3c702809ae7426fad9","sha":"0e0a2235985dc6611651ca3c702809ae7426fad9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/0e0a2235985dc6611651ca3c702809ae7426fad9"}],"sha":"8ca237cfec3b3ff0de48fd290fe15883d0ca91dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/8ca237cfec3b3ff0de48fd290fe15883d0ca91dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/0e0a2235985dc6611651ca3c702809ae7426fad9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T13:04:12Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T13:13:06Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"message":"Fix the typecheck under the pinned router-core, and restructure Quick start\n\nreact-router 1.170.31 resolves ErrorComponentProps from the router-core 1.171.13\nit was built against, where error is unknown, while the catalog pins 1.171.26\nwhere it is generic over Error. Two test error boundaries annotated the prop as\nError and stopped compiling. The pin stays: it exists so a newer framework\nrouter cannot produce two copies of router-core and incompatible AnyRoute types.\nWiden both to unknown and narrow at the use, which is what the type promises.\n\nQuick start led with twenty lines of building a remote tree and two long host\nblocks, all in the code-route form, so a file-routing reader met material that\ndid not apply before reaching their two-line difference. It is now four steps,\nwith the mount declaration — the only place the two forms diverge — shown both\nways, and the complete versions left to the runnable examples.\n\nThose steps are fragments that refer to identifiers declared in a neighbouring\nstep, so check-consumers could no longer treat every tsx fence as a standalone\nfile. It now selects the two tagged `title=remote.tsx` and `title=main.tsx`,\nwhich the Quick start keeps whole in a collapsed block, and names what is\nmissing rather than reporting a count. The compile guarantee is unchanged:\nverified by injecting a type error into the extracted snippet and watching tsc\nreject it, and by dropping a marker and watching the script throw.","tree":{"sha":"a6efe1625fb13b75138d3ed215bd1468371b5dc3","url":"https://ap