ttps://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/f575022fd4bb97df19026cdfbcf12178ab3e4268/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T22:56:23Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T22:56:23Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"message":"publish on a v* tag, matching the ts-remote workflow\n\nReplaces Changesets with the tag-driven release used in ts-remote: push a v*\ntag, the workflow runs the same gate as CI and publishes with --provenance\n--access public, taking NODE_AUTH_TOKEN from the NPM_TOKEN secret.\n\nSince the tag now carries the version, the workflow refuses to publish when it\ndisagrees with the manifest - otherwise a stale bump would publish the previous\nversion or fail on a duplicate.\n\npublishConfig.tag keeps the 0.1.0-alpha.0 prerelease off the latest dist-tag.\n\nNPM_TOKEN is not configured, so no release can run yet.","tree":{"sha":"0184990bf4fb77d04c3187f340bbace7841fa858","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/trees/0184990bf4fb77d04c3187f340bbace7841fa858"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/commits/f575022fd4bb97df19026cdfbcf12178ab3e4268","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/f575022fd4bb97df19026cdfbcf12178ab3e4268","node_id":"C_kwDOT3r0_9oAKGY1NzUwMjJmZDRiYjk3ZGYxOTAyNmNkZmJjZjEyMTc4YWIzZTQyNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/b9a16703630f1475d14955a67a18762126e47295","sha":"b9a16703630f1475d14955a67a18762126e47295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/b9a16703630f1475d14955a67a18762126e47295"}],"sha":"f575022fd4bb97df19026cdfbcf12178ab3e4268","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/f575022fd4bb97df19026cdfbcf12178ab3e4268"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/b9a16703630f1475d14955a67a18762126e47295/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T22:25:17Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T22:25:17Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"message":"port CI, the canary and the docs to pnpm; add a release workflow\n\nThe canary script no longer rewrites nine manifests: every workspace resolves\nthe TanStack pins through the catalog, so it rewrites that one file instead.\nIts single-React guard was counting a flat node_modules; under pnpm it counts\nstore entries, where one real directory per version means one instance.\n\nRelease is manual and dry-run by default. Publishing needs an NPM_TOKEN that\nis not configured yet, so nothing reaches npm until that is deliberate.\n\nDocs follow the new commands (pnpm run, --filter) and the packaging change.\nThe package README''s relative links are now absolute - they would 404 on\nnpmjs.com - and it no longer claims the package is private.\n\ntsBuildInfoFile moved out of dist/: everything under dist/ ships in the\ntarball, and the build cache was landing in it.","tree":{"sha":"10ab106a2a912d6a222132f26dd7e9fb7d2e8f76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/trees/10ab106a2a912d6a222132f26dd7e9fb7d2e8f76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/commits/b9a16703630f1475d14955a67a18762126e47295","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/b9a16703630f1475d14955a67a18762126e47295","node_id":"C_kwDOT3r0_9oAKGI5YTE2NzAzNjMwZjE0NzVkMTQ5NTVhNjdhMTg3NjIxMjZlNDcyOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/b6067b236e6c6a25ff298952af99689d654b9b3d","sha":"b6067b236e6c6a25ff298952af99689d654b9b3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/b6067b236e6c6a25ff298952af99689d654b9b3d"}],"sha":"b9a16703630f1475d14955a67a18762126e47295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/b9a16703630f1475d14955a67a18762126e47295"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/b6067b236e6c6a25ff298952af99689d654b9b3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T22:11:38Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T22:11:38Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"message":"format the repository with prettier\n\nMechanical: semi:false, singleQuote, trailingComma:all applied across 48\nfiles. No behavioral change - 70 tests and typecheck verified before and\nafter.","tree":{"sha":"2448d436cb8925130b4cf11dd28cb2cc4b3ad34c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/trees/2448d436cb8925130b4cf11dd28cb2cc4b3ad34c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/commits/b6067b236e6c6a25ff298952af99689d654b9b3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/b6067b236e6c6a25ff298952af99689d654b9b3d","node_id":"C_kwDOT3r0_9oAKGI2MDY3YjIzNmU2YzZhMjVmZjI5ODk1MmFmOTk2ODlkNjU0YjliM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/cc3059c85c64d18671d16ae4949213e165df08e3","sha":"cc3059c85c64d18671d16ae4949213e165df08e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/cc3059c85c64d18671d16ae4949213e165df08e3"}],"sha":"b6067b236e6c6a25ff298952af99689d654b9b3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/b6067b236e6c6a25ff298952af99689d654b9b3d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/cc3059c85c64d18671d16ae4949213e165df08e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T22:09:21Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T22:09:21Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"message":"switch to pnpm, build with rslib, add eslint/prettier/changesets\n\nReplaces npm workspaces with pnpm and a version catalog, so React and the\nTanStack pins are declared once instead of in nine manifests. That drift is\nwhat broke the canary before: a floating root React gave the adapter its own\nnested copy and hooks failed with ''Invalid hook call''.\n\nThe adapter now builds with rslib instead of tsc. bundle:false keeps dist/\nshaped like src/, so the exports map, sideEffects:false and consumer\ntree-shaking are unchanged, but relative imports no longer depend on hand-\nwritten .js extensions surviving review.\n\nESLint and Prettier mirror the TanStack Router repo''s rules (unused-imports\nreplacing the base rule, semi:false/singleQuote/trailingComma:all). Changesets\nis configured for versioning and publish; the package drops private:true and\ngains repository/license/keywords, but nothing is published yet.\n\nprefer-const is off for tests: mount fixtures are cyclic and need\n''let x!: AnyRoute'' declared before the component that closes over it.","tree":{"sha":"1ee3108c62dc2fc9a1db6804a0dc232ac0bcdd5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/trees/1ee3108c62dc2fc9a1db6804a0dc232ac0bcdd5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/commits/cc3059c85c64d18671d16ae4949213e165df08e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/cc3059c85c64d18671d16ae4949213e165df08e3","node_id":"C_kwDOT3r0_9oAKGNjMzA1OWM4NWM2NGQxODY3MWQxNmFlNDk0OTIxM2UxNjVkZjA4ZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/f53149cf897b3a733258a5d1a32311eea8f31459","sha":"f53149cf897b3a733258a5d1a32311eea8f31459","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/f53149cf897b3a733258a5d1a32311eea8f31459"}],"sha":"cc3059c85c64d18671d16ae4949213e165df08e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/cc3059c85c64d18671d16ae4949213e165df08e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/f53149cf897b3a733258a5d1a32311eea8f31459/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T21:03:39Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T21:03:39Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"message":"document bridge id namespacing and enable preload in the examples\n\nTwo follow-ups left over from the b5484b4 review.\n\nThe `bridgeRouteId` constant is shared by every mount and looked like a\ncollision waiting to happen. It is not: TanStack resolves a child `id`\nagainst the parent''s fullPath, so two mounts produce\n`/orders/__remote-root-bridge` and `/invoices/__remote-root-bridge`, and\nboth index cleanly. Verified with a throwaway probe that builds two\nmounts and reads `router.routesById`. Comment records why no suffix is\nneeded, so the next reader does not \"fix\" it.\n\nThe examples pinned `defaultPreload: false` from before imperative\n`preloadRoute`/`matchRoute` were scoped. Probed both modes against the\nreal runtime: hovering an unattached mount preloads nothing either way\n(the mount is a static route with no loader), the transport still runs\nexactly once on navigation, and a preload into an attached remote\nreaches the remote loader identically. Switched all four hosts to\n''intent''.\n\nNo regression test accompanies the preload change. I wrote one, then\ndeleted it: it survived both breaking `defaultPreload` and unscoping\n`preloadRoute`, so it asserted nothing the suite did not already cover.\nThe existing \"scopes imperative preloadRoute and matchRoute\" test is\nwhat actually guards this — unscoping `preloadRoute` fails it.\n\n`npm run check` green: 70 tests, all example builds.","tree":{"sha":"1b28a82d960c4068bedf0f2957039ea0cd9b3b5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/trees/1b28a82d960c4068bedf0f2957039ea0cd9b3b5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/commits/f53149cf897b3a733258a5d1a32311eea8f31459","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/f53149cf897b3a733258a5d1a32311eea8f31459","node_id":"C_kwDOT3r0_9oAKGY1MzE0OWNmODk3YjNhNzMzMjU4YTVkMWEzMjMxMWVlYThmMzE0NTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/79c87f677f4d2ad9336f6590155008ee6004c91c","sha":"79c87f677f4d2ad9336f6590155008ee6004c91c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/79c87f677f4d2ad9336f6590155008ee6004c91c"}],"sha":"f53149cf897b3a733258a5d1a32311eea8f31459","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/f53149cf897b3a733258a5d1a32311eea8f31459"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/79c87f677f4d2ad9336f6590155008ee6004c91c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:17:36Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:17:36Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"message":"pin React at the root so the canary resolves one instance\n\nThe canary installs without the lockfile, since no lockfile entry exists\nfor the canary versions. The root manifest declared no React at all, so\nthe install floated it in transitively from the router''s open range and\nlanded 19.2.8 in the root while every workspace pins 19.2.0. npm then\ngave the adapter its own nested copy, and two React instances in one\nprocess broke the hook dispatcher: ~24 tests across four files failed\nwith `Invalid hook call`, which reads like an upstream break rather than\na resolution problem.\n\nDeclare react/react-dom at the root and add matching overrides so no\nfuture transitive consumer can split them again. Also declare\n@tanstack/router-generator, which tests/unit/virtual-file-routes.test.ts\nimports directly but which only reached the tree by being hoisted out of\nrouter-plugin -- it resolves today by luck, not by contract, and its\nabsence is exactly the TS2307 the canary reported.\n\nVerified on a clean clone with the pins repointed at latest\n(react-router 1.170.29, router-plugin 1.168.32): one React copy,\n`npm run check` green at 70 tests. Falsified both halves -- dropping the\nroot React pins restores 9 duplicate copies and the same hook failures,\nand removing the generator reproduces the TS2307 verbatim.\n\nThe workflow gains a guard that asserts a single React instance right\nafter install, so this fails on its real cause instead of surfacing as\nunrelated test noise.","tree":{"sha":"7ca5fb5d2498404627fa114040fdd3469d234e83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/trees/7ca5fb5d2498404627fa114040fdd3469d234e83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/commits/79c87f677f4d2ad9336f6590155008ee6004c91c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/79c87f677f4d2ad9336f6590155008ee6004c91c","node_id":"C_kwDOT3r0_9oAKDc5Yzg3ZjY3N2Y0ZDJhZDkzMzZmNjU5MDE1NTAwOGVlNjAwNGM5MWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/87597f5567e94d17c40fab179cff3803c003c89e","sha":"87597f5567e94d17c40fab179cff3803c003c89e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/87597f5567e94d17c40fab179cff3803c003c89e"}],"sha":"79c87f677f4d2ad9336f6590155008ee6004c91c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/79c87f677f4d2ad9336f6590155008ee6004c91c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/87597f5567e94d17c40fab179cff3803c003c89e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:02:08Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:02:08Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"message":"correct three stale claims in the architecture doc\n\nFound by validating every .md file against the repository: relative links, npm\nscript names, quoted paths, test counts, pinned versions and example ports all\ncheck out; these three did not.\n\n- `createRemoteRoute` was described as having \"the same signature as TanStack\n  createRoute\". It has two overloads since the wrapped file-route form landed,\n  and the decorator one takes a route instance, not options — so the sentence\n  described only half the API and contradicted the documented mount form.\n- \"The two runnable example families\" predates the file-routing examples; there\n  are three.\n- \"supported alpha surface\" was the only \"alpha\" left in the repository, against\n  `0.x` plus \"production-ready within its documented scope\" everywhere else.","tree":{"sha":"616f6e4328353253a797dddc0c38609f867b535c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/trees/616f6e4328353253a797dddc0c38609f867b535c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/commits/87597f5567e94d17c40fab179cff3803c003c89e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/87597f5567e94d17c40fab179cff3803c003c89e","node_id":"C_kwDOT3r0_9oAKDg3NTk3ZjU1NjdlOTRkMTdjNDBmYWIxNzljZmYzODAzYzAwM2M4OWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/309a698df3435613159567bf06de909d2cc894bb","sha":"309a698df3435613159567bf06de909d2cc894bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/309a698df3435613159567bf06de909d2cc894bb"}],"sha":"87597f5567e94d17c40fab179cff3803c003c89e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/87597f5567e94d17c40fab179cff3803c003c89e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/309a698df3435613159567bf06de909d2cc894bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T20:55:42Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T20:55:42Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"message":"cover virtual file routes with an example and generator tests\n\nThe wrapped mount form was only ever exercised against physical routing, where\nthe generator derives each URL from a filename. Virtual routing assigns paths in\na config file instead, so filename-based inference is absent entirely — a\nseparate compatibility claim that had no coverage.\n\ntests/unit/virtual-file-routes.test.ts runs the real @tanstack/router-generator\nover scratch route directories rather than imitating it, since what is under\ntest is whether the generator accepts the form. It asserts that a wrapped mount\nwhose URL comes from routes.ts lands in the generated tree, that the same mount\ncomposes below a pathless layout(...), that the identical form still works with\nno virtual config, and that the source file is left byte-identical.\n\nTwo findings worth having in the repository:\n\n- Wrapping opts a file out of the generator''s path auto-correction. In physical\n  routing an unwrapped `createFileRoute(''/WRONG'')` is rewritten to ''/catalog'';\n  wrapped, it is left as ''/WRONG''. The rewrite only fires when the call is the\n  direct export initializer. This is a real trade-off of the documented form,\n  now asserted rather than discovered in the field.\n- Under a layout the generated route *id* carries the layout segment\n  (''/_shell/catalog'') while path and fullPath stay ''/catalog''. createFileRoute\n  is keyed by that id, so a mount moved under a layout must declare the longer\n  string — a type error, not a silent mismatch, but easy to trip over. Hit while\n  building the example; asserted so the example cannot drift from it.\n\nexamples/file-routing/virtual is the runnable counterpart, served at\n/file-routing-virtual on port 3211. Its mount file is deliberately named\ncatalog-mount.tsx and sits below a pathless shell.tsx layout, so nothing about\nits URL is inferable from the filesystem. Verified in a browser on the built\npreview: /file-routing-virtual/catalog/SKU-42?tab=history renders through the\nlayout, attaches the ESM remote, normalizes the param and validates the search.\n\nThe file-routing README now documents both modes side by side, including both\nfindings above. 70 tests.","tree":{"sha":"ecfed3da17b1b815d9ec1cdfb026d4461eb73fb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/trees/ecfed3da17b1b815d9ec1cdfb026d4461eb73fb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/commits/309a698df3435613159567bf06de909d2cc894bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/309a698df3435613159567bf06de909d2cc894bb","node_id":"C_kwDOT3r0_9oAKDMwOWE2OThkZjM0MzU2MTMxNTk1NjdiZjA2ZGU5MDlkMmNjODk0YmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/07ffe3a160ab656a657ec3c793fe3cb31511d6c2","sha":"07ffe3a160ab656a657ec3c793fe3cb31511d6c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/07ffe3a160ab656a657ec3c793fe3cb31511d6c2"}],"sha":"309a698df3435613159567bf06de909d2cc894bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/309a698df3435613159567bf06de909d2cc894bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/07ffe3a160ab656a657ec3c793fe3cb31511d6c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T20:34:38Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T20:34:38Z","email":"themontanyes@gmail.com","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"message":"harden route-tree attachment and simplify the file-route path\n\nFollow-up work on the initial proposal, in four parts.\n\nCorrectness\n-----------\nScope the imperative router methods. `createScopedRouter` now wraps\n`preloadRoute` and `matchRoute` in addition to `navigate`/`buildLocation`.\n`<Link preload>` was already safe — it passes a prebuilt `_builtLocation` — but\nan imperative `preloadRoute({ to: ''/slow'' })` from a remote resolved against the\nhost tree and silently preloaded a same-named host route. `matchRoute` returned\nfalse for the same reason.\n\nRelease remote-tree ownership on post-graft failure. A `router.update()` throw\nafter a successful graft left the mount with `[null]` children and skipped the\nownership release, so a server memoizing a remote tree got one poisoned failure\nthat disabled that remote until process restart. `graftRemoteRouteTree` now\nreturns `{ undo }`; `prepare()` undoes the graft and always releases the claim.\n`loadPrepared()` deliberately keeps it — there the router already indexes those\nroutes, so freeing the tree would corrupt the live one.\n\nPerformance\n-----------\nBatch concurrent attachments. `router.update()` rebuilds the whole route index,\nso N mounts attaching concurrently cost N reindexes and N loads. `SerialTaskQueue`\nbecomes `BatchingTaskQueue`: remote trees load in parallel, grafts apply in\norder, and the batch pays one `update()` + one `load()`. Measured on 3 mounts:\n3 + 3 becomes 1 + 1. Per-member failure is preserved; the shared steps are the\nexception and are documented as such. `attach()` and `prepare()` use separate\nqueues so an SSR preparation is never pulled into a client load.\n\nAPI and docs corrections\n------------------------\nDrop the advice to wire the mount''s `notFoundComponent`. A fuzzy 404 below an\nunattached mount is an ordinary match on the mount, not a `notFound()` thrown\ninto it, so `component` alone starts the attach. Verified on the pinned 1.170.18\nand on latest 1.170.28: removing every `notFoundComponent` mount occurrence\nleaves the suite green, and an A/B probe matched on all five paths (deep link,\nloading window, exact match, `notFoundMode: ''root''`, SSR `prepare()`). The\noption keeps its real job — catching a `notFound()` thrown by the mount''s own\n`beforeLoad`/`loader` — and the docs now say that instead.\n\nRemove the Rspack companion plugin. It existed to satisfy the TanStack\ngenerator''s strict parser by appending `createRemoteRoute(Route)` to the\ncompiled module. Unnecessary: the generator accepts a wrapped declaration as-is.\n\n  export const Route = createRemoteRoute(\n    createFileRoute(''/catalog'')({ component: CatalogMount }),\n  )\n\nVerified against router-generator 1.167.17 — it emits `/catalog` and leaves the\nsource byte-identical, with `autoCodeSplitting` on. Wrapping is also stricter\nthan the plugin: a mount that never reaches `createRemoteRoute` still serves\n`/catalog` while a deep link to `/catalog/SKU-42` silently fails, and as the\nexported initializer the call cannot be omitted. The two file-routing examples\ncollapse into one (`examples/file-routing/app`).\n\nGive `createRemoteRoute` real overloads instead of `(input: unknown)` cast to an\nintersection type. The generic list mirrors `createRoute` deliberately:\ninference is positional, and `Parameters<typeof createRoute>` collapses\n`fullPath`, params, search and loader data to `unknown`.\n\nTesting and CI\n--------------\nAdd a weekly canary job against `@tanstack/react-router@latest` with a pin\nscript that rewrites the exact pins across the workspace manifests, leaving the\nopen peer range alone. It is informational, not a required check.\n\nMake the test probes version-neutral: newer router-core removed\n`stores.cachedMatches`, `clearExpiredCache()`, `hasNotFoundMatch()`,\n`state.statusCode` and `match.globalNotFound`. Adapter sources use none of them;\nthe breakage was confined to tests, which now go through\n`tests/support/router-compat.ts`. Loader caching is asserted by counting loader\nruns, and the cache tests declare `@vitest-environment jsdom` — router-core\npicks its server build under `node`, which has no cross-navigation match cache.\n\n65 tests; `npm run check` type-checks the workspaces, runs the suite and builds\nevery example.","tree":{"sha":"39cec9493f1bd3f113b4b6de4ff96e3e484762e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/trees/39cec9493f1bd3f113b4b6de4ff96e3e484762e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/git/commits/07ffe3a160ab656a657ec3c793fe3cb31511d6c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/07ffe3a160ab656a657ec3c793fe3cb31511d6c2","node_id":"C_kwDOT3r0_9oAKDA3ZmZlM2ExNjBhYjY1NmE2NTdlYzNjNzkzZmUzY2IzMTUxMWQ2YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commit/772a92f9f76020078088af8a15195d01990d521b","sha":"772a92f9f76020078088af8a15195d01990d521b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/tanstack-router-remote/commits/772a92f9f76020078088af8a15195d01990d521b"}],"sh